export const swissNetSalaryTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"es":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de escenarios de salario neto suizo","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Calculadora de salarios suiza para 2026: escenario de salario bruto a neto","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Estime las deducciones de nómina de los empleados suizos para 2026. Consulte AHV/IV/EO federal y las contribuciones de desempleo, luego ingrese los montos reales de su pensión, seguro contra accidentes e impuestos de origen para un escenario útil de 12 o 13 pagos.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Construya un escenario práctico de nómina suizo para 2026. La calculadora calcula las contribuciones de los empleados a nivel nacional y resta la pensión, el seguro contra accidentes, las retenciones fiscales y otras deducciones que usted ingresa de sus propios documentos de nómina.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Las tasas federales son las mismas en todos los cantones, pero su plan de pensiones, su prima por accidentes no laborales y su impuesto fuente dependen de su plan, su empleador y su caso personal. Ingrese esos montos anuales de un recibo de sueldo o de una estimación actual del empleador. El cantón y la situación fiscal se muestran a modo de contexto; Esta herramienta no reconstruye las tablas cantonales de impuestos sobre la fuente ni el impuesto sobre la renta anual.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Para 8.000 CHF por pago de salario y 13 pagos, el importe bruto anual es de 104.000 CHF. Las contribuciones de los empleados federales se estiman a partir del salario anual; introduzca el plan anual y las deducciones fiscales para estimar el escenario neto.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Bruto por un pago de salario regular (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Pagos de salario por año","12 payments":"12 pagos","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pagos, incluido el 13º salario","Age in years":"Edad en años","Contribution situation":"Situación de cotización","Employee contributions apply":"Aplican contribuciones de empleados","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Aún no sujeto a contribuciones de los empleados","Working after AHV reference age":"Trabajando después de la edad de referencia AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Aplicar el subsidio AHV mensual de CHF 1.400","Canton for your payroll context":"Cantón para su contexto de nómina","Tax-at-source situation":"Situación del impuesto en la fuente","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"No se grava en la fuente/usa el impuesto anual por separado","Taxed at source":"Gravado en origen","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Deducciones anuales de sus documentos de nómina (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Deducción de pensión de empleados (anual)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Seguro de accidentes no laborales (anual)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Impuesto en fuente retenido (anual)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Otras deducciones de empleados (anual)","Estimate net salary":"Salario neto estimado","Reset example":"Ejemplo de reinicio","2026 salary scenario":"Escenario salarial 2026","Gross salary per year":"Salario bruto por año","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Empleado AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Seguro de desempleo para empleados","Pension deduction entered":"Deducción de pensión ingresada","Accident insurance entered":"Seguro de accidentes ingresado","Source tax entered":"Impuesto de fuente ingresado","Other deductions entered":"Otras deducciones ingresadas","Total deductions shown":"Se muestran las deducciones totales","Estimated net per year":"Neto estimado por año","Average net per salary payment":"Promedio neto por pago de salario","Average net per month":"Promedio neto por mes","AHV allowance applied":"Asignación AHV aplicada","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Ingrese su salario bruto y, si están disponibles, las deducciones anuales reales de nómina.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Escenario calculado en su navegador.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Consulta el salario, la edad y los importes de las deducciones. Las deducciones no pueden exceder el salario bruto.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Elija la situación de cotización que coincida con su nómina actual. La edad por sí sola no determina todos los casos especiales.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Cantón es solo contexto aquí. No cambia las tasas de contribución federal ni calcula el impuesto fuente.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Utilice el monto anual mostrado por su empleador o recibo de nómina. Un cantón y una lengua no son suficientes para calcular una tarifa individual.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Los montos de pensión y accidentes varían según el plan y el empleador. Si no los conoces déjalos en cero; el resultado será una estimación parcial.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"No se incluye el impuesto sobre la renta anual ordinario. Los empleados suizos que no pagan impuestos en origen generalmente los liquidan mediante una declaración de impuestos anual, no mediante una retención estándar en la nómina.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Estimación de nómina federal con fecha de 2026. Asume el trabajo de un empleado y un año completo. Los trabajos de parte del año, los empleadores múltiples, las bonificaciones, los casos transfronterizos, el estado de cotización especial y el redondeo individual pueden cambiar la nómina. Utilice la declaración de su empleador para conocer el monto vinculante.","Official 2026 references:":"Referencias oficiales de 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Tasas de contribución AHV/IV/EO y ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Umbrales de pensión ocupacional para 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"¿Es ésta una cotización exacta del salario neto suizo?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"No. Calcula las contribuciones legales de los empleados a nivel nacional y resta los montos anuales específicos de la nómina que ingresa. El resultado es tan completo como esas entradas.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"¿Por qué tengo que introducir deducciones por pensiones y accidentes?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Las aportaciones a pensiones profesionales dependen del fondo y plan de pensiones. Las primas por accidentes no laborales dependen del riesgo del asegurador, de la industria y del empleador. No existe una cantidad única para el empleado que pueda deducirse únicamente del salario bruto.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"¿Puede calcular el impuesto fuente de mi cantón?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"No. Las tarifas de impuestos en origen utilizan datos personales y de nómina y los archivos publicados están destinados a empleadores y proveedores de software de nómina. Ingrese el monto de su recibo de sueldo actual o estimación del empleador.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"¿Cómo funciona aquí el salario 13?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Ingrese el monto bruto de un pago de salario regular y elija 13 pagos. La calculadora anualiza primero el monto bruto, aplica límites de contribución anual y divide la estimación neta resultante entre los 13 pagos.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"¿El cantón cambia AVS/AI/APG o tasas de desempleo?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Las tarifas para empleados federales que se utilizan aquí son a nivel nacional. El impuesto sobre la fuente específico del cantón y otras deducciones del plan o del empleador no se calculan automáticamente.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Las contribuciones federales del empleador se muestran por separado (no se deducen de su neto)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Empleador AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Seguro de desempleo empresarial","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Tasas legales federales únicamente. No se incluyen la pensión del empleador, el seguro de accidentes, el fondo de prestaciones familiares ni las cotizaciones cantonales específicas."},"fr":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Calculateur de scénario de salaire net suisse","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Calculateur de salaire suisse 2026 — Scénario de salaire brut à net","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Estimez les retenues sur les salaires des salariés suisses pour 2026. Consultez les cotisations fédérales AVS/AI/EO et chômage, puis saisissez les montants réels de votre pension, de votre assurance-accidents et de votre impôt à la source pour un scénario utile de 12 ou 13 salaires.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Construisez un scénario pratique de fiche de paie suisse 2026. Le calculateur estime les cotisations des employés à l'échelle nationale et soustrait la pension, l'assurance accident, la retenue à la source et les autres déductions que vous saisissez de vos propres documents de paie.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Les taux fédéraux sont les mêmes d'un canton à l'autre, mais votre caisse de prévoyance, votre prime d'accident non professionnel et votre impôt à la source dépendent de votre caisse, de votre employeur et de votre cas personnel. Saisissez ces montants annuels à partir d’une fiche de paie ou d’une estimation actuelle de l’employeur. Le canton et le statut fiscal sont indiqués à titre de contexte ; cet outil ne reconstitue pas les tables cantonales d'impôt à la source ni l'impôt sur le revenu annuel.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Pour 8 000 CHF par versement de salaire et 13 versements, le brut annuel est de 104 000 CHF. Les cotisations des employés fédéraux sont estimées à partir du salaire annuel ; saisissez le plan annuel et les déductions fiscales pour estimer le scénario net.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brut pour un paiement de salaire régulier (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Paiements de salaire par an","12 payments":"12 paiements","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 versements, dont le 13ème salaire","Age in years":"Âge en années","Contribution situation":"Situation des cotisations","Employee contributions apply":"Les cotisations des employés s'appliquent","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Pas encore soumis aux cotisations salariales","Working after AHV reference age":"Travailler après l'âge de référence AVS","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Appliquer l'allocation AVS mensuelle de 1400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton pour votre contexte de paie","Tax-at-source situation":"Situation de l'impôt à la source","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Non imposé à la source / utiliser la taxe annuelle séparément","Taxed at source":"Imposé à la source","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Retenues annuelles sur vos documents de paie (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Déduction pour pension des employés (annuelle)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Assurance accidents non professionnels (annuelle)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Impôt à la source retenu (annuel)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Autres retenues des employés (annuelle)","Estimate net salary":"Estimation du salaire net","Reset example":"Exemple de réinitialisation","2026 salary scenario":"Scénario salarial 2026","Gross salary per year":"Salaire brut par an","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Salarié AVS/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Assurance chômage des salariés","Pension deduction entered":"Déduction de pension saisie","Accident insurance entered":"Assurance accidents saisie","Source tax entered":"Taxe à la source saisie","Other deductions entered":"Autres déductions saisies","Total deductions shown":"Total des déductions indiqué","Estimated net per year":"Net estimé par an","Average net per salary payment":"Moyenne nette par paiement de salaire","Average net per month":"Moyenne nette par mois","AHV allowance applied":"Allocation AVS appliquée","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Entrez votre salaire brut et, si disponible, les retenues salariales annuelles réelles.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scénario calculé dans votre navigateur.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Vérifiez le salaire, l'âge et les montants des retenues. Les retenues ne peuvent excéder le salaire brut.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Choisissez la situation de cotisation qui correspond à votre paie actuelle. L'âge à lui seul ne détermine pas chaque cas particulier.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton est un contexte uniquement ici. Cela ne modifie pas les taux de cotisation fédéraux ni ne calcule l’impôt à la source.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Utilisez le montant annuel indiqué par votre employeur ou votre fiche de paie. Un canton et une langue ne suffisent pas pour calculer un tarif individuel.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Les montants des pensions et des accidents varient selon le régime et l'employeur. Si vous ne les connaissez pas, laissez-les à zéro ; le résultat sera une estimation partielle.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"L'impôt sur le revenu annuel ordinaire n'est pas inclus. Les salariés suisses qui ne sont pas imposés à la source le règlent généralement au moyen d'une déclaration d'impôt annuelle et non d'une retenue à la source standard sur une fiche de salaire.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Estimation de la masse salariale fédérale datée de 2026. Elle suppose un emploi d'employé et une année complète. Les emplois sur une partie de l'année, les employeurs multiples, les primes, les cas transfrontaliers, le statut de cotisation spécial et les arrondis individuels peuvent modifier la masse salariale. Utilisez votre déclaration d'employeur pour le montant contraignant.","Official 2026 references:":"Références officielles 2026 :","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Taux de cotisation AVS/AI/EO et ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Seuils de retraite professionnelle 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Est-ce un devis exact pour le salaire net suisse ?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Non. Il estime les cotisations légales des employés à l’échelle nationale et soustrait les montants annuels spécifiques à la paie que vous saisissez. Le résultat est aussi complet que ces entrées.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Pourquoi dois-je saisir les déductions pour pension et accident ?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Les cotisations de retraite professionnelle dépendent du fonds de pension et du plan. Les primes d’accidents non professionnels dépendent du risque de l’assureur, du secteur et de l’employeur. Il n’existe pas de montant unique pour l’employé qui puisse être déduit du seul salaire brut.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Peut-il calculer l'impôt à la source de mon canton ?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Non. Les tarifs d'impôt à la source utilisent des informations personnelles et salariales et les fichiers publiés sont destinés aux employeurs et aux fournisseurs de logiciels de paie. Saisissez le montant de votre fiche de paie actuelle ou de l'estimation de votre employeur.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Comment fonctionne le 13ème salaire ici ?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Entrez le montant brut d'un paiement de salaire régulier et choisissez 13 paiements. Le calculateur annualise d'abord le montant brut, applique les limites de cotisation annuelles et divise l'estimation nette résultante entre les 13 paiements.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Le canton modifie-t-il l'AVS/AI/APG ou le taux de chômage ?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Les tarifs des employés fédéraux utilisés ici s'appliquent à l'ensemble du pays. L'impôt à la source cantonal et les autres retenues d'employeur ou de régime ne sont pas calculés automatiquement.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Cotisations fédérales de l'employeur indiquées séparément (non déduites de votre net)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Employeur AVS/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Assurance chômage employeur","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Tarifs légaux fédéraux uniquement. Ne sont pas incluses la rente de l'employeur, l'assurance-accidents, la caisse d'allocations familiales et les cotisations cantonales."},"pt":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de cenário de salário líquido suíço","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Calculadora de salário suíço 2026 - Cenário de pagamento bruto para líquido","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Estimar as deduções na folha de pagamento dos funcionários suíços para 2026. Consulte AHV/IV/EO federal e contribuições de desemprego e, em seguida, insira seus valores reais de pensão, seguro contra acidentes e imposto de origem para um cenário útil de 12 ou 13 pagamentos.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Construa um cenário prático de contracheque suíço de 2026. A calculadora estima as contribuições dos funcionários em todo o país e subtrai a pensão, o seguro contra acidentes, o imposto retido na fonte e outras deduções inseridas de seus próprios documentos de folha de pagamento.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"As taxas federais são as mesmas em todos os cantões, mas seu plano de pensão, prêmio de acidente não ocupacional e imposto de origem dependem do seu plano, empregador e caso pessoal. Insira esses valores anuais a partir de um contracheque ou estimativa atual do empregador. O cantão e a situação fiscal são mostrados para fins de contexto; esta ferramenta não reconstrói tabelas cantonais de imposto de origem ou imposto de renda anual.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Para CHF 8.000 por pagamento de salário e 13 pagamentos, o valor bruto anual é de CHF 104.000. As contribuições dos funcionários federais são estimadas a partir do salário anual; insira o plano anual e as deduções fiscais para estimar o cenário líquido.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Bruto para um pagamento de salário regular (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Pagamentos de salário por ano","12 payments":"12 pagamentos","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pagamentos, incluindo 13º salário","Age in years":"Idade em anos","Contribution situation":"Situação de contribuição","Employee contributions apply":"Aplicam-se contribuições de funcionários","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Ainda não sujeito a contribuições de funcionários","Working after AHV reference age":"Trabalhar após a idade de referência do AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Aplicar o subsídio mensal AHV de CHF 1.400","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton para seu contexto de folha de pagamento","Tax-at-source situation":"Situação do imposto na fonte","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Não tributado na fonte/utilizar imposto anual separadamente","Taxed at source":"Tributado na fonte","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Deduções anuais de seus documentos de folha de pagamento (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Dedução de pensão de funcionário (anual)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Seguro de acidentes não ocupacionais (anual)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Imposto de origem retido (anual)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Outras deduções de funcionários (anual)","Estimate net salary":"Estimativa de salário líquido","Reset example":"Exemplo de redefinição\nCenário salarial","2026 salary scenario":"2026","Gross salary per year":"Salário bruto por ano","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Funcionário AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Seguro-desemprego para funcionários","Pension deduction entered":"Dedução de pensão inserida","Accident insurance entered":"Seguro de acidentes inserido","Source tax entered":"Imposto de origem inserido","Other deductions entered":"Outras deduções inseridas","Total deductions shown":"Total de deduções mostradas","Estimated net per year":"Líquido estimado por ano","Average net per salary payment":"Média líquida por pagamento de salário","Average net per month":"Média líquida por mês","AHV allowance applied":"Subsídio de AHV aplicado","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Insira seu salário bruto e, se disponível, as deduções anuais reais na folha de pagamento.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Cenário calculado em seu navegador.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Verifique o salário, a idade e os valores dos descontos. As deduções não podem exceder o salário bruto.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Escolha a situação contributiva que corresponde à sua folha de pagamento atual. A idade por si só não determina todos os casos especiais.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Cantão é contexto apenas aqui. Não altera as alíquotas de contribuição federal nem calcula o imposto de origem.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Use o valor anual mostrado pelo seu empregador ou contracheque. Um cantão e um idioma não são suficientes para calcular uma tarifa individual.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Os valores das pensões e acidentes variam de acordo com o plano e o empregador. Se você não os conhece, deixe-os em zero; o resultado será uma estimativa parcial.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Imposto de renda anual ordinário não incluído. Os funcionários suíços que não são tributados na fonte geralmente liquidam o imposto por meio de uma declaração anual de imposto de renda, e não de uma retenção padrão de recibo de pagamento.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Estimativa da folha de pagamento federal datada de 2026. Ela pressupõe um emprego de funcionário e um ano inteiro. Empregos de meio período, múltiplos empregadores, bônus, casos transfronteiriços, status de contribuição especial e arredondamentos individuais podem alterar a folha de pagamento. Use a declaração do seu empregador para obter o valor vinculativo.","Official 2026 references:":"Referências oficiais de 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Taxas de contribuição AHV/IV/EO e ALV\nLimites de pensão ocupacional","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Esta é uma cotação exata para pagamento em casa na Suíça?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Não. Ele estima as contribuições legais dos funcionários em todo o país e subtrai os valores anuais específicos da folha de pagamento inseridos. O resultado é tão completo quanto essas entradas.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Por que preciso inserir deduções de pensões e acidentes?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"As contribuições para pensões profissionais dependem do fundo e plano de pensões. Os prêmios de acidentes não ocupacionais dependem do risco da seguradora, da indústria e do empregador. Não existe um valor único de funcionário que possa ser inferido apenas do salário bruto.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"É possível calcular o imposto de origem do meu cantão?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Não. As tarifas de imposto sobre a fonte utilizam detalhes pessoais e de folha de pagamento e os arquivos publicados destinam-se a empregadores e fornecedores de software de folha de pagamento. Insira o valor do seu contracheque atual ou estimativa do empregador.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Como funciona o 13º salário aqui?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Insira o valor bruto de um pagamento regular de salário e escolha 13 pagamentos. A calculadora anualiza primeiro o valor bruto, aplica limites de contribuição anual e divide a estimativa líquida resultante pelos 13 pagamentos.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"O cantão altera AVS/AI/APG ou taxas de desemprego?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"As taxas de funcionários federais usadas aqui são nacionais. O imposto fonte específico do cantão e outras deduções do empregador ou do plano não são calculados automaticamente.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Contribuições federais do empregador mostradas separadamente (não deduzidas do seu valor líquido)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Empregador AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Seguro-desemprego do empregador","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Somente taxas legais federais. A pensão do empregador, o seguro contra acidentes, o fundo de abono de família e as contribuições específicas do cantão não estão incluídos."},"de":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Schweizer Nettolohn-Szenario-Rechner","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Schweizer Gehaltsrechner 2026 – Brutto-Netto-Lohnszenario\nUSN001","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Schätzen Sie die Lohnabzüge von Schweizer Arbeitnehmern für das Jahr 2026. Sehen Sie sich die AHV/IV/EO- und Arbeitslosenbeiträge des Bundes an und geben Sie dann Ihre tatsächlichen Renten-, Unfallversicherungs- und Quellensteuerbeträge ein, um ein nützliches 12- oder 13-Lohn-Szenario zu erhalten.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Erstellen Sie ein praktisches Schweizer Gehaltsabrechnungsszenario für 2026. Der Rechner schätzt die bundesweiten Arbeitnehmerbeiträge und zieht die von Ihnen erfassten Renten-, Unfallversicherungs-, Quellensteuer- und sonstigen Abzüge von Ihren eigenen Lohnunterlagen ab.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Die Bundessätze sind in allen Kantonen gleich, Ihr Vorsorgeplan, Ihre Nichtberufsunfallprämie und Ihre Quellensteuer hängen jedoch von Ihrem Plan, Ihrem Arbeitgeber und Ihrem persönlichen Fall ab. Geben Sie diese Jahresbeträge aus einer Gehaltsabrechnung oder einer Schätzung des aktuellen Arbeitgebers ein. Als Kontext werden Kanton und Steuerstatus angezeigt; Dieses Tool rekonstruiert keine kantonalen Quellensteuertabellen oder die jährliche Einkommenssteuer.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Bei CHF 8'000 pro Lohnzahlung und 13 Zahlungen beträgt der Jahresbrutto CHF 104'000. Die Beiträge der Bundesangestellten werden anhand des Jahresgehalts geschätzt; Geben Sie den Jahresplan und die Steuerabzüge ein, um das Nettoszenario abzuschätzen.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brutto für eine reguläre Lohnzahlung (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Gehaltszahlungen pro Jahr","12 payments":"12 Zahlungen","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 Zahlungen, einschließlich 13. Gehalt","Age in years":"Alter in Jahren","Contribution situation":"Beitragssituation","Employee contributions apply":"Es fallen Arbeitnehmerbeiträge an","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Unterliegt noch nicht den Arbeitnehmerbeiträgen","Working after AHV reference age":"Erwerbstätig nach dem AHV-Referenzalter","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Wenden Sie den monatlichen AHV-Zuschuss von CHF 1'400 an","Canton for your payroll context":"Kanton für Ihren Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnungskontext","Tax-at-source situation":"Quellensteuersituation","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Keine Quellensteuer / Jahressteuer separat verwenden","Taxed at source":"An der Quelle besteuert","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Jährliche Abzüge von Ihren Lohnunterlagen (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Abzug von der Arbeitnehmerrente (jährlich)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Nichtberufsunfallversicherung (jährlich)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Quellensteuer einbehalten (jährlich)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Sonstige Arbeitnehmerabzüge (jährlich)","Estimate net salary":"Schätzung des Nettogehalts","Reset example":"Beispiel zum Zurücksetzen","2026 salary scenario":"Gehaltsszenario 2026","Gross salary per year":"Bruttogehalt pro Jahr","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Angestellter AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Arbeitnehmer-Arbeitslosenversicherung","Pension deduction entered":"Rentenabzug eingegeben","Accident insurance entered":"Unfallversicherung eingegeben","Source tax entered":"Quellensteuer eingegeben","Other deductions entered":"Andere Abzüge eingegeben","Total deductions shown":"Gesamtabzüge angezeigt","Estimated net per year":"Geschätzter Nettowert pro Jahr","Average net per salary payment":"Durchschnittlicher Nettobetrag pro Gehaltszahlung","Average net per month":"Durchschnittliches Netto pro Monat","AHV allowance applied":"AHV-Zuschuss beantragt","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Geben Sie Ihr Bruttogehalt und, falls verfügbar, die tatsächlichen jährlichen Lohnabzüge ein.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"In Ihrem Browser berechnetes Szenario.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Überprüfen Sie Gehalt, Alter und Abzugsbeträge. Die Abzüge dürfen das Bruttogehalt nicht überschreiten.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Wählen Sie die Beitragssituation, die zu Ihrer aktuellen Gehaltsabrechnung passt. Das Alter allein bestimmt nicht jeden Sonderfall.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Kanton ist hier nur Kontext. Die Bundesbeitragssätze werden dadurch nicht geändert und die Quellensteuer wird nicht berechnet.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Verwenden Sie den von Ihrem Arbeitgeber oder Ihrer Gehaltsabrechnung ausgewiesenen Jahresbetrag. Zur Berechnung eines individuellen Tarifs reichen Kanton und Sprache nicht aus.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Renten- und Unfallbeträge variieren je nach Plan und Arbeitgeber. Wenn Sie sie nicht kennen, belassen Sie sie bei Null; Das Ergebnis wird eine Teilschätzung sein.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Die normale jährliche Einkommensteuer ist nicht enthalten. Schweizer Arbeitnehmer, die nicht an der Quelle besteuert werden, begleichen dies in der Regel durch eine jährliche Steuererklärung und nicht durch die übliche Einbehaltung der Lohnabrechnung.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Gehaltsschätzung des Bundes vom Jahr 2026. Es wird von einem Mitarbeiterjob und einem ganzen Jahr ausgegangen. Teiljahresjobs, mehrere Arbeitgeber, Prämien, grenzüberschreitende Fälle, besonderer Beitragsstatus und individuelle Rundungen können die Gehaltsabrechnung verändern. Für den verbindlichen Betrag verwenden Sie bitte die Abrechnung Ihres Arbeitgebers.","Official 2026 references:":"Offizielle Referenzen für 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Beitragssätze AHV/IV/EO und ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 Betriebsrentenschwellen","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Ist das ein exaktes Schweizer Take-Home-Pay-Angebot?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Nr. Es schätzt die gesetzlich vorgeschriebenen bundesweiten Arbeitnehmerbeiträge und subtrahiert die von Ihnen eingegebenen jährlichen lohnspezifischen Beträge. Das Ergebnis ist nur so vollständig wie diese Eingaben.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Warum muss ich Renten- und Unfallabzüge angeben?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Die Beiträge zur betrieblichen Altersvorsorge hängen von der Pensionskasse und dem Pensionsplan ab. Die Prämien für Nichtberufsunfälle hängen vom Versicherer, der Branche und dem Arbeitgeberrisiko ab. Es gibt keinen einzelnen Mitarbeiterbetrag, der allein aus dem Bruttogehalt abgeleitet werden kann.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Kann es die Quellensteuer meines Kantons berechnen?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Nr. Bei Quellensteuertarifen werden personenbezogene Daten und Angaben zur Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnung verwendet. Die veröffentlichten Dateien sind für Arbeitgeber und Anbieter von Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnungssoftware bestimmt. Geben Sie den Betrag aus Ihrer aktuellen Gehaltsabrechnung oder Arbeitgeberschätzung ein.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Wie funktioniert hier das 13. Gehalt?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Geben Sie den Bruttobetrag einer regulären Gehaltszahlung ein und wählen Sie 13 Zahlungen aus. Der Rechner rechnet zunächst den Bruttobetrag auf das Jahr um, wendet jährliche Beitragsgrenzen an und teilt die resultierende Nettoschätzung auf die 13 Zahlungen auf.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Ändert der Kanton AHV/IV/APG oder die Arbeitslosenquote?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Die hier verwendeten Bundesangestelltensätze gelten landesweit. Kantonsspezifische Quellensteuern und andere Arbeitgeber- oder Tarifabzüge werden nicht automatisch berechnet.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Bundesbeiträge des Arbeitgebers werden separat ausgewiesen (nicht von Ihrem Netto abgezogen)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Arbeitgeber AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Arbeitgeber-Arbeitslosenversicherung","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Nur gesetzliche Bundestarife. Arbeitgeberrente, Unfallversicherung, Familienzulagenkasse und kantonale Beiträge sind nicht enthalten."},"ja":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"スイスの純給与シナリオ計算ツール","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"2026 年のスイスの給与計算ツール — 総支払額から純額までのシナリオ","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 年のスイス従業員給与控除を推定します。連邦 AHV/IV/EO および失業保険料を確認し、実際の年金、傷害保険、源泉税額を入力して、便利な 12 または 13 給与シナリオを作成します。","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"実用的な 2026 年のスイスの給与明細シナリオを構築します。この計算機は、全国的な従業員の拠出金を見積もり、自分の給与計算書類から入力した年金、傷害保険、源泉徴収税、その他の控除額を差し引きます。","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"連邦税率はどの州でも同じですが、年金プラン、非業務災害保険料、源泉税はプラン、雇用主、個人のケースによって異なります。給与明細または現在の雇用主の見積りからこれらの年間金額を入力します。カントンと税金のステータスは、文脈のために示されています。このツールは、州の源泉税表や年間所得税を再構築しません。","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"給与支払い 1 回あたり 8,000 スイス フラン、13 回の支払いの場合、年間総額は 104,000 スイス フランです。連邦職員の拠出金は年収から推定されます。年間計画と税控除を入力して、最終的なシナリオを見積もります。","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"1 回の定期給与支払い総額 (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"年間の給与支払額","12 payments":"12 回の支払い","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 回目の給与を含む 13 回の支払い","Age in years":"年齢 (年)","Contribution situation":"寄付状況","Employee contributions apply":"従業員拠出金が適用されます","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"まだ従業員拠出の対象ではありません","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV 基準年齢以降の作業","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"月額 1,400 スイスフランの AHV 手当を適用する","Canton for your payroll context":"給与計算のカントン","Tax-at-source situation":"源泉徴収状況","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"源泉徴収なし / 年間税を別途使用","Taxed at source":"源泉徴収あり","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"給与計算書類からの年間控除 (スイスフラン)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"厚生年金控除（年額）","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"労災保険（年間）","Source tax withheld (annual)":"源泉徴収税 (年次)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"その他の従業員控除 (年次)","Estimate net salary":"純給与の見積もり","Reset example":"リセットの例","2026 salary scenario":"2026 年の給与シナリオ","Gross salary per year":"年間総給与","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"従業員 AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"従業員失業保険","Pension deduction entered":"年金控除を入力しました","Accident insurance entered":"傷害保険に加入しました","Source tax entered":"源泉税を入力しました","Other deductions entered":"その他の控除が入力されました","Total deductions shown":"表示される控除総額","Estimated net per year":"年間推定純額","Average net per salary payment":"給与支払いごとの平均純額","Average net per month":"月あたりの平均純額","AHV allowance applied":"AHV 許容値が適用されました","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"総給与と、可能な場合は実際の年間給与控除を入力します。","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"ブラウザで計算されたシナリオ。","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"給与、年齢、控除額を確認してください。控除は総給与を超えることはできません。","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"現在の給与に一致する拠出状況を選択してください。年齢だけですべての特殊なケースが決まるわけではありません。","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"カントンはここだけの文脈です。連邦負担率を変更したり、源泉税を計算したりすることはありません。","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"雇用主または給与明細によって示された年間金額を使用します。州と言語だけでは、個別の料金を計算するのに十分ではありません。","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"年金と事故の額はプランや雇用主によって異なります。それらがわからない場合は、ゼロのままにしておきます。結果は部分的な見積もりになります。","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"通常の年間所得税は含まれておりません。源泉徴収を受けていないスイスの従業員は、通常、標準的な給与明細の源泉徴収ではなく、年次納税申告書を通じて税金を清算します。","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026 年の連邦給与推計。これは 1 人の従業員の仕事と 1 年間を想定しています。パートイヤーの仕事、複数の雇用主、ボーナス、国境を越えたケース、特別拠出ステータス、および個人の端数処理により、給与が変更される可能性があります。拘束力のある金額については、雇用主の声明を使用してください。","Official 2026 references:":"2026 年の公式参照:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO および ALV 寄与率","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 年の職業年金基準値","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"これはスイスの手取り額の正確な見積もりですか?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"いいえ。全国の法定従業員拠出額を推定し、入力した年間給与固有の金額を差し引きます。結果は、それらの入力と同じくらい完全なものになります。","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"なぜ年金や事故控除を入力しなければならないのですか?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"職業年金拠出金は年金基金と年金制度によって異なります。非労働災害保険料は、保険会社、業界、雇用主のリスクによって異なります。総給与だけから推定できる単一の従業員の金額はありません。","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"私のカントンの源泉税を計算できますか?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"いいえ。源泉税税率は個人および給与の詳細を使用し、公開されたファイルは雇用主および給与ソフトウェア プロバイダーを対象としています。現在の給与明細または雇用主の見積もりから金額を入力します。","How does the 13th salary work here?":"ここでは 13 番目の給与はどのように機能しますか?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"1 回の定期給与支払いの総額を入力し、13 回の支払いを選択します。計算機は、まず総額を年換算し、年間拠出限度額を適用し、結果として得られる正味見積もりを 13 回の支払いに分割します。","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"州は AVS/AI/APG または失業率を変更しますか?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"ここで使用される連邦職員の税率は全国的なものです。カントン固有の源泉税およびその他の雇用主またはプランの控除は、自動的には計算されません。","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"雇用主の連邦拠出金は別途表示されます (純額から差し引かれません)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"雇用主 AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"雇用主の失業保険","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"連邦法定税率のみ。雇用主年金、傷害保険、家族手当基金、州特有の拠出金は含まれません。"},"ko":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"스위스 순 급여 시나리오 계산기","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"스위스 급여 계산기 2026 — 총 급여 시나리오","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026년 스위스 직원 급여 공제액을 추산합니다. 연방 AHV/IV/EO 및 실업 기여금을 확인한 다음 유용한 12 또는 13 급여 시나리오에 대한 실제 연금, 사고 보험 및 원천세 금액을 입력하세요.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"실용적인 2026년 스위스 급여명세서 시나리오를 구축하세요. 계산기는 전국적인 직원 기여금을 추정하고 급여 문서에서 입력한 연금, 상해 보험, 원천징수세 및 기타 공제액을 뺍니다.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"연방 세율은 모든 주에서 동일하지만 연금 계획, 비산업 재해 보험료 및 원천세는 계획, 고용주 및 개인 사례에 따라 다릅니다. 급여명세서나 현재 고용주 추정치에 있는 연간 금액을 입력하세요. 맥락에 따라 주 및 세금 상태가 표시됩니다. 이 도구는 주의 원천세 표나 연간 소득세를 재구성하지 않습니다.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"급여당 CHF 8,000 및 13회 지급의 경우 연간 총액은 CHF 104,000입니다. 연방 직원 기여금은 연봉으로 추정됩니다. 연간 계획과 세금 공제를 입력하여 순 시나리오를 추정합니다.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"한 번의 정규 급여 지급에 대한 총액(CHF)","Salary payments per year":"연간 급여 지급","12 payments":"12개 결제","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13번째 급여를 포함하여 13번 지급","Age in years":"나이(년)","Contribution situation":"기여 상황","Employee contributions apply":"직원 기여금 적용","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"아직 직원 기여금이 적용되지 않음","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV 기준 연령 이후 작업 중","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"월간 AHV 수당 CHF 1,400 적용","Canton for your payroll context":"급여 상황에 대한 캔톤","Tax-at-source situation":"원천과세 상황","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"원천과세 안됨 / 연간세 별도 사용","Taxed at source":"원천지에서 과세됨","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"급여 문서에서 연간 공제(CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"후생연금 공제(연간)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"비업무상 재해 보험(연간)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"원천징수된 원천세(연간)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"기타 직원 공제(연간)","Estimate net salary":"순 급여 추정","Reset example":"리셋 예","2026 salary scenario":"2026 연봉 시나리오","Gross salary per year":"연간 총 급여","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"직원 AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"직원 실업 보험","Pension deduction entered":"연금 공제 시작됨","Accident insurance entered":"상해 보험 가입됨","Source tax entered":"원천세가 입력됨","Other deductions entered":"기타 공제가 입력됨","Total deductions shown":"총 공제액 표시","Estimated net per year":"연간 순 추정치","Average net per salary payment":"급여 지급당 평균 순액","Average net per month":"월 평균 순익","AHV allowance applied":"AHV 허용량이 적용됨","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"총 급여를 입력하고 가능한 경우 실제 연간 급여 공제액을 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"브라우저에서 계산된 시나리오.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"급여, 연령, 공제금액을 확인하세요. 공제는 총 급여를 초과할 수 없습니다.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"귀하의 현재 급여와 일치하는 기부 상황을 선택하세요. 나이만으로 모든 특별한 경우가 결정되는 것은 아닙니다.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton은 여기서만 해당됩니다. 연방 기여율을 변경하거나 원천세를 계산하지 않습니다.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"고용주나 급여명세서에 표시된 연간 금액을 사용하세요. 주(州)와 언어만으로는 개별 관세를 계산할 수 없습니다.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"연금 및 사고 금액은 계획과 고용주에 따라 다릅니다. 모르는 경우에는 0으로 두십시오. 결과는 부분적인 추정이 될 것입니다.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"보통 연간 소득세는 포함되지 않습니다. 원천적으로 과세되지 않는 스위스 직원은 일반적으로 표준 급여명세서 원천징수가 아닌 연간 세금 신고서를 통해 정산합니다.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026년 연방 급여 추정치. 직원 1명과 1년을 가정합니다. 파트년 일자리, 복수 고용주, 보너스, 국경 간 사례, 특별 기여 상태 및 개별 반올림으로 인해 급여가 변경될 수 있습니다. 구속력 있는 금액에 대해서는 고용주 명세서를 사용하십시오.","Official 2026 references:":"공식 2026 참조:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO 및 ALV 기여율","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 기업연금 기준액","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"이것은 정확한 스위스 집에 지불하는 견적입니까?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"아니요. 법정 전국 직원 기여액을 추정하고 입력한 연간 급여별 금액을 뺍니다. 결과는 해당 입력만큼만 완전합니다.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"왜 연금 및 사고 공제를 입력해야 합니까?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"직업 연금 기여금은 연금 기금 및 계획에 따라 다릅니다. 비업무상 재해 보험료는 보험사, 업계 및 고용주의 위험에 따라 다릅니다. 총 급여만으로 추정할 수 있는 단일 직원 금액은 없습니다.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"내 주에서 원천세를 계산할 수 있습니까?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"아니요. 원천세 관세는 개인 및 급여 세부 정보를 사용하며 게시된 파일은 고용주와 급여 소프트웨어 제공업체를 위한 것입니다. 현재 급여명세서나 고용주 추정 금액을 입력하세요.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"여기서 13번째 급여는 어떻게 되나요?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"1회 정기 급여 지급 총액을 입력하고 13회 지급을 선택하세요. 계산기는 먼저 총액을 연 단위로 계산하고 연간 기부 한도를 적용한 다음 결과 순 추정액을 13회 지불액으로 나눕니다.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"주에 따라 AVS/AI/APG 또는 실업률이 변경됩니까?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"여기에 사용된 연방 직원 요금은 전국 단위입니다. 캔톤별 원천세 및 기타 고용주 또는 계획 공제액은 자동으로 계산되지 않습니다.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"고용주 연방 기여금이 별도로 표시됨(순액에서 공제되지 않음)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"고용주 AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"고용주 실업 보험","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"연방 법정 세율만 적용됩니다. 고용주 연금, 상해 보험, 가족 수당 기금 및 주별 기여금은 포함되지 않습니다."},"id":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Skenario Gaji Bersih Swiss","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Kalkulator Gaji Swiss 2026 — Skenario Pembayaran Kotor ke Bersih","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Perkirakan pemotongan gaji karyawan Swiss untuk tahun 2026. Lihat AHV/IV/EO federal dan kontribusi pengangguran, lalu masukkan jumlah pensiun, asuransi kecelakaan, dan pajak sumber Anda yang sebenarnya untuk skenario pembayaran 12 atau 13 yang berguna.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Buat skenario slip gaji Swiss 2026 yang praktis. Kalkulator memperkirakan kontribusi karyawan secara nasional dan mengurangi dana pensiun, asuransi kecelakaan, pemotongan pajak, dan pemotongan lainnya yang Anda masukkan dari dokumen penggajian Anda sendiri.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Tarif federal sama di seluruh wilayah, tetapi program pensiun Anda, premi kecelakaan non-kerja, dan pajak sumber bergantung pada rencana, perusahaan, dan kasus pribadi Anda. Masukkan jumlah tahunan tersebut dari slip gaji atau perkiraan perusahaan saat ini. Status wilayah dan pajak ditampilkan untuk konteks; alat ini tidak merekonstruksi tabel sumber pajak wilayah atau pajak pendapatan tahunan.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Untuk CHF 8.000 per pembayaran gaji dan 13 pembayaran, kotor tahunan adalah CHF 104.000. Kontribusi pegawai federal diperkirakan dari gaji tahunan; masukkan rencana tahunan dan pengurangan pajak untuk memperkirakan skenario bersih.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Kotor untuk satu pembayaran gaji reguler (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Pembayaran gaji per tahun","12 payments":"12 pembayaran","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pembayaran, termasuk gaji ke-13","Age in years":"Umur dalam tahun","Contribution situation":"Situasi kontribusi","Employee contributions apply":"Kontribusi karyawan berlaku","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Belum dikenakan iuran pegawai","Working after AHV reference age":"Bekerja setelah usia referensi AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Terapkan tunjangan AHV bulanan CHF 1.400","Canton for your payroll context":"Kanton untuk konteks penggajian Anda","Tax-at-source situation":"Situasi pajak di sumber","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Tidak dikenakan pajak pada sumber/menggunakan pajak tahunan secara terpisah","Taxed at source":"Pajak di sumbernya","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Potongan tahunan dari dokumen penggajian Anda (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Potongan pensiun karyawan (tahunan)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Asuransi kecelakaan non-kerja (tahunan)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Sumber pajak dipotong (tahunan)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Potongan pegawai lainnya (tahunan)","Estimate net salary":"Perkiraan gaji bersih","Reset example":"Reset contoh","2026 salary scenario":"skenario gaji 2026","Gross salary per year":"Gaji kotor per tahun","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Karyawan AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Asuransi pengangguran karyawan","Pension deduction entered":"Potongan pensiun dimasukkan","Accident insurance entered":"Asuransi kecelakaan masuk","Source tax entered":"Sumber pajak dimasukkan","Other deductions entered":"Potongan lainnya dimasukkan","Total deductions shown":"Total potongan yang ditampilkan","Estimated net per year":"Perkiraan bersih per tahun","Average net per salary payment":"Rata-rata bersih per pembayaran gaji","Average net per month":"Rata-rata bersih per bulan\nTunjangan","AHV allowance applied":"AHV diterapkan","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Masukkan gaji kotor Anda dan, jika tersedia, potongan gaji tahunan aktual.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Skenario dihitung di browser Anda.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Periksa gaji, umur dan besaran potongan. Pemotongan tidak boleh melebihi gaji kotor.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Pilih situasi kontribusi yang sesuai dengan gaji Anda saat ini. Usia saja tidak menentukan setiap kasus khusus.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Kanton hanyalah konteks di sini. Ini tidak mengubah tingkat kontribusi federal atau menghitung sumber pajak.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Gunakan jumlah tahunan yang ditunjukkan oleh perusahaan atau slip gaji Anda. Wilayah dan bahasa saja tidak cukup untuk menghitung tarif individu.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Jumlah pensiun dan kecelakaan bervariasi menurut rencana dan pemberi kerja. Jika Anda tidak mengetahuinya, biarkan nol; hasilnya akan menjadi perkiraan parsial.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Belum termasuk pajak penghasilan tahunan biasa. Karyawan Swiss yang tidak dikenakan pajak pada sumbernya umumnya menyelesaikannya melalui pengembalian pajak tahunan, bukan pemotongan gaji standar.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Perkiraan penggajian federal tertanggal 2026. Ini mengasumsikan satu pekerjaan karyawan dan satu tahun penuh. Pekerjaan paruh tahun, banyak perusahaan, bonus, kasus lintas batas, status iuran khusus, dan pembulatan individu dapat mengubah penggajian. Gunakan pernyataan perusahaan Anda untuk jumlah yang mengikat.","Official 2026 references:":"Referensi resmi tahun 2026:\nTingkat kontribusi","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO dan ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 ambang batas pensiun kerja","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Apakah ini benar-benar penawaran untuk dibawa pulang dari Swiss?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Tidak. Ini memperkirakan kontribusi karyawan nasional menurut undang-undang dan mengurangi jumlah spesifik gaji tahunan yang Anda masukkan. Hasilnya hanya selengkap masukan tersebut.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Mengapa saya harus memasukkan iuran pensiun dan kecelakaan?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Iuran pensiun kerja bergantung pada dana dan program pensiun. Premi kecelakaan non-kerja bergantung pada risiko perusahaan asuransi, industri, dan pemberi kerja. Tidak ada satu pun jumlah karyawan yang dapat disimpulkan dari gaji kotor saja.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Dapatkah menghitung pajak sumber dari wilayah saya?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Tidak. Tarif sumber pajak menggunakan rincian pribadi dan penggajian dan file yang dipublikasikan ditujukan untuk pemberi kerja dan penyedia perangkat lunak penggajian. Masukkan jumlah dari slip gaji atau perkiraan perusahaan Anda saat ini.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Bagaimana cara kerja gaji ke-13 di sini?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Masukkan jumlah kotor dari satu pembayaran gaji reguler dan pilih 13 pembayaran. Kalkulator menghitung jumlah kotor secara tahunan terlebih dahulu, menerapkan batas kontribusi tahunan, dan membagi perkiraan bersih yang dihasilkan ke dalam 13 pembayaran.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Apakah wilayah mengubah AVS/AI/APG atau tingkat pengangguran?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Tarif pegawai federal yang digunakan di sini bersifat nasional. Pajak sumber khusus wilayah dan potongan perusahaan atau rencana lainnya tidak dihitung secara otomatis.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Kontribusi federal pemberi kerja ditampilkan secara terpisah (tidak dipotong dari jumlah bersih Anda)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Majikan AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Asuransi pengangguran pemberi kerja","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Tarif hukum federal saja. Pensiun pemberi kerja, asuransi kecelakaan, dana tunjangan keluarga, dan kontribusi khusus wilayah tidak termasuk."},"hi":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"स्विस नेट वेतन परिदृश्य कैलकुलेटर","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"स्विस वेतन कैलकुलेटर 2026 — सकल से शुद्ध वेतन परिदृश्य\nयूएसएन002एक्स|2026 के लिए स्विस कर्मचारी पेरोल कटौती का अनुमान लगाएं। संघीय एएचवी/आईवी/ईओ और बेरोजगारी योगदान देखें, फिर उपयोगी 12- या 13-वेतन परिदृश्य के लिए अपनी वास्तविक पेंशन, दुर्घटना बीमा और स्रोत-कर राशि दर्ज करें।","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 के लिए स्विस कर्मचारी पेरोल कटौती का अनुमान लगाएं। संघीय एएचवी/आईवी/ईओ और बेरोजगारी योगदान देखें, फिर उपयोगी 12- या 13-वेतन परिदृश्य के लिए अपनी वास्तविक पेंशन, दुर्घटना बीमा और स्रोत-कर राशि दर्ज करें।","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"एक व्यावहारिक 2026 स्विस पेस्लिप परिदृश्य बनाएं। कैलकुलेटर राष्ट्रव्यापी कर्मचारी योगदान का अनुमान लगाता है और आपके अपने पेरोल दस्तावेज़ों से आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई पेंशन, दुर्घटना बीमा, विदहोल्डिंग टैक्स और अन्य कटौतियों को घटा देता है।","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"संघीय दरें सभी कैंटनों में समान हैं, लेकिन आपकी पेंशन योजना, गैर-व्यावसायिक दुर्घटना प्रीमियम और स्रोत कर आपकी योजना, नियोक्ता और व्यक्तिगत मामले पर निर्भर करते हैं। वेतन पर्ची या वर्तमान नियोक्ता अनुमान से उन वार्षिक राशियों को दर्ज करें। संदर्भ के लिए कैंटन और कर स्थिति दिखायी गयी है; यह उपकरण कैंटोनल स्रोत-कर तालिकाओं या वार्षिक आयकर का पुनर्निर्माण नहीं करता है।","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"CHF 8,000 प्रति वेतन भुगतान और 13 भुगतानों के लिए, वार्षिक सकल CHF 104,000 है। संघीय कर्मचारी योगदान का अनुमान वार्षिक वेतन से लगाया जाता है; शुद्ध परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाने के लिए वार्षिक योजना और कर कटौती दर्ज करें।","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"एक नियमित वेतन भुगतान के लिए सकल (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"प्रति वर्ष वेतन भुगतान","12 payments":"12 भुगतान","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13वें वेतन सहित 13 भुगतान","Age in years":"आयु वर्षों में","Contribution situation":"योगदान स्थिति","Employee contributions apply":"कर्मचारी योगदान लागू","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"अभी तक कर्मचारी योगदान के अधीन नहीं है","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV संदर्भ आयु के बाद कार्य करना","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 मासिक AHV भत्ता लागू करें","Canton for your payroll context":"कैंटन","Tax-at-source situation":"स्रोत पर कर स्थिति","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"स्रोत पर कर नहीं लगाया जाएगा/वार्षिक कर का उपयोग अलग से किया जाएगा","Taxed at source":"स्रोत पर कर लगाया गया","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"आपके पेरोल दस्तावेज़ों से वार्षिक कटौतियाँ (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"कर्मचारी पेंशन कटौती (वार्षिक)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"गैर-व्यावसायिक दुर्घटना बीमा (वार्षिक)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"स्रोत कर रोका गया (वार्षिक)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"अन्य कर्मचारी कटौतियाँ (वार्षिक)","Estimate net salary":"अनुमानित शुद्ध वेतन","Reset example":"उदाहरण रीसेट करें","2026 salary scenario":"2026 वेतन परिदृश्य","Gross salary per year":"प्रति वर्ष सकल वेतन","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"कर्मचारी AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"कर्मचारी बेरोजगारी बीमा","Pension deduction entered":"पेंशन कटौती दर्ज की गई","Accident insurance entered":"दुर्घटना बीमा दर्ज किया गया","Source tax entered":"स्रोत कर दर्ज किया गया","Other deductions entered":"अन्य कटौतियाँ दर्ज की गईं","Total deductions shown":"दिखाई गई कुल कटौतियाँ","Estimated net per year":"अनुमानित शुद्ध प्रति वर्ष","Average net per salary payment":"प्रति वेतन भुगतान औसत शुद्ध","Average net per month":"औसत नेट प्रति माह","AHV allowance applied":"AHV भत्ता लागू","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"अपना सकल वेतन और, यदि उपलब्ध हो, वास्तविक वार्षिक पेरोल कटौती दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"आपके ब्राउज़र में परिदृश्य की गणना की गई।","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"वेतन, आयु और कटौती राशि की जांच करें। कटौती सकल वेतन से अधिक नहीं हो सकती.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"वह योगदान स्थिति चुनें जो आपके वर्तमान पेरोल से मेल खाती हो। प्रत्येक विशेष मामले में केवल उम्र ही निर्धारित नहीं होती।","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"कैंटन केवल यहां संदर्भ है। यह संघीय योगदान दरों में बदलाव नहीं करता है या स्रोत कर की गणना नहीं करता है।","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"अपने नियोक्ता या वेतन पर्ची द्वारा दिखाई गई वार्षिक राशि का उपयोग करें। किसी व्यक्तिगत टैरिफ की गणना के लिए एक कैंटन और भाषा पर्याप्त नहीं है।","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"पेंशन और दुर्घटना राशि योजना और नियोक्ता के अनुसार अलग-अलग होती है। यदि आप उन्हें नहीं जानते, तो उन्हें शून्य पर छोड़ दें; नतीजा आंशिक अनुमान होगा.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"साधारण वार्षिक आयकर शामिल नहीं है। जिन स्विस कर्मचारियों पर स्रोत पर कर नहीं लगाया जाता है, वे आम तौर पर वार्षिक कर रिटर्न के माध्यम से इसका निपटान करते हैं, न कि मानक वेतन-पर्ची रोककर।","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"संघीय पेरोल अनुमान दिनांक 2026। इसमें एक कर्मचारी की नौकरी और एक पूरा वर्ष माना गया है। अंश-वर्षीय नौकरियां, एकाधिक नियोक्ता, बोनस, सीमा पार मामले, विशेष योगदान स्थिति और व्यक्तिगत राउंडिंग पेरोल को बदल सकते हैं। बाध्यकारी राशि के लिए अपने नियोक्ता विवरण का उपयोग करें।","Official 2026 references:":"आधिकारिक 2026 संदर्भ:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO और ALV योगदान दरें","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 व्यावसायिक-पेंशन सीमाएँ","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"क्या यह सटीक स्विस टेक-होम-पे उद्धरण है?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"नहीं. यह वैधानिक राष्ट्रव्यापी कर्मचारी योगदान का अनुमान लगाता है और आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई वार्षिक पेरोल-विशिष्ट राशि को घटा देता है। परिणाम उन इनपुटों जितना ही पूर्ण है।","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"मुझे पेंशन और दुर्घटना कटौती क्यों दर्ज करनी होगी?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"व्यावसायिक पेंशन योगदान पेंशन फंड और योजना पर निर्भर करता है। गैर-व्यावसायिक दुर्घटना प्रीमियम बीमाकर्ता, उद्योग और नियोक्ता जोखिम पर निर्भर करते हैं। ऐसी कोई एकल कर्मचारी राशि नहीं है जिसका अनुमान अकेले सकल वेतन से लगाया जा सके।","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"क्या यह मेरे कैंटन से स्रोत कर की गणना कर सकता है?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"नहीं. स्रोत-कर टैरिफ व्यक्तिगत और पेरोल विवरण का उपयोग करते हैं और प्रकाशित फ़ाइलें नियोक्ताओं और पेरोल-सॉफ़्टवेयर प्रदाताओं के लिए होती हैं। अपनी वर्तमान वेतन पर्ची या नियोक्ता अनुमान से राशि दर्ज करें।","How does the 13th salary work here?":"यहां 13वां वेतन कैसे काम करता है?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"एक नियमित वेतन भुगतान की सकल राशि दर्ज करें और 13 भुगतान चुनें। कैलकुलेटर पहले सकल राशि को वार्षिक करता है, वार्षिक योगदान सीमा लागू करता है, और परिणामी शुद्ध अनुमान को 13 भुगतानों में विभाजित करता है।","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"क्या कैंटन AVS/AI/APG या बेरोजगारी दर बदलता है?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"यहां प्रयुक्त संघीय कर्मचारी दरें राष्ट्रव्यापी हैं। कैंटन-विशिष्ट स्रोत कर और अन्य नियोक्ता या योजना कटौती की गणना स्वचालित रूप से नहीं की जाती है।","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"नियोक्ता संघीय योगदान अलग से दिखाया गया है (आपके नेट से नहीं काटा गया)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"नियोक्ता AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"नियोक्ता बेरोजगारी बीमा","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"केवल संघीय वैधानिक दरें। नियोक्ता पेंशन, दुर्घटना बीमा, पारिवारिक भत्ता निधि और कैंटन-विशिष्ट योगदान शामिल नहीं हैं।"},"ar":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"حاسبة سيناريو صافي الراتب السويسري","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"حاسبة الراتب السويسرية 2026 — سيناريو الراتب الإجمالي إلى الصافي","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"قم بتقدير استقطاعات رواتب الموظفين السويسريين لعام 2026. راجع AHV/IV/EO الفيدرالية ومساهمات البطالة، ثم أدخل معاشك التقاعدي الفعلي والتأمين ضد الحوادث ومبالغ ضريبة المصدر للحصول على سيناريو مفيد يبلغ 12 أو 13 أجرًا.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"قم ببناء سيناريو عملي لكشوف المرتبات السويسرية لعام 2026. تقوم الآلة الحاسبة بتقدير مساهمات الموظفين على المستوى الوطني وتطرح المعاش التقاعدي والتأمين ضد الحوادث والضرائب المقتطعة والخصومات الأخرى التي تدخلها من مستندات الرواتب الخاصة بك.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"المعدلات الفيدرالية هي نفسها عبر الكانتونات، لكن خطة التقاعد الخاصة بك وأقساط الحوادث غير المهنية وضريبة المصدر تعتمد على خطتك وصاحب العمل والحالة الشخصية. أدخل هذه المبالغ السنوية من كشف الراتب أو تقدير صاحب العمل الحالي. يتم عرض كانتون والحالة الضريبية للسياق؛ لا تقوم هذه الأداة بإعادة بناء جداول ضريبة المصدر في الكانتونات أو ضريبة الدخل السنوية.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"بالنسبة إلى 8000 فرنك سويسري لكل دفعة راتب و13 دفعة، يبلغ الإجمالي السنوي 104000 فرنك سويسري. يتم تقدير مساهمات الموظفين الفيدراليين من الراتب السنوي؛ أدخل الخطة السنوية والخصومات الضريبية لتقدير السيناريو الصافي.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"الإجمالي لدفعة راتب منتظمة واحدة (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"دفعات الرواتب سنويا","12 payments":"12 دفعة","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 دفعة، بما في ذلك الراتب الثالث عشر","Age in years":"العمر بالسنوات","Contribution situation":"حالة المساهمة","Employee contributions apply":"تُطبق مساهمات الموظفين","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"لا يخضع بعد لمساهمات الموظفين","Working after AHV reference age":"العمل بعد العمر المرجعي لـ AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"طبق بدل AHV الشهري بقيمة 1400 فرنك سويسري","Canton for your payroll context":"كانتون لسياق الرواتب الخاص بك","Tax-at-source situation":"وضع الضريبة عند المصدر","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"لا يخضع للضريبة عند المصدر / استخدم الضريبة السنوية بشكل منفصل","Taxed at source":"تخضع للضريبة عند المصدر","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"الاستقطاعات السنوية من مستندات الرواتب (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"خصم معاش الموظف (سنوي)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"التأمين ضد الحوادث غير المهنية (سنوي)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"تم اقتطاع ضريبة المصدر (سنويًا)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"استقطاعات الموظفين الأخرى (سنوية)","Estimate net salary":"تقدير صافي الراتب","Reset example":"إعادة تعيين المثال","2026 salary scenario":"سيناريو الراتب 2026","Gross salary per year":"الراتب الإجمالي في السنة","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"الموظف AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"التأمين ضد البطالة للموظفين","Pension deduction entered":"تم إدخال خصم المعاش التقاعدي","Accident insurance entered":"تم إدخال التأمين ضد الحوادث","Source tax entered":"تم إدخال ضريبة المصدر","Other deductions entered":"تم إدخال الخصومات الأخرى","Total deductions shown":"إجمالي الخصومات المعروضة","Estimated net per year":"الصافي المقدر في السنة","Average net per salary payment":"متوسط صافي دفعة الراتب","Average net per month":"متوسط صافي شهريًا","AHV allowance applied":"تم تطبيق بدل AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"أدخل إجمالي الراتب الخاص بك، وإذا كان متاحًا، الاستقطاعات السنوية الفعلية من الرواتب.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"السيناريو المحسوب في المستعرض الخاص بك.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"التحقق من الراتب والعمر ومبالغ الاستقطاع. لا يجوز أن تتجاوز الاستقطاعات الراتب الإجمالي.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"اختر حالة المساهمة التي تتوافق مع كشف الرواتب الحالي الخاص بك. العمر وحده لا يحدد كل حالة خاصة.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"كانتون هو السياق هنا فقط. ولا يغير معدلات المساهمة الفيدرالية أو يحسب ضريبة المصدر.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"استخدم المبلغ السنوي الموضح من قبل صاحب العمل أو كشوف الراتب. الكانتون واللغة لا يكفيان لحساب التعريفة الفردية.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"تختلف مبالغ المعاشات التقاعدية والحوادث حسب الخطة وصاحب العمل. إذا كنت لا تعرفهم، اتركهم عند الصفر؛ وستكون النتيجة تقديرا جزئيا.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"لم يتم تضمين ضريبة الدخل السنوية العادية. عادة ما يقوم الموظفون السويسريون الذين لا يخضعون للضريبة عند المصدر بتسوية هذه الضريبة من خلال الإقرار الضريبي السنوي، وليس من خلال حجب كشوف المرتبات القياسية.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"تقدير كشوف المرتبات الفيدرالية بتاريخ 2026. ويفترض وظيفة موظف واحد وسنة كاملة. يمكن للوظائف بدوام جزئي، وأصحاب العمل المتعددين، والمكافآت، والحالات عبر الحدود، وحالة المساهمة الخاصة، والتقريب الفردي أن تغير كشوف المرتبات. استخدم بيان صاحب العمل الخاص بك للحصول على المبلغ الملزم.","Official 2026 references:":"المراجع الرسمية لعام 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"معدلات مساهمة AHV/IV/EO وALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 عتبات التقاعد المهني","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"هل هذا عرض أسعار سويسري دقيق لأخذ الأجر إلى المنزل؟","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"لا. يقوم بتقدير مساهمات الموظفين القانونية على المستوى الوطني ويطرح المبالغ السنوية الخاصة بكشوف المرتبات التي تدخلها. والنتيجة هي فقط كاملة مثل تلك المدخلات.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"لماذا يجب علي إدخال استقطاعات المعاشات والحوادث؟","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"تعتمد مساهمات المعاشات التقاعدية المهنية على صندوق المعاشات التقاعدية والخطة. تعتمد أقساط التأمين ضد الحوادث غير المهنية على مخاطر شركة التأمين والصناعة وصاحب العمل. لا يوجد مبلغ واحد للموظف يمكن استنتاجه من الراتب الإجمالي وحده.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"هل يمكن حساب ضريبة المصدر من الكانتون الخاص بي؟","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"لا. تستخدم تعريفات ضريبة المصدر التفاصيل الشخصية وتفاصيل الرواتب، والملفات المنشورة مخصصة لأصحاب العمل ومقدمي برامج الرواتب. أدخل المبلغ من كشف الراتب الحالي أو تقدير صاحب العمل.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"كيف يعمل الراتب الثالث عشر هنا؟","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"أدخل المبلغ الإجمالي لدفعة راتب منتظمة واحدة واختر 13 دفعة. تقوم الآلة الحاسبة بحساب المبلغ الإجمالي سنويًا أولاً، وتطبق حدود المساهمة السنوية، وتقسم صافي التقدير الناتج على الدفعات الـ 13.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"هل يغير الكانتون معدلات AVS/AI/APG أو معدلات البطالة؟","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"أسعار الموظفين الفيدراليين المستخدمة هنا تنطبق على مستوى الدولة. لا يتم حساب ضريبة المصدر الخاصة بالكانتون وغيرها من خصومات أصحاب العمل أو الخطة تلقائيًا.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"المساهمات الفيدرالية لأصحاب العمل معروضة بشكل منفصل (لا يتم خصمها من شبكتك)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"صاحب العمل AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"التأمين ضد البطالة لصاحب العمل","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"المعدلات القانونية الفيدرالية فقط. لا يتم تضمين معاشات أصحاب العمل والتأمين ضد الحوادث وصندوق بدل الأسرة والمساهمات الخاصة بالكانتون."},"zh":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"瑞士净工资情景计算器","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"2026 年瑞士薪资计算器 — 毛薪到净薪情景","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"估计 2026 年瑞士员工工资扣除额。查看联邦 AHV/IV/EO 和失业缴款，然后输入您的实际养老金、意外保险和来源税金额，以适用于有用的 12 或 13 工资方案。","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"构建实用的 2026 年瑞士工资单场景。该计算器估算全国范围内的员工缴款，并减去养老金、意外保险、预扣税和您从自己的工资单文件中输入的其他扣除额。","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"各州的联邦税率相同，但您的养老金计划、非职业事故保费和来源税取决于您的计划、雇主和个人情况。输入工资单或当前雇主估算中的年度金额。显示州和税务状况以供参考；该工具不会重建州源税表或年度所得税。","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"每次工资支付 8,000 瑞士法郎并分 13 次支付，年度总额为 104,000 瑞士法郎。联邦雇员缴款根据年薪估算；输入年度计划和税收减免来估计净情景。","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"一笔定期工资支付总额（瑞士法郎）","Salary payments per year":"每年支付工资","12 payments":"12 笔付款","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13笔付款，包括第13笔工资","Age in years":"年龄（岁）","Contribution situation":"贡献情况","Employee contributions apply":"员工缴款适用","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"尚未缴纳员工缴款","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV参考年龄后工作","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"申请每月 1,400 瑞士法郎的 AHV 津贴","Canton for your payroll context":"广州为您提供薪资环境","Tax-at-source situation":"源头税情况","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"源头不征税/单独使用年税","Taxed at source":"源头征税","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"从您的工资文件中每年扣除（瑞士法郎）","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"员工养老金扣除（每年）","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"非职业意外保险（每年）","Source tax withheld (annual)":"来源税预扣（年度）","Other employee deductions (annual)":"其他员工扣除额（年度）","Estimate net salary":"估计净工资","Reset example":"重置示例","2026 salary scenario":"2026年薪资情景","Gross salary per year":"每年总工资","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"员工 AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"职工失业保险","Pension deduction entered":"养老金扣除已输入","Accident insurance entered":"已入意外险","Source tax entered":"输入源税","Other deductions entered":"输入的其他扣除额","Total deductions shown":"显示的总扣除额","Estimated net per year":"估计每年净值","Average net per salary payment":"平均每笔工资净额","Average net per month":"每月平均净值","AHV allowance applied":"已应用 AHV 津贴","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"输入您的工资总额以及实际年度工资扣除额（如果有）。","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"在您的浏览器中计算的场景。","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"查看工资、年龄和扣除金额。扣除额不能超过工资总额。","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"选择与您当前工资单相匹配的缴款情况。年龄本身并不能决定所有特殊情况。","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"广州仅是此处的上下文。它不会改变联邦缴款率或计算来源税。","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"使用您的雇主或工资单显示的年度金额。州和语言不足以计算个人关税。","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"养老金和事故金额因计划和雇主而异。如果您不知道它们，请将它们保留为零；结果将是部分估计。","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"不包含普通年所得税。不在源头征税的瑞士员工通常通过年度纳税申报表而不是标准工资单预扣税来解决。","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026 年联邦工资预估。它假设一名员工工作和一整年。半年工作、多个雇主、奖金、跨境案件、特殊缴款状态和个人四舍五入都可能改变工资单。使用您的雇主声明来确定具有约束力的金额。","Official 2026 references:":"2026 年官方参考文献：","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO 和 ALV 贡献率","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026年职业养老金起征点","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"这是瑞士的实得工资报价吗？","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"编号它估算全国范围内的法定雇员缴款，并减去您输入的年度工资特定金额。结果仅与这些输入一样完整。","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"为什么我必须输入养老金和意外扣除？","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"职业养老金缴款取决于养老基金和计划。非职业事故保费取决于保险公司、行业和雇主的风险。仅从工资总额中无法推断出单个员工的金额。","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"可以计算我所在州的来源税吗？","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"编号来源税关税使用个人和工资详细信息，发布的文件适用于雇主和工资软件提供商。输入您当前工资单或雇主估算的金额。","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13薪在这里如何发挥作用？","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"输入一笔定期工资付款的总额并选择 13 笔付款。计算器首先对总额进行年度化，应用年度缴款限额，然后将所得的净估算值除以 13 笔付款。","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"各州是否会改变 AVS/AI/APG 或失业率？","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"此处使用的联邦雇员费率为全国范围内的费率。州特定源税和其他雇主或计划扣除额不会自动计算。","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"单独显示的雇主联邦缴款（不从您的净额中扣除）","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"雇主 AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"雇主失业保险","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"仅限联邦法定费率。雇主养老金、意外保险、家庭津贴基金和各州特定缴款不包括在内。"},"bn":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"সুইস নেট বেতন দৃশ্যকল্প ক্যালকুলেটর","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"সুইস বেতন ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — মোট থেকে নেট পে দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026-এর জন্য সুইস কর্মচারীদের বেতন-কাঠামোর পরিমাণ অনুমান করুন। ফেডারেল AHV/IV/EO এবং বেকারত্বের অবদান দেখুন, তারপর একটি দরকারী 12- বা 13-বেতনের পরিস্থিতির জন্য আপনার প্রকৃত পেনশন, দুর্ঘটনা বীমা এবং উৎস-করের পরিমাণ লিখুন।","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"একটি ব্যবহারিক 2026 সুইস পেস্লিপ দৃশ্য তৈরি করুন। ক্যালকুলেটর দেশব্যাপী কর্মচারীদের অবদান অনুমান করে এবং পেনশন, দুর্ঘটনা বীমা, উইথহোল্ডিং ট্যাক্স এবং আপনার নিজের পে-রোল নথি থেকে আপনার প্রবেশ করা অন্যান্য কর্তনগুলি বিয়োগ করে।","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"ফেডারেল রেট ক্যান্টন জুড়ে একই, তবে আপনার পেনশন প্ল্যান, অ-পেশাগত দুর্ঘটনা প্রিমিয়াম এবং উৎস কর নির্ভর করে আপনার পরিকল্পনা, নিয়োগকর্তা এবং ব্যক্তিগত ক্ষেত্রে। একটি পেস্লিপ বা বর্তমান নিয়োগকর্তার অনুমান থেকে সেই বার্ষিক পরিমাণগুলি লিখুন৷ ক্যান্টন এবং ট্যাক্স স্ট্যাটাস প্রসঙ্গের জন্য দেখানো হয়েছে; এই টুলটি ক্যান্টোনাল সোর্স-ট্যাক্স টেবিল বা বার্ষিক আয়কর পুনর্গঠন করে না।","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"প্রতি বেতন পেমেন্ট 8,000 CHF এবং 13টি পেমেন্টের জন্য, বার্ষিক মোট CHF 104,000। ফেডারেল কর্মচারীদের অবদান বার্ষিক বেতন থেকে অনুমান করা হয়; নেট দৃশ্যকল্প অনুমান করতে বার্ষিক পরিকল্পনা এবং কর কর্তন লিখুন।","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"একটি নিয়মিত বেতন প্রদানের জন্য মোট (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"প্রতি বছর বেতন প্রদান","12 payments":"12 পেমেন্ট","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 পেমেন্ট, 13 তম বেতন সহ","Age in years":"বছরে বয়স","Contribution situation":"অবদান পরিস্থিতি","Employee contributions apply":"কর্মচারীর অবদান প্রযোজ্য","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"এখনও কর্মচারী অবদানের বিষয় নয়","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV রেফারেন্স বয়সের পরে কাজ করা","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 মাসিক AHV ভাতা প্রয়োগ করুন","Canton for your payroll context":"আপনার বেতনের প্রসঙ্গের জন্য ক্যান্টন","Tax-at-source situation":"ট্যাক্স-এ-সোর্স পরিস্থিতি","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"উৎস/ব্যবহারে আলাদাভাবে বার্ষিক ট্যাক্স ধার্য করা হয় না","Taxed at source":"উৎসে ট্যাক্স","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"আপনার বেতনের নথি (CHF) থেকে বার্ষিক কর্তন","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"কর্মচারী পেনশন কাটা (বার্ষিক)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"অ-পেশাগত দুর্ঘটনা বীমা (বার্ষিক)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"উৎস ট্যাক্স আটকানো (বার্ষিক)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"অন্যান্য কর্মচারী কর্তন (বার্ষিক)","Estimate net salary":"আনুমানিক নেট বেতন","Reset example":"রিসেট উদাহরণ","2026 salary scenario":"2026 বেতনের পরিস্থিতি","Gross salary per year":"প্রতি বছর মোট বেতন","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"কর্মচারী AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"কর্মচারী বেকারত্ব বীমা","Pension deduction entered":"পেনশন কর্তন প্রবেশ করা হয়েছে৷","Accident insurance entered":"দুর্ঘটনা বীমা প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Source tax entered":"উৎস ট্যাক্স প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে","Other deductions entered":"অন্যান্য ছাড় প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Total deductions shown":"মোট কাট দেখানো হয়েছে","Estimated net per year":"প্রতি বছর আনুমানিক নেট","Average net per salary payment":"প্রতি বেতন প্রদানের গড় নেট","Average net per month":"প্রতি মাসে গড় নেট","AHV allowance applied":"AHV ভাতা প্রযোজ্য","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"আপনার মোট বেতন লিখুন এবং, যদি উপলব্ধ থাকে, প্রকৃত বার্ষিক বেতন কর্তন।","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"আপনার ব্রাউজারে গণনা করা দৃশ্যকল্প।","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"বেতন, বয়স এবং কাটার পরিমাণ দেখুন। কর্তন মোট বেতন অতিক্রম করতে পারে না.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"আপনার বর্তমান বেতনের সাথে মেলে এমন অবদানের পরিস্থিতি বেছে নিন। শুধুমাত্র বয়স প্রতিটি বিশেষ ক্ষেত্রে নির্ধারণ করে না।","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"ক্যান্টন শুধুমাত্র এখানে প্রসঙ্গ। এটি ফেডারেল অবদানের হার পরিবর্তন করে না বা উৎস ট্যাক্স গণনা করে না।","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"আপনার নিয়োগকর্তা বা পেস্লিপ দ্বারা দেখানো বার্ষিক পরিমাণ ব্যবহার করুন। একটি ক্যান্টন এবং ভাষা একটি পৃথক ট্যারিফ গণনা করার জন্য যথেষ্ট নয়।","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"পেনশন এবং দুর্ঘটনার পরিমাণ পরিকল্পনা এবং নিয়োগকর্তার দ্বারা পরিবর্তিত হয়। যদি আপনি তাদের না জানেন, তাদের শূন্যে ছেড়ে দিন; ফলাফল একটি আংশিক অনুমান হবে.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"সাধারণ বার্ষিক আয়কর অন্তর্ভুক্ত নয়। যে সুইস কর্মচারীদের উৎসে কর দেওয়া হয় না তারা সাধারণত একটি বার্ষিক ট্যাক্স রিটার্নের মাধ্যমে এটি নিষ্পত্তি করে, একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড পে-স্লিপ উইথহোল্ডিং নয়।","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"ফেডারেল বেতন অনুমান 2026 তারিখে। এটি একজন কর্মচারীর চাকরি এবং একটি পুরো বছর ধরে নেয়। খণ্ড-বর্ষের চাকরি, একাধিক নিয়োগকর্তা, বোনাস, ক্রস-বর্ডার কেস, বিশেষ অবদানের স্থিতি এবং ব্যক্তিগত রাউন্ডিং বেতন পরিবর্তন করতে পারে। বাধ্যতামূলক পরিমাণের জন্য আপনার নিয়োগকর্তার বিবৃতি ব্যবহার করুন।","Official 2026 references:":"অফিসিয়াল 2026 রেফারেন্স:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO এবং ALV অবদানের হার","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 পেশাগত-পেনশন থ্রেশহোল্ড","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"এটি কি সঠিক সুইস টেক-হোম-পে উদ্ধৃতি?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"নং এটি বিধিবদ্ধ দেশব্যাপী কর্মচারীদের অবদানের অনুমান করে এবং আপনার প্রবেশ করা বার্ষিক বেতন-নির্দিষ্ট পরিমাণ বিয়োগ করে। ফলাফল শুধুমাত্র সেই ইনপুট হিসাবে সম্পূর্ণ.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"কেন আমাকে পেনশন এবং দুর্ঘটনা কাটানোর জন্য প্রবেশ করতে হবে?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"পেনশন তহবিল এবং পরিকল্পনার উপর পেশাগত পেনশন অবদান নির্ভর করে। অ-পেশাগত দুর্ঘটনার প্রিমিয়াম বীমাকারী, শিল্প এবং নিয়োগকর্তার ঝুঁকির উপর নির্ভর করে। শুধুমাত্র মোট বেতন থেকে অনুমান করা যেতে পারে এমন কোন একক কর্মচারীর পরিমাণ নেই।","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"এটি কি আমার ক্যান্টন থেকে উৎস ট্যাক্স গণনা করতে পারে?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"নং উৎস-কর ট্যারিফ ব্যক্তিগত এবং বেতনের বিবরণ ব্যবহার করে এবং প্রকাশিত ফাইলগুলি নিয়োগকর্তা এবং বেতন-সফ্টওয়্যার প্রদানকারীদের জন্য উদ্দিষ্ট। আপনার বর্তমান পেস্লিপ বা নিয়োগকর্তার অনুমান থেকে পরিমাণ লিখুন।","How does the 13th salary work here?":"১৩তম বেতন এখানে কিভাবে কাজ করে?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"একটি নিয়মিত বেতন পেমেন্টের মোট পরিমাণ লিখুন এবং 13টি পেমেন্ট বেছে নিন। ক্যালকুলেটর প্রথমে মোট পরিমাণ বার্ষিক করে, বার্ষিক অবদানের সীমা প্রযোজ্য করে এবং 13টি অর্থপ্রদানের ফলে নেট অনুমানকে ভাগ করে।","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"ক্যান্টন কি AVS/AI/APG বা বেকারত্বের হার পরিবর্তন করে?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"এখানে ব্যবহৃত ফেডারেল কর্মচারীর হার দেশব্যাপী। ক্যান্টন-নির্দিষ্ট উত্স ট্যাক্স এবং অন্যান্য নিয়োগকর্তা বা পরিকল্পনার কাটতি স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে গণনা করা হয় না।","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"নিয়োগকর্তার ফেডারেল অবদান আলাদাভাবে দেখানো হয়েছে (আপনার নেট থেকে কাটা হয়নি)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"নিয়োগদাতা AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"নিয়োগকর্তা বেকারত্ব বীমা","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"ফেডারেল সংবিধিবদ্ধ হার শুধুমাত্র। নিয়োগকর্তা পেনশন, দুর্ঘটনা বীমা, পারিবারিক ভাতা তহবিল এবং ক্যান্টন-নির্দিষ্ট অবদান অন্তর্ভুক্ত নয়।"},"ru":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор сценария чистой зарплаты в Швейцарии","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Швейцарский калькулятор зарплат на 2026 год — сценарий от валовой к чистой заработной плате","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Оцените отчисления из заработной платы швейцарских сотрудников на 2026 год. См. федеральные AHV/IV/EO и взносы по безработице, затем введите сумму фактической пенсии, страхования от несчастных случаев и налога у источника для полезного сценария с 12 или 13 выплатами.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Разработайте практический сценарий расчета заработной платы в Швейцарии на 2026 год. Калькулятор оценивает взносы сотрудников по всей стране и вычитает пенсию, страхование от несчастных случаев, подоходный налог и другие вычеты, которые вы вводите из своих собственных документов по заработной плате.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Федеральные ставки одинаковы во всех кантонах, но ваш пенсионный план, страховой взнос за несчастный случай, не связанный с производством, и исходный налог зависят от вашего плана, работодателя и личного случая. Введите эти годовые суммы из расчетной ведомости или текущей оценки работодателя. Кантон и налоговый статус показаны для контекста; этот инструмент не восстанавливает кантональные таблицы исходного налога или годовой подоходный налог.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Для 8 000 швейцарских франков на одну выплату заработной платы и 13 выплат годовая валовая прибыль составляет 104 000 швейцарских франков. Взносы федеральных служащих рассчитываются на основе годовой зарплаты; введите годовой план и налоговые вычеты для оценки чистого сценария.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Брутто за одну регулярную выплату заработной платы (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Выплата заработной платы в год","12 payments":"12 платежей","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 выплат, включая 13-ю зарплату","Age in years":"Возраст в годах","Contribution situation":"Ситуация со взносом","Employee contributions apply":"Взимаются взносы сотрудников","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Пока не облагается взносами сотрудников","Working after AHV reference age":"Работа после референтного возраста AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Применить ежемесячное пособие AHV в размере 1400 швейцарских франков.","Canton for your payroll context":"Кантон для вашего контекста расчета заработной платы","Tax-at-source situation":"Ситуация с налогом у источника","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Не облагается налогом у источника/использовать годовой налог отдельно","Taxed at source":"Облагается налогом у источника","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Ежегодные удержания из ваших зарплатных документов (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Вычет из пенсии сотрудника (ежегодный)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Страхование от несчастных случаев на производстве (годовое)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Удержанный налог у источника (ежегодно)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Прочие отчисления сотрудникам (ежегодно)","Estimate net salary":"Оценить чистую зарплату","Reset example":"Пример сброса","2026 salary scenario":"Сценарий заработной платы на 2026 год","Gross salary per year":"Валовая зарплата в год","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Сотрудник AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Страхование по безработице для сотрудников","Pension deduction entered":"Пенсионный вычет введен","Accident insurance entered":"Введена страховка от несчастного случая","Source tax entered":"Введен исходный налог","Other deductions entered":"Введены другие вычеты","Total deductions shown":"Показана общая сумма вычетов","Estimated net per year":"Расчетная чистая прибыль в год","Average net per salary payment":"Средняя чистая выплата заработной платы","Average net per month":"Средняя чистая прибыль в месяц","AHV allowance applied":"Применена надбавка AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Введите свою брутто-зарплату и, если возможно, фактические годовые отчисления из заработной платы.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Сценарий рассчитан в вашем браузере.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Проверьте зарплату, возраст и суммы отчислений. Вычеты не могут превышать брутто-зарплату.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Выберите ситуацию с взносами, соответствующую вашей текущей заработной плате. Возраст сам по себе не определяет каждый особый случай.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Кантон здесь используется только в контексте. Он не меняет федеральные ставки взносов и не рассчитывает исходный налог.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Используйте годовую сумму, указанную вашим работодателем или в платежной ведомости. Для расчета индивидуального тарифа недостаточно кантона и языка.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Суммы пенсий и выплат по несчастным случаям различаются в зависимости от плана и работодателя. Если вы их не знаете, оставьте их равными нулю; результатом будет частичная оценка.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Обычный годовой подоходный налог не включен. Швейцарские сотрудники, которые не облагаются налогом у источника, обычно выплачивают его посредством ежегодной налоговой декларации, а не стандартного удержания из заработной платы.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Федеральная оценка заработной платы на 2026 год. Она предполагает работу одного сотрудника и полный год работы. Работа на неполный год, несколько работодателей, бонусы, трансграничные случаи, статус специального взноса и индивидуальное округление могут изменить заработную плату. Используйте заявление вашего работодателя для определения обязательной суммы.","Official 2026 references:":"Официальные ссылки на 2026 год:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO и ставки взносов ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Пороги профессиональной пенсии на 2026 год","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Это точная швейцарская расценка с зарплатой на дому?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Нет. Он оценивает установленные законом общенациональные взносы сотрудников и вычитает введенные вами годовые суммы заработной платы. Результат настолько же полон, насколько и эти входные данные.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Почему мне необходимо вводить пенсионные отчисления и отчисления по несчастным случаям?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Профессиональные пенсионные взносы зависят от пенсионного фонда и плана. Страховые премии за несчастные случаи, не связанные с производством, зависят от риска страховщика, отрасли и работодателя. Не существует какой-либо отдельной суммы работника, которую можно было бы вывести только из валовой заработной платы.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Может ли он рассчитать исходный налог в моем кантоне?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Нет. В тарифах исходного налога используются личные данные и данные о заработной плате, а опубликованные файлы предназначены для работодателей и поставщиков программного обеспечения для расчета заработной платы. Введите сумму из вашей текущей расчетной ведомости или оценки работодателя.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Как здесь работает 13-я зарплата?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Введите общую сумму одной регулярной выплаты заработной платы и выберите 13 выплат. Калькулятор сначала перечисляет валовую сумму в годовом исчислении, применяет годовые лимиты взносов и делит полученную чистую оценку на 13 платежей.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Изменяет ли кантон AVS/AI/APG или уровень безработицы?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Использованные здесь ставки федеральных служащих действительны для всей страны. Кантонский исходный налог и другие отчисления работодателя или плана не рассчитываются автоматически.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Федеральные взносы работодателя показаны отдельно (не вычитаются из вашей чистой суммы)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Работодатель AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Страхование работодателя по безработице","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Только федеральные тарифы. Пенсия работодателя, страхование от несчастных случаев, фонд семейных пособий и взносы кантона не включены."},"ur":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"سوئس نیٹ تنخواہ کا منظرنامہ کیلکولیٹر","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"سوئس تنخواہ کیلکولیٹر 2026 - مجموعی سے خالص تنخواہ کا منظر","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 کے لیے سوئس ملازمین کی تنخواہوں میں کٹوتیوں کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ وفاقی AHV/IV/EO اور بے روزگاری کی شراکتیں دیکھیں، پھر ایک مفید 12- یا 13-تنخواہ والے منظر نامے کے لیے اپنی اصل پنشن، ایکسیڈنٹ انشورنس اور سورس ٹیکس کی رقم درج کریں۔","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"ایک عملی 2026 سوئس پے سلپ منظر نامہ بنائیں۔ کیلکولیٹر ملک بھر میں ملازمین کی شراکت کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے اور پنشن، ایکسیڈنٹ انشورنس، ودہولڈنگ ٹیکس اور دیگر کٹوتیوں کو منہا کرتا ہے جو آپ اپنے پے رول دستاویزات سے درج کرتے ہیں۔\nUSN004 X وہ سالانہ رقم پے سلپ یا موجودہ آجر کے تخمینہ سے درج کریں۔ کینٹن اور ٹیکس کی حیثیت سیاق و سباق کے لیے دکھائی گئی ہے۔ یہ ٹول کینٹونل سورس ٹیکس ٹیبل یا سالانہ انکم ٹیکس کی تشکیل نو نہیں کرتا ہے۔","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"تمام کینٹنز میں وفاقی شرحیں یکساں ہیں، لیکن آپ کا پنشن پلان، غیر پیشہ ورانہ حادثے کا پریمیم اور سورس ٹیکس آپ کے پلان، آجر اور ذاتی کیس پر منحصر ہے۔ وہ سالانہ رقم پے سلپ یا موجودہ آجر کے تخمینہ سے درج کریں۔ کینٹن اور ٹیکس کی حیثیت سیاق و سباق کے لیے دکھائی گئی ہے۔ یہ ٹول کینٹونل سورس ٹیکس ٹیبل یا سالانہ انکم ٹیکس کی تشکیل نو نہیں کرتا ہے۔","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"CHF 8,000 فی تنخواہ کی ادائیگی اور 13 ادائیگیوں کے لیے، سالانہ مجموعی CHF 104,000 ہے۔ وفاقی ملازم کی شراکت کا تخمینہ سالانہ تنخواہ سے لگایا جاتا ہے۔ خالص منظر نامے کا تخمینہ لگانے کے لیے سالانہ منصوبہ اور ٹیکس کٹوتیاں درج کریں۔","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"ایک باقاعدہ تنخواہ کی ادائیگی کے لیے مجموعی (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"ہر سال تنخواہ کی ادائیگی","12 payments":"12 ادائیگیاں","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 ادائیگیاں، بشمول 13ویں تنخواہ","Age in years":"سالوں میں عمر","Contribution situation":"تعاون کی صورت حال","Employee contributions apply":"ملازمین کی شراکتیں لاگو ہوتی ہیں۔","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"ابھی تک ملازمین کے تعاون سے مشروط نہیں ہے۔","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV حوالہ جاتی عمر کے بعد کام کرنا","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 ماہانہ AHV الاؤنس کا اطلاق کریں۔","Canton for your payroll context":"آپ کے پے رول سیاق و سباق کے لیے کینٹن","Tax-at-source situation":"Tax-at-source صورتحال","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"ماخذ پر ٹیکس نہیں لگایا گیا/سالانہ ٹیکس الگ سے استعمال کریں۔","Taxed at source":"ذریعہ ٹیکس","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"آپ کے پے رول دستاویزات (CHF) سے سالانہ کٹوتیاں","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"ملازمین کی پنشن کی کٹوتی (سالانہ)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"غیر پیشہ ورانہ حادثاتی بیمہ (سالانہ)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"ماخذ ٹیکس روکا گیا (سالانہ)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"دیگر ملازمین کی کٹوتیاں (سالانہ)","Estimate net salary":"نیٹ تنخواہ کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Reset example":"ری سیٹ مثال","2026 salary scenario":"2026 تنخواہ کا منظرنامہ","Gross salary per year":"ہر سال مجموعی تنخواہ","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"ملازم AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"ملازمین کی بے روزگاری انشورنس","Pension deduction entered":"پنشن کی کٹوتی درج کر دی گئی۔","Accident insurance entered":"حادثہ بیمہ درج کیا گیا۔","Source tax entered":"ماخذ ٹیکس درج کیا گیا۔","Other deductions entered":"دیگر کٹوتیاں درج کی گئیں۔","Total deductions shown":"کل کٹوتیاں دکھائی گئیں۔","Estimated net per year":"تخمینہ خالص فی سال","Average net per salary payment":"اوسط خالص فی تنخواہ ادائیگی","Average net per month":"ہر ماہ اوسط نیٹ","AHV allowance applied":"AHV الاؤنس لاگو","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"اپنی مجموعی تنخواہ اور، اگر دستیاب ہو تو، اصل سالانہ تنخواہ کی کٹوتیاں درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"آپ کے براؤزر میں شمار کردہ منظرنامہ۔","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"تنخواہ، عمر اور کٹوتی کی رقم چیک کریں۔ کٹوتیاں مجموعی تنخواہ سے زیادہ نہیں ہو سکتیں۔","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"صرف عمر ہر خاص معاملے کا تعین نہیں کرتی۔","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton صرف یہاں سیاق و سباق ہے۔ یہ وفاقی شراکت کی شرحوں کو تبدیل نہیں کرتا ہے یا ذریعہ ٹیکس کا حساب نہیں لگاتا ہے۔","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"اپنے آجر کی طرف سے دکھائی گئی سالانہ رقم یا پے سلپ استعمال کریں۔ ایک کینٹن اور زبان انفرادی ٹیرف کا حساب لگانے کے لیے کافی نہیں ہیں۔","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"پنشن اور حادثے کی رقم پلان اور آجر کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتی ہے۔ اگر آپ انہیں نہیں جانتے تو انہیں صفر پر چھوڑ دیں۔ نتیجہ ایک جزوی تخمینہ ہو گا.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"عام سالانہ انکم ٹیکس شامل نہیں ہے۔ سوئس ملازمین جن پر ماخذ پر ٹیکس نہیں لگایا جاتا ہے وہ اسے عام طور پر سالانہ ٹیکس ریٹرن کے ذریعے طے کرتے ہیں، نہ کہ معیاری پے سلپ ودہولڈنگ کے ذریعے۔","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"پارٹ ایئر ملازمتیں، متعدد آجر، بونس، سرحد پار کے معاملات، خصوصی شراکت کی حیثیت اور انفرادی راؤنڈنگ پے رول کو تبدیل کر سکتی ہے۔ پابند رقم کے لیے اپنے آجر کا بیان استعمال کریں۔","Official 2026 references:":"سرکاری 2026 حوالہ جات:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO اور ALV شراکت کی شرحیں۔","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 پیشہ ورانہ پنشن کی حد","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"کیا یہ درست سوئس ٹیک ہوم پے کا حوالہ ہے؟","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"No یہ قانونی ملک گیر ملازمین کی شراکت کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے اور سالانہ تنخواہ کے لحاظ سے جو رقم آپ داخل کرتے ہیں اسے گھٹا دیتا ہے۔ نتیجہ صرف اتنا ہی مکمل ہے جتنا کہ ان پٹس۔","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"مجھے پنشن اور حادثاتی کٹوتیوں کو کیوں داخل کرنا ہوگا؟","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"پیشہ ور پنشن کی شراکت پنشن فنڈ اور پلان پر منحصر ہے۔ غیر پیشہ ورانہ حادثے کے پریمیم کا انحصار بیمہ کنندہ، صنعت اور آجر کے خطرے پر ہوتا ہے۔ ملازم کی کوئی رقم نہیں ہے جس کا اندازہ صرف مجموعی تنخواہ سے لگایا جا سکتا ہے۔","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"کیا یہ میرے کینٹن سے سورس ٹیکس کا حساب لگا سکتا ہے؟","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"No ماخذ ٹیکس ٹیرف ذاتی اور پے رول کی تفصیلات استعمال کرتے ہیں اور شائع شدہ فائلیں آجروں اور پے رول سافٹ ویئر فراہم کرنے والوں کے لیے ہیں۔ اپنی موجودہ پے سلپ یا آجر کے تخمینہ سے رقم درج کریں۔","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13ویں تنخواہ یہاں کیسے کام کرتی ہے؟","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"ایک باقاعدہ تنخواہ کی ادائیگی کی مجموعی رقم درج کریں اور 13 ادائیگیوں کا انتخاب کریں۔ کیلکولیٹر پہلے مجموعی رقم کو سالانہ بناتا ہے، سالانہ شراکت کی حدوں کا اطلاق کرتا ہے، اور نتیجے میں آنے والے خالص تخمینہ کو 13 ادائیگیوں میں تقسیم کرتا ہے۔","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"کیا کینٹن AVS/AI/APG یا بے روزگاری کی شرح کو تبدیل کرتا ہے؟","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"یہاں استعمال ہونے والے وفاقی ملازمین کے نرخ ملک گیر ہیں۔ کینٹن کے لیے مخصوص ذریعہ ٹیکس اور دوسرے آجر یا پلان کی کٹوتیوں کا خود بخود حساب نہیں لگایا جاتا ہے۔","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"آجر کے وفاقی تعاون کو الگ سے دکھایا گیا ہے (آپ کے نیٹ سے کٹوتی نہیں کی گئی ہے)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"آجر AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"آجر کی بے روزگاری انشورنس","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"صرف وفاقی قانونی شرحیں۔ آجر کی پنشن، ایکسیڈنٹ انشورنس، فیملی الاؤنس فنڈ اور کینٹن کے لیے مخصوص تعاون شامل نہیں ہیں۔"},"tr":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"İsviçre Net Maaş Senaryosu Hesaplayıcı","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"İsviçre Maaş Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Brütten Net Maaş Senaryosuna","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 için İsviçreli çalışanların maaş bordrosu kesintilerini tahmin edin. Federal AHV/IV/EO ve işsizlik katkı paylarına bakın, ardından yararlı bir 12 veya 13 ödeme senaryosu için gerçek emeklilik, kaza sigortası ve kaynak vergisi tutarlarınızı girin.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Pratik bir 2026 İsviçre maaş bordrosu senaryosu oluşturun. Hesaplayıcı, ülke çapındaki çalışan katkı paylarını tahmin eder ve kendi maaş bordrosu belgelerinizden girdiğiniz emeklilik, kaza sigortası, stopaj vergisi ve diğer kesintileri çıkarır.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Federal oranlar kantonlar arasında aynıdır ancak emeklilik planınız, iş dışı kaza priminiz ve kaynak verginiz planınıza, işvereninize ve kişisel durumunuza bağlıdır. Bu yıllık tutarları maaş bordrosundan veya mevcut işveren tahmininden girin. Kanton ve vergi durumu bağlam açısından gösterilmiştir; bu araç kanton kaynak vergisi tablolarını veya yıllık gelir vergisini yeniden yapılandırmaz.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Maaş başına 8.000 CHF ve 13 ödeme için yıllık brüt 104.000 CHF'dir. Federal çalışanların katkıları yıllık maaştan tahmin edilmektedir; Net senaryoyu tahmin etmek için yıllık planı ve vergi kesintilerini girin.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Bir düzenli maaş ödemesi için brüt (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Yıllık maaş ödemeleri","12 payments":"12 ödemeleri","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 ödeme, 13. maaş dahil","Age in years":"Yıl olarak yaş","Contribution situation":"Katkı durumu","Employee contributions apply":"Çalışan katkıları geçerlidir","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Henüz çalışan katkılarına tabi değil","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV referans yaşından sonra çalışma","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Aylık 1.400 CHF AHV ödeneğini uygulayın","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton","Tax-at-source situation":"Kaynakta vergi durumu","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Kaynağa göre vergilendirilmez / yıllık vergiyi ayrı olarak kullanın","Taxed at source":"Kaynağında vergilendirilir","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Maaş bordrosu belgelerinizden yıllık kesintiler (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Çalışan emekli maaşı kesintisi (yıllık)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"İş dışı kaza sigortası (yıllık)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Kaynak vergisi stopajı (yıllık)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Diğer çalışan kesintileri (yıllık)","Estimate net salary":"Tahmini net maaş","Reset example":"Sıfırlama örneği","2026 salary scenario":"2026 maaş senaryosu","Gross salary per year":"Yıllık brüt maaş","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Çalışan AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Çalışan işsizlik sigortası","Pension deduction entered":"Emeklilik kesintisi girildi","Accident insurance entered":"Kaza sigortası girildi","Source tax entered":"Kaynak vergisi girildi","Other deductions entered":"Diğer kesintiler girildi","Total deductions shown":"Gösterilen toplam kesintiler","Estimated net per year":"Yıllık tahmini net","Average net per salary payment":"Maaş ödemesi başına ortalama net","Average net per month":"Aylık ortalama net","AHV allowance applied":"AHV ödeneği uygulandı","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Brüt maaşınızı ve varsa fiili yıllık bordro kesintilerinizi girin.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Senaryo tarayıcınızda hesaplandı.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Maaş, yaş ve kesinti tutarlarını kontrol edin. Kesintiler brüt maaşı aşamaz.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Mevcut maaş bordronuzla eşleşen katkı durumunu seçin. Yaş tek başına her özel durumu belirlemez.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton yalnızca burada bağlamdır. Federal katkı oranlarını değiştirmez veya kaynak vergisini hesaplamaz.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"İşvereninizin veya maaş bordronuzun gösterdiği yıllık tutarı kullanın. Bireysel tarife hesaplamak için kanton ve dil yeterli değildir.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Emeklilik ve kaza tutarları plana ve işverene göre değişir. Bilmiyorsanız sıfırda bırakın; sonuç kısmi bir tahmin olacaktır.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Olağan yıllık gelir vergisi dahil değildir. Kaynağında vergilendirilmeyen İsviçreli çalışanlar, bu sorunu genellikle standart maaş bordrosu stopajıyla değil, yıllık vergi beyannamesi yoluyla çözüyor.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026 tarihli federal maaş bordrosu tahmini. Bir çalışanın işini ve bir tam yılı varsayar. Yarı yıllık işler, birden fazla işveren, ikramiyeler, sınır ötesi davalar, özel katkı statüsü ve bireysel yuvarlama maaş bordrosunu değiştirebilir. Bağlayıcı tutar için işveren beyanınızı kullanın.","Official 2026 references:":"Resmi 2026 referansları:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO ve ALV katkı oranları","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 mesleki emeklilik eşikleri","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Bu tam olarak İsviçre'nin eve götürdüğü ödeme teklifi mi?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Hayır. Ülke çapındaki yasal çalışan katkılarını tahmin eder ve girdiğiniz yıllık maaş bordrosuna özgü tutarları çıkarır. Sonuç ancak bu girdiler kadar eksiksizdir.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Neden emeklilik ve kaza kesintilerine girmem gerekiyor?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Mesleki emeklilik katkı payları emeklilik fonuna ve planına bağlıdır. İş dışı kaza primleri sigortacı, sektör ve işveren riskine bağlıdır. Yalnızca brüt maaştan çıkarılabilecek tek bir çalışan tutarı bulunmamaktadır.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Benim kantonumdaki kaynak vergisini hesaplayabilir mi?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Hayır. Kaynak vergi tarifeleri kişisel bilgileri ve bordro ayrıntılarını kullanır ve yayınlanan dosyalar işverenlere ve bordro yazılımı sağlayıcılarına yöneliktir. Mevcut maaş bordronuzdaki veya işveren tahmininizdeki tutarı girin.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Burada 13. maaş nasıl işliyor?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Bir düzenli maaş ödemesinin brüt tutarını girin ve 13 ödemeyi seçin. Hesaplayıcı öncelikle brüt tutarı yıllıklaştırır, yıllık katkı limitlerini uygular ve ortaya çıkan net tahmini 13 ödemeye böler.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Kanton AVS/AI/APG'yi veya işsizlik oranlarını değiştiriyor mu?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Burada kullanılan federal çalışan oranları ülke çapındadır. Kantona özgü kaynak vergisi ve diğer işveren veya plan kesintileri otomatik olarak hesaplanmaz.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"İşveren federal katkıları ayrı olarak gösterilir (netinizden kesilmez)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"İşveren AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"İşveren işsizlik sigortası","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Yalnızca federal yasal oranlar. İşveren emekliliği, kaza sigortası, aile yardım fonu ve kantona özel katkılar dahil değildir."},"vi":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Máy tính kịch bản lương ròng của Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Công cụ tính lương của Thụy Sĩ năm 2026 — Kịch bản tổng lương thành ròng","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Ước tính các khoản khấu trừ vào lương của nhân viên Thụy Sĩ cho năm 2026. Xem AHV/IV/EO của liên bang và các khoản đóng góp thất nghiệp, sau đó nhập số tiền lương hưu, bảo hiểm tai nạn và thuế nguồn thực tế của bạn để có kịch bản trả lương 12 hoặc 13 hữu ích.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Xây dựng kịch bản phiếu lương Thụy Sĩ năm 2026 thực tế. Máy tính ước tính các khoản đóng góp của nhân viên trên toàn quốc và trừ đi lương hưu, bảo hiểm tai nạn, thuế khấu trừ và các khoản khấu trừ khác mà bạn nhập từ tài liệu bảng lương của chính mình.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Các mức thuế liên bang giống nhau ở các bang, nhưng kế hoạch lương hưu, phí bảo hiểm tai nạn phi nghề nghiệp và thuế nguồn phụ thuộc vào kế hoạch, chủ lao động và trường hợp cá nhân của bạn. Nhập số tiền hàng năm đó từ phiếu lương hoặc ước tính của nhà tuyển dụng hiện tại. Trạng thái bang và thuế được hiển thị theo ngữ cảnh; công cụ này không xây dựng lại các bảng thuế nguồn hoặc thuế thu nhập hàng năm của bang.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Đối với 8.000 CHF cho mỗi lần thanh toán lương và 13 lần thanh toán, tổng doanh thu hàng năm là 104.000 CHF. Đóng góp của nhân viên liên bang được ước tính từ tiền lương hàng năm; nhập kế hoạch hàng năm và các khoản khấu trừ thuế để ước tính kịch bản thực.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Tổng cho một lần thanh toán lương định kỳ (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Trả lương mỗi năm","12 payments":"12 khoản thanh toán","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 khoản thanh toán, bao gồm lương thứ 13","Age in years":"Tuổi tính theo năm","Contribution situation":"Tình hình đóng góp","Employee contributions apply":"Áp dụng đóng góp của nhân viên","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Chưa chịu sự đóng góp của nhân viên","Working after AHV reference age":"Làm việc sau tuổi tham chiếu AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Áp dụng khoản trợ cấp AHV 1.400 CHF hàng tháng","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton cho bối cảnh bảng lương của bạn","Tax-at-source situation":"Tình hình thuế tại nguồn","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Không bị đánh thuế tại nguồn / thuế sử dụng hàng năm riêng","Taxed at source":"Thuế tại nguồn","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Các khoản khấu trừ hàng năm từ tài liệu bảng lương của bạn (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Khấu trừ lương hưu của nhân viên (hàng năm)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Bảo hiểm tai nạn phi nghề nghiệp (hàng năm)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Thuế nguồn được khấu trừ (hàng năm)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Các khoản khấu trừ nhân viên khác (hàng năm)","Estimate net salary":"Ước tính mức lương ròng","Reset example":"Ví dụ đặt lại","2026 salary scenario":"2026 kịch bản lương","Gross salary per year":"Tổng lương mỗi năm","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Nhân viên AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Bảo hiểm thất nghiệp cho nhân viên","Pension deduction entered":"Đã nhập khoản khấu trừ lương hưu","Accident insurance entered":"Đã nhập bảo hiểm tai nạn","Source tax entered":"Đã nhập thuế nguồn","Other deductions entered":"Các khoản khấu trừ khác đã được nhập","Total deductions shown":"Tổng số khoản khấu trừ được hiển thị","Estimated net per year":"Số ròng ước tính mỗi năm","Average net per salary payment":"Thanh toán ròng trung bình trên mỗi lương","Average net per month":"Net trung bình mỗi tháng","AHV allowance applied":"Phụ cấp AHV được áp dụng","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Nhập tổng lương của bạn và các khoản khấu trừ lương thực tế hàng năm, nếu có.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Kịch bản được tính toán trong trình duyệt của bạn.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Kiểm tra mức lương, tuổi và số tiền khấu trừ. Các khoản khấu trừ không thể vượt quá tổng lương.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Chọn tình huống đóng góp phù hợp với bảng lương hiện tại của bạn. Chỉ riêng tuổi tác không quyết định được mọi trường hợp đặc biệt.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton chỉ có ngữ cảnh ở đây. Nó không thay đổi tỷ lệ đóng góp của liên bang hoặc tính thuế nguồn.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Sử dụng số tiền hàng năm do chủ lao động của bạn hiển thị hoặc phiếu lương. Một bang và ngôn ngữ là không đủ để tính toán mức thuế riêng lẻ.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Số tiền trợ cấp và tai nạn khác nhau tùy theo chương trình và người sử dụng lao động. Nếu bạn không biết chúng, hãy để chúng ở mức 0; kết quả sẽ là một ước tính một phần.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Không bao gồm thuế thu nhập thông thường hàng năm. Những nhân viên Thụy Sĩ không bị đánh thuế tại nguồn thường giải quyết vấn đề này thông qua tờ khai thuế hàng năm chứ không phải khấu trừ phiếu lương tiêu chuẩn.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Ước tính bảng lương liên bang năm 2026. Nó giả định một công việc của nhân viên và cả năm. Công việc bán thời gian, nhiều người sử dụng lao động, tiền thưởng, trường hợp xuyên biên giới, trạng thái đóng góp đặc biệt và làm tròn số cá nhân có thể thay đổi bảng lương. Sử dụng tuyên bố sử dụng lao động của bạn cho số tiền ràng buộc.","Official 2026 references:":"Tài liệu tham khảo chính thức năm 2026:\nTỷ lệ đóng góp","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO và ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 ngưỡng lương hưu nghề nghiệp","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Đây có phải là báo giá chính xác về khoản thanh toán tại nhà của Thụy Sĩ không?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Không. Nó ước tính các khoản đóng góp của nhân viên theo luật định trên toàn quốc và trừ đi số tiền cụ thể trong bảng lương hàng năm mà bạn nhập. Kết quả chỉ đầy đủ như những đầu vào đó.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Tại sao tôi phải nhập các khoản khấu trừ lương hưu và tai nạn?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Đóng góp lương hưu nghề nghiệp phụ thuộc vào quỹ hưu trí và kế hoạch. Phí bảo hiểm tai nạn phi nghề nghiệp phụ thuộc vào rủi ro của công ty bảo hiểm, ngành và người sử dụng lao động. Không có số tiền nhân viên nào có thể được suy ra chỉ từ tổng lương.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Nó có thể tính thuế nguồn từ bang của tôi không?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Không. Biểu thuế nguồn sử dụng chi tiết cá nhân và bảng lương và các tệp được xuất bản là dành cho người sử dụng lao động và nhà cung cấp phần mềm tính lương. Nhập số tiền từ phiếu lương hiện tại của bạn hoặc ước tính của nhà tuyển dụng.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Lương thứ 13 ở đây hoạt động như thế nào?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Nhập tổng số tiền của một khoản lương thông thường và chọn 13 khoản thanh toán. Trước tiên, máy tính sẽ tính tổng số tiền hàng năm, áp dụng giới hạn đóng góp hàng năm và chia ước tính ròng thu được cho 13 khoản thanh toán.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Bang có thay đổi AVS/AI/APG hoặc tỷ lệ thất nghiệp không?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Mức lương nhân viên liên bang được sử dụng ở đây là trên toàn quốc. Thuế nguồn cụ thể của từng bang và các khoản khấu trừ từ chủ lao động hoặc chương trình khác không được tính tự động.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Các khoản đóng góp liên bang của nhà tuyển dụng được hiển thị riêng (không được khấu trừ khỏi mạng của bạn)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Chủ đầu tư AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Bảo hiểm thất nghiệp của người sử dụng lao động","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Chỉ theo tỷ lệ luật định của liên bang. Không bao gồm lương hưu của người sử dụng lao động, bảo hiểm tai nạn, quỹ trợ cấp gia đình và các khoản đóng góp cụ thể của bang."},"it":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Calcolatore dello scenario salariale netto svizzero","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Calcolatore salariale svizzero 2026 — Scenario retribuzione lorda/netta","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Stima delle detrazioni sui salari dei dipendenti svizzeri per il 2026. Consulta l'AVS/AI/IPG federale e i contributi di disoccupazione, quindi inserisci gli importi effettivi della pensione, dell'assicurazione contro gli infortuni e dell'imposta alla fonte per un utile scenario di 12 o 13 retribuzioni.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Costruisci uno scenario pratico per la busta paga svizzera del 2026. Il calcolatore stima i contributi dei dipendenti a livello nazionale e sottrae la pensione, l'assicurazione contro gli infortuni, la ritenuta d'acconto e altre detrazioni inserite dai documenti del libro paga.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Le aliquote federali sono le stesse in tutti i cantoni, ma il piano pensionistico, il premio per gli infortuni non professionali e l'imposta alla fonte dipendono dal piano, dal datore di lavoro e dal caso personale. Inserisci gli importi annuali da una busta paga o dalla stima attuale del datore di lavoro. Il cantone e lo status fiscale sono mostrati per contesto; questo strumento non ricostruisce le tabelle cantonali dell'imposta alla fonte né l'imposta annuale sul reddito.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Per CHF 8'000 per salario e 13 pagamenti, il lordo annuo è di CHF 104'000. I contributi dei dipendenti federali sono stimati a partire dallo stipendio annuo; inserire piano annuale e detrazioni fiscali per stimare lo scenario netto.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Lordo per un pagamento regolare dello stipendio (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Pagamenti salariali annuali","12 payments":"12 pagamenti","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pagamenti, incluso il 13° stipendio","Age in years":"Età in anni","Contribution situation":"Situazione contributiva","Employee contributions apply":"Si applicano i contributi dei dipendenti","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Non ancora soggetto ai contributi dei dipendenti","Working after AHV reference age":"Lavorare dopo l'età di riferimento AVS","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Applica l'indennità AVS mensile di CHF 1400","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton per il contesto delle buste paga","Tax-at-source situation":"Situazione fiscale alla fonte","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Non tassato alla fonte/utilizza la tassa annuale separatamente","Taxed at source":"Imposta alla fonte","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Detrazioni annuali dai documenti del libro paga (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Detrazione pensione del dipendente (annuale)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Assicurazione contro gli infortuni non professionali (annuale)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Imposta alla fonte trattenuta (annuale)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Altre detrazioni dipendenti (annuali)","Estimate net salary":"Stipendio netto stimato","Reset example":"Esempio di reimpostazione","2026 salary scenario":"Scenario salariale 2026","Gross salary per year":"Stipendio lordo annuo","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Dipendente AVS/AI/IPG","Employee unemployment insurance":"Assicurazione contro la disoccupazione dei dipendenti","Pension deduction entered":"Detrazione pensione inserita","Accident insurance entered":"Assicurazione infortuni inserita","Source tax entered":"Imposta sorgente inserita","Other deductions entered":"Altre detrazioni immesse","Total deductions shown":"Detrazioni totali mostrate","Estimated net per year":"Netto stimato per anno","Average net per salary payment":"Pagamento medio netto per stipendio","Average net per month":"Netto medio al mese","AHV allowance applied":"Indennità AVS applicata","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Inserisci il tuo stipendio lordo e, se disponibili, le trattenute annuali effettive sulla retribuzione.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario calcolato nel tuo browser.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Verificare lo stipendio, l'età e gli importi delle detrazioni. Le trattenute non possono superare la retribuzione lorda.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Scegli la situazione contributiva che corrisponde alla tua busta paga attuale. L’età da sola non determina ogni caso particolare.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton è contestuale solo qui. Non modifica le aliquote contributive federali né calcola l’imposta alla fonte.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Utilizza l'importo annuo indicato dal tuo datore di lavoro o dalla busta paga. Per calcolare una tariffa individuale non bastano il cantone e la lingua.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Gli importi delle pensioni e degli infortuni variano in base al piano e al datore di lavoro. Se non li conosci, lasciali a zero; il risultato sarà una stima parziale.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"L'imposta ordinaria sul reddito annuale non è inclusa. I dipendenti svizzeri che non sono tassati alla fonte generalmente pagano il pagamento tramite una dichiarazione dei redditi annuale, non con una trattenuta standard sulla busta paga.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Stima del libro paga federale datata 2026. Si presuppone un lavoro dipendente e un anno intero. Lavori parziali, più datori di lavoro, bonus, casi transfrontalieri, status contributivo speciale e arrotondamenti individuali possono modificare le buste paga. Utilizza la dichiarazione del tuo datore di lavoro per l'importo vincolante.","Official 2026 references:":"Riferimenti ufficiali 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Aliquote contributive AVS/IV/EO e ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Soglie pensionistiche professionali 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Si tratta di un preventivo svizzero esatto da portare a casa?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"No. Stima i contributi legali dei dipendenti a livello nazionale e sottrae gli importi annuali specifici della busta paga inseriti. Il risultato è completo solo quanto questi input.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Perché devo inserire le trattenute pensionistiche e infortuni?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"I contributi pensionistici professionali dipendono dal fondo pensione e dal piano. I premi per gli infortuni non professionali dipendono dal rischio dell’assicuratore, del settore e del datore di lavoro. Non esiste un importo unico per dipendente che possa essere dedotto solo dalla retribuzione lorda.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Può calcolare l'imposta alla fonte del mio cantone?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"No. Le tariffe dell'imposta alla fonte utilizzano dati personali e salariali e i file pubblicati sono destinati ai datori di lavoro e ai fornitori di software per la gestione dei salari. Inserisci l'importo dalla tua busta paga attuale o dalla stima del datore di lavoro.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Come funziona il 13° stipendio qui?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Inserisci l'importo lordo di un pagamento regolare dello stipendio e scegli 13 pagamenti. Il calcolatore annualizza innanzitutto l'importo lordo, applica i limiti di contributo annuale e divide la stima netta risultante tra i 13 pagamenti.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Il Cantone modifica AVS/AI/APG o tassi di disoccupazione?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Le tariffe per i dipendenti federali utilizzate qui sono a livello nazionale. L'imposta alla fonte specifica del cantone e altre detrazioni del datore di lavoro o del piano non vengono calcolate automaticamente.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Contributi federali del datore di lavoro mostrati separatamente (non detratti dalla rete)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Datore di lavoro AVS/AI/IPG","Employer unemployment insurance":"Assicurazione contro la disoccupazione del datore di lavoro","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Solo tariffe legali federali. Sono esclusi la pensione del datore di lavoro, l'assicurazione contro gli infortuni, il fondo per gli assegni familiari e i contributi cantonali."},"zh_tw":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"瑞士淨工資情境計算器","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"2026 年瑞士薪資計算器 — 毛薪到淨薪情景","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"估計 2026 年瑞士員工薪資扣除額。查看聯邦 AHV/IV/EO 和失業繳款，然後輸入您的實際退休金、意外保險和來源稅金額，以適用於有用的 12 或 13 工資方案。","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"建立實用的 2026 年瑞士薪資場景。計算器估算全國範圍內的員工繳款，並減去退休金、意外保險、預扣稅和您從自己的薪資單文件中輸入的其他扣除額。","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"各州的聯邦稅率相同，但您的退休金計劃、非職業事故保費和來源稅取決於您的計劃、雇主和個人情況。輸入薪資單或目前雇主估算中的年度金額。顯示州和稅務狀況以供參考；該工具不會重建州源稅表或年度所得稅。","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"每次薪資支付 8,000 瑞士法郎並分 13 次支付，年度總額為 104,000 瑞士法郎。聯邦僱員繳款是根據年薪估算；輸入年度計劃和稅收減免來估計淨情景。","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"一筆定期薪資支付總額（瑞士法郎）","Salary payments per year":"每年支付工資","12 payments":"12 筆付款","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13筆付款，包括第13筆薪資","Age in years":"年齡（歲）","Contribution situation":"貢獻狀況","Employee contributions apply":"員工繳款適用","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"尚未繳納員工繳款","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV參考年齡後工作","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"申請每月 1,400 瑞士法郎的 AHV 津貼","Canton for your payroll context":"廣州為您提供薪資環境","Tax-at-source situation":"源頭稅狀況","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"源頭不課稅/單獨使用年稅","Taxed at source":"源頭徵稅","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"從您的薪資文件中每年扣除（瑞士法郎）","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"員工退休金扣除（每年）","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"非職業意外保險（每年）","Source tax withheld (annual)":"來源稅預扣（年度）","Other employee deductions (annual)":"其他員工扣除額（年度）","Estimate net salary":"估計淨工資","Reset example":"重置範例","2026 salary scenario":"2026年薪資情景","Gross salary per year":"每年總工資","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"員工 AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"勞工失業保險","Pension deduction entered":"退休金扣除已輸入","Accident insurance entered":"已入意外險","Source tax entered":"輸入源稅","Other deductions entered":"輸入的其他扣除額","Total deductions shown":"顯示的總扣除額","Estimated net per year":"估計每年淨值","Average net per salary payment":"平均每筆工資淨額","Average net per month":"每月平均淨值","AHV allowance applied":"已應用 AHV 津貼","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"輸入您的薪資總額以及實際年度薪資扣除額（如果有）。","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"在您的瀏覽器中計算的場景。","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"查看工資、年齡和扣除金額。扣除額不能超過工資總額。","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"選擇與您目前薪資單相符的繳款情況。年齡本身並不能決定所有特殊情況。","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"廣州僅是此處的上下文。它不會改變聯邦繳款率或計算來源稅。","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"使用您的雇主或薪資單顯示的年度金額。州和語言不足以計算個人關稅。","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"退休金和事故金額因計劃和雇主而異。如果您不知道它們，請將它們保留為零；結果將是部分估計。","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"不含普通年所得稅。不在源頭徵稅的瑞士員工通常透過年度報稅表而不是標準薪資預扣稅來解決。","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026 年聯邦薪資預估。它假設一名員工工作和一整年。半年工作、多個雇主、獎金、跨國案件、特殊繳款狀態和個人四捨五入都可能改變薪資單。使用您的雇主聲明來確定具有約束力的金額。","Official 2026 references:":"2026 年官方參考文獻：","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO 和 ALV 貢獻率","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026年職業退休金起徵點","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"這是瑞士的實質薪資報價嗎？","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"編號它估算全國範圍內的法定僱員繳款，並減去您輸入的年度工資特定金額。結果僅與這些輸入一樣完整。","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"為什麼我必須輸入退休金和意外扣除？","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"職業退休金繳款取決於退休基金和計劃。非職業事故保費取決於保險公司、產業和雇主的風險。僅從總薪資中無法推斷出單一員工的金額。","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"可以計算我所在州的來源稅嗎？","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"編號來源稅關稅使用個人和工資詳細信息，發布的文件適用於雇主和工資軟體提供者。輸入您目前薪資單或雇主估算的金額。","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13薪在這裡如何發揮作用？","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"輸入一筆定期薪資付款的總額並選擇 13 筆付款。計算器首先將總額年度化，以應用年度繳款限額，然後將所得的淨估算值除以 13 筆付款。","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"各州是否會改變 AVS/AI/APG 或失業率？","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"此處使用的聯邦僱員費率為全國範圍內的費率。州特定源稅和其他雇主或計劃扣除額不會自動計算。","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"單獨顯示的雇主聯邦繳款（不從您的淨額中扣除）","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"雇主 AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"雇主失業保險","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"僅限聯邦法定費率。雇主退休金、意外保險、家庭津貼基金和各州特定繳款不包括在內。"},"bg":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Калкулатор за сценарий за нетна заплата в Швейцария","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Калкулатор на заплата в Швейцария 2026 г. — Сценарий от бруто към нетно заплащане","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Оценете удръжките от заплатите на швейцарските служители за 2026 г. Вижте федералните AHV/IV/EO и вноските за безработица, след това въведете сумите на действителната си пенсия, застраховка срещу злополука и данък източник за полезен сценарий с 12 или 13 заплати.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Изградете практичен сценарий за швейцарски фиш за 2026 г. Калкулаторът изчислява вноските на служителите в цялата страна и изважда пенсията, застраховката срещу злополука, данъка, удържан при източника, и други удръжки, които въвеждате от вашите собствени документи за заплати.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Федералните ставки са еднакви за всички кантони, но вашият пенсионен план, премия за непрофесионална злополука и данък източник зависят от вашия план, работодател и личен случай. Въведете тези годишни суми от фиш за заплати или текуща оценка на работодателя. Кантонът и данъчният статус са показани за контекст; този инструмент не реконструира кантонални таблици с данък източник или годишен данък върху дохода.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"За 8 000 CHF на плащане на заплата и 13 плащания, годишната брутна сума е 104 000 CHF. Вноските на федералните служители се изчисляват от годишната заплата; въведете годишен план и данъчни удръжки, за да оцените нетния сценарий.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Бруто за едно редовно плащане на заплата (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Плащания на заплати на година","12 payments":"12 плащания","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 плащания, включително 13-та заплата","Age in years":"Възраст в години","Contribution situation":"Ситуация с принос","Employee contributions apply":"Прилагат се вноски на служителите","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Все още не подлежи на вноски на служителите","Working after AHV reference age":"Работа след референтна възраст за AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Приложете месечната надбавка от AHV от 1400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Кантон за вашия контекст на заплатите","Tax-at-source situation":"Ситуация с данък при източника","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Не се облага с данък при източника / използва годишен данък отделно","Taxed at source":"Облага се с данък при източника","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Годишни удръжки от вашите документи за заплати (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Удръжка от пенсия на служители (годишно)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Застраховка за непрофесионална злополука (годишна)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Удържан данък на източника (годишен)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Други удръжки на служители (годишно)","Estimate net salary":"Приблизителна нетна заплата","Reset example":"Пример за нулиране","2026 salary scenario":"2026 сценарий за заплата","Gross salary per year":"Брутна заплата на година","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Служител AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Застраховка за безработица на служителите","Pension deduction entered":"Въведено е приспадане на пенсия","Accident insurance entered":"Въведена е застраховка срещу злополука","Source tax entered":"Въведен е данък на източника","Other deductions entered":"Въведени са други удръжки","Total deductions shown":"Общо показани удръжки","Estimated net per year":"Прогнозна нетна стойност на година","Average net per salary payment":"Средно нетно плащане на заплата","Average net per month":"Средно нето на месец","AHV allowance applied":"Приложено е надбавка за AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Въведете брутната си заплата и, ако има такива, действителните годишни удръжки по ведомостта.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Сценарий, изчислен във вашия браузър.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Проверете сумите на заплатата, възрастта и удръжките. Удръжките не могат да надвишават брутната заплата.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Изберете ситуацията с вноските, която съответства на текущата ви заплата. Само възрастта не определя всеки специален случай.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Кантон е контекст само тук. Той не променя федералните ставки за вноски или изчислява данъка на източника.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Използвайте годишната сума, показана от вашия работодател или фиш за заплати. Кантон и език не са достатъчни за изчисляване на индивидуална тарифа.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Сумите за пенсия и злополука варират според плана и работодателя. Ако не ги знаете, оставете ги на нула; резултатът ще бъде частична оценка.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Обикновеният годишен данък върху дохода не е включен. Швейцарските служители, които не се облагат с данък при източника, обикновено го уреждат чрез годишна данъчна декларация, а не чрез стандартен фиш за заплати.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Федерална оценка на заплатите от 2026 г. Предполага работа на един служител и цяла година. Работа на непълна година, множество работодатели, бонуси, трансгранични случаи, статут на специални вноски и индивидуално закръгляване могат да променят ведомостта. Използвайте извлечението от вашия работодател за обвързващата сума.","Official 2026 references:":"Официални справки за 2026 г.:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO и ALV вноски","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 прагове за професионална пенсия","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Това ли е точната швейцарска оферта за плащане вкъщи?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Бр. Той оценява законоустановените вноски на служителите в цялата страна и изважда годишните суми, специфични за заплатите, които въвеждате. Резултатът е толкова пълен, колкото и тези входове.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Защо трябва да въвеждам удръжки за пенсия и злополука?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Вноските за професионална пенсия зависят от пенсионния фонд и плана. Премиите за непрофесионална злополука зависят от риска на застрахователя, индустрията и работодателя. Няма единична сума за служител, която може да бъде изведена само от брутната заплата.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Може ли да изчисли данък източник от моя кантон?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Не. Тарифите за данък източник използват лични данни и данни за заплати, а публикуваните файлове са предназначени за работодатели и доставчици на софтуер за заплати. Въведете сумата от текущия си фиш за заплати или прогнозата на работодателя.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Как работи 13-та заплата тук?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Въведете брутната сума на едно редовно плащане на заплата и изберете 13 плащания. Калкулаторът първо изчислява брутната сума на годишна база, прилага лимити за годишни вноски и разделя получената нетна оценка на 13 плащания.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Променя ли кантонът AVS/AI/APG или нивата на безработица?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Федералните ставки за служители, използвани тук, са за цялата страна. Специфичният за кантона данък на източника и други удръжки от работодател или план не се изчисляват автоматично.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Федералните вноски на работодателя, показани отделно (не се приспадат от вашата мрежа)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Работодател AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Застраховка за безработица на работодателя","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Само федерални законови ставки. Пенсията на работодателя, застраховката срещу злополука, фондът за семейни надбавки и специфичните за кантона вноски не са включени."},"ca":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora d'escenaris de salari net suís","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Calculadora de salaris suís 2026: escenari de pagament brut a net","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Calculeu les deduccions de nòmines dels empleats suïssos per a l'any 2026. Vegeu les cotitzacions federals d'AVS/IV/EO i d'atur i, a continuació, introduïu la vostra pensió real, l'assegurança d'accidents i els imports de l'impost font per a un escenari útil de 12 o 13 sou.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Construeix un escenari pràctic de nòmina suïssa de 2026. La calculadora estima les contribucions dels empleats a nivell nacional i resta la pensió, l'assegurança d'accidents, la retenció a la font i altres deduccions que introduïu dels vostres documents de nòmina.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Les tarifes federals són les mateixes entre els cantons, però el vostre pla de pensions, la prima d'accidents no laborals i l'impost de font depenen del vostre pla, empresa i cas personal. Introduïu aquests imports anuals a partir d'una nòmina o estimació actual de l'empresari. El cantó i l'estat fiscal es mostren per context; aquesta eina no reconstrueix taules cantonals d'impostos font ni impost sobre la renda anual.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Per 8.000 CHF per pagament de salari i 13 pagaments, el brut anual és de 104.000 CHF. Les contribucions dels empleats federals s'estimen a partir del salari anual; introduïu el pla anual i les deduccions fiscals per estimar l'escenari net.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brut per un pagament regular de salari (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Pagaments salarials per any","12 payments":"12 pagaments","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pagaments, inclòs el 13è salari","Age in years":"Edat en anys","Contribution situation":"Situació de cotització","Employee contributions apply":"S'apliquen contribucions dels empleats","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Encara no està subjecte a les aportacions dels empleats","Working after AHV reference age":"Treballar després de l'edat de referència de l'AVS","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Aplicar el subsidi mensual de l'AVS de 1.400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton per al vostre context de nòmines","Tax-at-source situation":"Situació de l'impost en origen","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"No s'imposa en origen / s'utilitza l'impost anual per separat","Taxed at source":"Impost en origen","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Deduccions anuals dels vostres documents de nòmina (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Deducció de la pensió dels empleats (anual)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Assegurança d'accidents no laborals (anual)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Impost de font retingut (anual)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Altres deduccions d'empleats (anuals)","Estimate net salary":"Salari net estimat","Reset example":"Exemple de restabliment","2026 salary scenario":"escenari salarial 2026","Gross salary per year":"Salari brut anual","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Empleat AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Assegurança d'atur dels empleats","Pension deduction entered":"S'ha introduït la deducció de la pensió","Accident insurance entered":"Assegurança d'accidents introduïda","Source tax entered":"Impost d'origen introduït","Other deductions entered":"S'han introduït altres deduccions","Total deductions shown":"Deduccions totals mostrades","Estimated net per year":"Net estimat per any","Average net per salary payment":"Mitjana neta per pagament de salari","Average net per month":"Mitjana net al mes","AHV allowance applied":"Subsistència per l'AVS aplicada","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Introduïu el vostre sou brut i, si està disponible, les deduccions anuals reals de la nòmina.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Escenari calculat al vostre navegador.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Consulta el salari, l'edat i els imports de les deduccions. Les deduccions no poden superar el salari brut.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Trieu la situació de cotització que coincideixi amb la vostra nòmina actual. L'edat per si sola no determina cada cas especial.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton només és context aquí. No canvia les taxes de contribució federal ni calcula l'impost d'origen.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Utilitzeu l'import anual mostrat pel vostre empresari o la vostra nòmina. Un cantó i una llengua no són suficients per calcular una tarifa individual.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"L'import de les pensions i accidents varien segons el pla i l'empresari. Si no els coneixeu, deixeu-los a zero; el resultat serà una estimació parcial.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"No s'inclou l'impost sobre la renda anual ordinari. Els empleats suïssos que no tributen en origen generalment ho liquiden mitjançant una declaració d'impostos anual, no una retenció estàndard de nòmines.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Estimació de nòmines federal amb data de 2026. Suposa una feina d'empleat i un any sencer. Els llocs de treball a part d'any, els ocupadors múltiples, les bonificacions, els casos transfronterers, l'estatus de cotització especial i l'arrodoniment individual poden canviar la nòmina. Utilitzeu la vostra declaració de l'empresari per a l'import vinculant.","Official 2026 references:":"Referències oficials 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Tipus de cotització AHV/IV/EO i ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 llindars de pensions ocupacionals","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"És una cotització suïssa exacta de pagament per emportar-se a casa?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Núm. Estima les contribucions estatutàries dels empleats a tot el país i resta les quantitats anuals específiques de la nòmina que introduïu. El resultat només és tan complet com aquestes entrades.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Per què he d'introduir deduccions per pensions i accidents?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Les aportacions de pensions professionals depenen del fons i pla de pensions. Les primes d'accidents no laborals depenen del risc de l'assegurador, la indústria i l'empresari. No hi ha una quantitat única d'empleat que es pugui deduir només del salari brut.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Pot calcular l'impost d'origen del meu cantó?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Núm. Les tarifes fiscals d'origen utilitzen detalls personals i de nòmina i els fitxers publicats estan destinats a empresaris i proveïdors de programari de nòmines. Introduïu l'import de la vostra nòmina actual o estimació de l'empresari.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Com funciona el 13è sou aquí?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Introduïu l'import brut d'un pagament de sou regular i trieu 13 pagaments. La calculadora anualitza primer l'import brut, aplica límits de contribució anuals i divideix l'estimació neta resultant en els 13 pagaments.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"El cantó canvia AVS/AI/APG o les taxes d'atur?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Les tarifes dels empleats federals que s'utilitzen aquí són a tot el país. L'impost d'origen específic del cantó i altres deduccions de l'empresari o del pla no es calculen automàticament.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Les contribucions federals de l'empresari es mostren per separat (no es dedueixen de la teva xarxa)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Empleador AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Assegurança d'atur de l'empresari","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Només tarifes legals federals. No s'inclouen la pensió de l'empresari, l'assegurança d'accidents, el fons d'ajudes familiars i les cotitzacions específiques del cantó."},"nl":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Zwitserse nettosalarisscenariocalculator","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Zwitserse salariscalculator 2026 — Scenario van bruto naar nettoloon","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Schat de loonaftrek voor Zwitserse werknemers voor 2026. Bekijk federale AHV/IV/EO- en werkloosheidsbijdragen en voer vervolgens uw werkelijke pensioen-, ongevallenverzekerings- en bronbelastingbedragen in voor een nuttig scenario met 12 of 13 betalingen.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Bouw een praktisch Zwitsers loonstrookscenario voor 2026 op. De calculator schat de landelijke werknemersbijdragen en trekt het pensioen, de ongevallenverzekering, de bronbelasting en andere inhoudingen die u invoert af van uw eigen loondocumenten.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"De federale tarieven zijn hetzelfde in alle kantons, maar uw pensioenplan, premie voor niet-beroepsongevallen en bronbelasting zijn afhankelijk van uw plan, werkgever en persoonlijke situatie. Voer die jaarbedragen in uit een loonstrook of een schatting van de huidige werkgever. Kanton- en belastingstatus worden getoond voor context; deze tool reconstrueert geen kantonale bronbelastingtabellen of jaarlijkse inkomstenbelasting.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Voor CHF 8.000 per salarisbetaling en 13 betalingen is het jaarlijkse bruto CHF 104.000. De federale werknemersbijdragen worden geschat op basis van het jaarsalaris; voer het jaarplan en de belastingaftrekken in om het nettoscenario te schatten.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Bruto voor één reguliere salarisbetaling (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Salarisbetalingen per jaar","12 payments":"12 betalingen","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 betalingen, inclusief 13e salaris","Age in years":"Leeftijd in jaren","Contribution situation":"Contributiesituatie","Employee contributions apply":"Werknemersbijdragen zijn van toepassing","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Nog niet onderworpen aan werknemersbijdragen","Working after AHV reference age":"Werken na de AHV-referentieleeftijd","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Pas de maandelijkse AHV-vergoeding van CHF 1.400 toe","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton voor uw looncontext","Tax-at-source situation":"Belasting aan de bron","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Niet aan de bron belast / jaarlijkse belasting afzonderlijk gebruiken","Taxed at source":"Belast aan de bron","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Jaarlijkse inhoudingen op uw loondocumenten (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Pensioenaftrek voor werknemers (jaarlijks)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Niet-arbeidsongevallenverzekering (jaarlijks)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Ingehouden bronbelasting (jaarlijks)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Overige personeelsinhoudingen (jaarlijks)","Estimate net salary":"Schatting van het nettosalaris","Reset example":"Resetvoorbeeld","2026 salary scenario":"Salarisscenario 2026","Gross salary per year":"Bruto salaris per jaar","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Medewerker AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Werkloosheidsverzekering voor werknemers","Pension deduction entered":"Pensioeninhouding ingevoerd","Accident insurance entered":"Ongevallenverzekering ingevoerd","Source tax entered":"Bronbelasting ingevoerd","Other deductions entered":"Andere inhoudingen ingevoerd","Total deductions shown":"Totale aftrekkingen weergegeven","Estimated net per year":"Geschat netto per jaar","Average net per salary payment":"Gemiddelde netto per salarisbetaling","Average net per month":"Gemiddeld netto per maand","AHV allowance applied":"AHV-toeslag toegepast","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Voer uw brutosalaris in en, indien beschikbaar, de werkelijke jaarlijkse looninhoudingen.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario berekend in uw browser.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Controleer de bedragen van salaris, leeftijd en inhoudingen. De inhoudingen mogen niet hoger zijn dan het brutosalaris.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Kies de premiesituatie die past bij uw huidige salarisadministratie. Leeftijd alleen bepaalt niet elk speciaal geval.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Kanton is hier alleen context. Het verandert niets aan de federale bijdragetarieven en berekent de bronbelasting niet.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Gebruik het jaarbedrag dat uw werkgever of loonstrook heeft opgegeven. Een kanton en een taal zijn niet voldoende om een individueel tarief te berekenen.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Pensioen- en ongevallenbedragen variëren per regeling en werkgever. Als u ze niet kent, laat ze dan op nul staan; het resultaat zal een gedeeltelijke schatting zijn.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Gewone jaarlijkse inkomstenbelasting is niet inbegrepen. Zwitserse werknemers die niet aan de bron worden belast, verrekenen dit doorgaans via een jaarlijkse belastingaangifte en niet via een standaard loonstrook.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Federale loonschatting uit 2026. Er wordt uitgegaan van één werknemersbaan en een volledig jaar. Deeljaarsbanen, meerdere werkgevers, bonussen, grensoverschrijdende gevallen, bijzondere premiestatus en individuele afronding kunnen de loonsom veranderen. Gebruik voor het bindend bedrag uw werkgeversverklaring.","Official 2026 references:":"Officiële 2026-referenties:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO en ALV premietarieven","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Beroepspensioendrempels voor 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Is dit een exacte Zwitserse prijsopgave voor thuisbetalen?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Nee. Het schat de wettelijke landelijke werknemersbijdragen en trekt de jaarlijkse loonspecifieke bedragen af die u invoert. Het resultaat is slechts zo compleet als die invoer.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Waarom moet ik pensioen- en ongevallenaftrek invoeren?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Bedrijfspensioenbijdragen zijn afhankelijk van het pensioenfonds en de regeling. De premies voor niet-beroepsongevallen zijn afhankelijk van het verzekeraar-, sector- en werkgeversrisico. Er is geen enkel werknemersbedrag dat uit het brutosalaris alleen kan worden afgeleid.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Kan het de bronbelasting voor mijn kanton berekenen?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Nee. Bij de bronbelastingtarieven wordt gebruik gemaakt van persoons- en loongegevens en de gepubliceerde bestanden zijn bedoeld voor werkgevers en loonsoftwareleveranciers. Vul het bedrag in uit uw huidige loonstrook of werkgeversraming.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Hoe werkt het 13e salaris hier?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Vul het brutobedrag in van één reguliere salarisbetaling en kies 13 betalingen. De rekenmachine brengt eerst het brutobedrag op jaarbasis, past jaarlijkse bijdragelimieten toe en verdeelt de resulterende nettoschatting over de 13 betalingen.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Verandert het kanton de AVS/AI/APG of de werkloosheidscijfers?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"De hier gebruikte federale werknemerstarieven gelden voor het hele land. Kantonspecifieke bronbelasting en andere werkgevers- of planinhoudingen worden niet automatisch berekend.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Federale bijdragen van werkgevers afzonderlijk weergegeven (niet afgetrokken van uw netto)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Werkgever AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Werkloosheidsverzekering voor werkgevers","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Alleen federale wettelijke tarieven. Werkgeverspensioen, ongevallenverzekering, kinderbijslagfonds en kantonspecifieke bijdragen zijn niet inbegrepen."},"el":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Υπολογιστής σεναρίου καθαρού ελβετικού μισθού","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής μισθών 2026 — Σενάριο μεικτής προς καθαρή αμοιβή","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Υπολογίστε τις κρατήσεις μισθοδοσίας των Ελβετών υπαλλήλων για το 2026. Δείτε τις ομοσπονδιακές εισφορές AHV/IV/EO και την ανεργία και, στη συνέχεια, εισαγάγετε την πραγματική σύνταξη, την ασφάλιση ατυχήματος και τα ποσά του φόρου πηγής για ένα χρήσιμο σενάριο 12 ή 13 αποδοχών.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Δημιουργήστε ένα πρακτικό ελβετικό σενάριο πληρωμών 2026. Η αριθμομηχανή υπολογίζει τις συνεισφορές των εργαζομένων σε εθνικό επίπεδο και αφαιρεί τη σύνταξη, την ασφάλιση ατυχημάτων, την παρακράτηση φόρου και άλλες κρατήσεις που εισάγετε από τα δικά σας έγγραφα μισθοδοσίας.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Οι ομοσπονδιακές τιμές είναι οι ίδιες στα καντόνια, αλλά το συνταξιοδοτικό σας πρόγραμμα, το ασφάλιστρο για μη επαγγελματικά ατυχήματα και ο φόρος πηγής εξαρτώνται από το πρόγραμμα, τον εργοδότη και την προσωπική σας περίπτωση. Εισαγάγετε αυτά τα ετήσια ποσά από ένα δελτίο πληρωμής ή από την τρέχουσα εκτίμηση του εργοδότη. Το καντόνι και η φορολογική κατάσταση εμφανίζονται για το πλαίσιο. αυτό το εργαλείο δεν ανακατασκευάζει τους καντονικούς πίνακες φόρου πηγών ή τον ετήσιο φόρο εισοδήματος.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Για 8.000 CHF ανά πληρωμή μισθού και 13 πληρωμές, το ετήσιο μεικτό είναι 104.000 CHF. Οι συνεισφορές των ομοσπονδιακών υπαλλήλων υπολογίζονται από τον ετήσιο μισθό. εισάγετε το ετήσιο πρόγραμμα και τις φορολογικές εκπτώσεις για να εκτιμήσετε το καθαρό σενάριο.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Μικτό για μία τακτική πληρωμή μισθού (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Πληρωμές μισθών ανά έτος","12 payments":"12 πληρωμές","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 πληρωμές, συμπεριλαμβανομένου του 13ου μισθού","Age in years":"Ηλικία σε χρόνια","Contribution situation":"Κατάσταση συνεισφοράς","Employee contributions apply":"Ισχύουν εισφορές εργαζομένων","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Δεν υπόκειται ακόμη σε εισφορές εργαζομένων","Working after AHV reference age":"Εργασία μετά την ηλικία αναφοράς AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Εφαρμόστε το μηνιαίο επίδομα AHV 1.400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton για το πλαίσιο μισθοδοσίας σας","Tax-at-source situation":"Κατάσταση φόρου στην πηγή","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Δεν φορολογείται χωριστά στην πηγή / χρήση ετήσιου φόρου","Taxed at source":"Φορολογείται στην πηγή","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Ετήσιες κρατήσεις από τα έγγραφα μισθοδοσίας σας (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Παρακράτηση σύνταξης εργαζομένων (ετήσια)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Μη επαγγελματικά ατυχήματα (ετήσια)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Παρακράτηση φόρου πηγής (ετήσιος)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Λοιπές κρατήσεις υπαλλήλων (ετήσιες)","Estimate net salary":"Εκτιμήστε τον καθαρό μισθό","Reset example":"Παράδειγμα επαναφοράς","2026 salary scenario":"Σενάριο μισθών 2026","Gross salary per year":"Μικτός μισθός ανά έτος","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Υπάλληλος AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Ασφάλιση ανεργίας εργαζομένων","Pension deduction entered":"Εισήγαγε έκπτωση σύνταξης","Accident insurance entered":"Δηλώθηκε η ασφάλιση ατυχήματος","Source tax entered":"Εισήγαγε φόρο πηγής","Other deductions entered":"Εισάγονται άλλες μειώσεις","Total deductions shown":"Εμφανίζονται συνολικές μειώσεις","Estimated net per year":"Εκτιμώμενο καθαρό ανά έτος","Average net per salary payment":"Μέση καθαρή πληρωμή ανά μισθό","Average net per month":"Μέσος καθαρός ανά μήνα","AHV allowance applied":"Εφαρμόστηκε επίδομα AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Εισαγάγετε τον ακαθάριστο μισθό σας και, εάν υπάρχουν, τις πραγματικές ετήσιες κρατήσεις μισθοδοσίας.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Το σενάριο υπολογίζεται στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Ελέγξτε το μισθό, την ηλικία και τα ποσά έκπτωσης. Οι κρατήσεις δεν μπορούν να υπερβαίνουν τον ακαθάριστο μισθό.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Επιλέξτε την κατάσταση συνεισφοράς που αντιστοιχεί στην τρέχουσα μισθοδοσία σας. Η ηλικία από μόνη της δεν καθορίζει κάθε ειδική περίπτωση.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Το Canton είναι πλαίσιο μόνο εδώ. Δεν αλλάζει τα ποσοστά ομοσπονδιακών εισφορών ούτε υπολογίζει τον φόρο πηγής.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε το ετήσιο ποσό που δείχνει ο εργοδότης σας ή το δελτίο πληρωμής. Ένα καντόνι και μια γλώσσα δεν αρκούν για να υπολογιστεί ένα μεμονωμένο τιμολόγιο.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Τα ποσά των συντάξεων και των ατυχημάτων διαφέρουν ανάλογα με το πρόγραμμα και τον εργοδότη. Εάν δεν τα γνωρίζετε, αφήστε τα στο μηδέν. το αποτέλεσμα θα είναι μια μερική εκτίμηση.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Δεν περιλαμβάνεται ο συνήθης ετήσιος φόρος εισοδήματος. Οι Ελβετοί εργαζόμενοι που δεν φορολογούνται στην πηγή γενικά το διακανονίζουν μέσω ετήσιας φορολογικής δήλωσης και όχι με τυπική παρακράτηση εκκαθαριστικών.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Ομοσπονδιακή εκτίμηση μισθοδοσίας με ημερομηνία 2026. Προϋποθέτει μία θέση υπαλλήλου και ένα πλήρες έτος. Οι θέσεις εργασίας μερικού έτους, οι πολλαπλοί εργοδότες, τα μπόνους, οι διασυνοριακές υποθέσεις, το καθεστώς ειδικής εισφοράς και η ατομική στρογγυλοποίηση μπορούν να αλλάξουν τη μισθοδοσία. Χρησιμοποιήστε τη δήλωση εργοδότη σας για το δεσμευτικό ποσό.","Official 2026 references:":"Επίσημες αναφορές 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Ποσοστά συνεισφοράς AHV/IV/EO και ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"Επαγγελματικά συνταξιοδοτικά όρια 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Αυτή είναι η ακριβής προσφορά πληρωμής από την Ελβετία;","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Αρ. Υπολογίζει τις νόμιμες συνεισφορές των εργαζομένων σε εθνικό επίπεδο και αφαιρεί τα ετήσια ποσά που εισάγετε για συγκεκριμένους μισθούς. Το αποτέλεσμα είναι τόσο πλήρες όσο αυτές οι εισροές.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Γιατί πρέπει να καταχωρίσω παρακρατήσεις συντάξεων και ατυχημάτων;","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Οι επαγγελματικές συνταξιοδοτικές εισφορές εξαρτώνται από το συνταξιοδοτικό ταμείο και το πρόγραμμα. Τα ασφάλιστρα για μη επαγγελματικά ατυχήματα εξαρτώνται από τον κίνδυνο του ασφαλιστή, του κλάδου και του εργοδότη. Δεν υπάρχει ενιαίο ποσό υπαλλήλου που να μπορεί να συναχθεί μόνο από τον ακαθάριστο μισθό.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Μπορεί να υπολογίσει τον φόρο πηγής από το καντόνι μου;","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Αρ. Τα τιμολόγια φόρου πηγής χρησιμοποιούν προσωπικά στοιχεία και στοιχεία μισθοδοσίας και τα δημοσιευμένα αρχεία προορίζονται για εργοδότες και παρόχους λογισμικού μισθοδοσίας. Εισαγάγετε το ποσό από το τρέχον δελτίο πληρωμής ή την εκτίμηση του εργοδότη.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Πώς λειτουργεί ο 13ος μισθός εδώ;","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Εισαγάγετε το ακαθάριστο ποσό μιας τακτικής πληρωμής μισθού και επιλέξτε 13 πληρωμές. Η αριθμομηχανή ετησιοποιεί πρώτα το ακαθάριστο ποσό, εφαρμόζει ετήσια όρια εισφορών και διαιρεί την καθαρή εκτίμηση που προκύπτει στις 13 πληρωμές.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Αλλάζει το καντόνι AVS/AI/APG ή τα ποσοστά ανεργίας;","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Οι τιμές ομοσπονδιακών υπαλλήλων που χρησιμοποιούνται εδώ είναι σε εθνικό επίπεδο. Ο φόρος προέλευσης για συγκεκριμένα καντόνια και άλλες εκπτώσεις εργοδοτών ή προγραμμάτων δεν υπολογίζονται αυτόματα.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Οι ομοσπονδιακές συνεισφορές εργοδοτών εμφανίζονται χωριστά (δεν αφαιρούνται από το καθαρό σας)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Εργοδότης AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Ασφάλιση ανεργίας εργοδότη","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Μόνο ομοσπονδιακές νόμιμες τιμές. Δεν περιλαμβάνονται η εργοδοτική σύνταξη, η ασφάλιση ατυχήματος, το ταμείο οικογενειακών επιδομάτων και οι ειδικές εισφορές για το καντόνι."},"ms":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Senario Gaji Bersih Switzerland","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Kalkulator Gaji Switzerland 2026 — Senario Gaji Kasar hingga Bersih","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Anggarkan potongan gaji pekerja Switzerland untuk 2026. Lihat AHV/IV/EO persekutuan dan caruman pengangguran, kemudian masukkan jumlah pencen, insurans kemalangan dan cukai sumber sebenar anda untuk senario 12- atau 13-gaji yang berguna.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Bina senario slip gaji Swiss 2026 yang praktikal. Kalkulator menganggarkan caruman pekerja di seluruh negara dan menolak pencen, insurans kemalangan, cukai pegangan dan potongan lain yang anda masukkan daripada dokumen senarai gaji anda sendiri.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Kadar persekutuan adalah sama di seluruh kanton, tetapi pelan pencen anda, premium kemalangan bukan pekerjaan dan cukai sumber bergantung pada pelan, majikan dan kes peribadi anda. Masukkan jumlah tahunan tersebut daripada slip gaji atau anggaran majikan semasa. Canton dan status cukai ditunjukkan untuk konteks; alat ini tidak membina semula jadual cukai sumber cantonal atau cukai pendapatan tahunan.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Untuk CHF 8,000 setiap pembayaran gaji dan 13 pembayaran, kasar tahunan ialah CHF 104,000. Caruman pekerja persekutuan dianggarkan daripada gaji tahunan; masukkan rancangan tahunan dan potongan cukai untuk menganggarkan senario bersih.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Kasar untuk satu bayaran gaji tetap (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Bayaran gaji setahun","12 payments":"12 pembayaran","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pembayaran, termasuk gaji ke-13","Age in years":"Umur dalam tahun","Contribution situation":"Situasi sumbangan","Employee contributions apply":"Caruman pekerja dikenakan","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Belum lagi tertakluk kepada caruman pekerja","Working after AHV reference age":"Bekerja selepas umur rujukan AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Gunakan elaun AHV bulanan CHF 1,400","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton untuk konteks senarai gaji anda","Tax-at-source situation":"Situasi cukai di sumber","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Tidak dikenakan cukai pada sumber / gunakan cukai tahunan secara berasingan","Taxed at source":"Dikenakan cukai pada sumber","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Potongan tahunan daripada dokumen gaji anda (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Potongan pencen pekerja (tahunan)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Insurans kemalangan bukan pekerjaan (tahunan)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Cukai sumber ditahan (tahunan)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Potongan pekerja lain (tahunan)","Estimate net salary":"Anggaran gaji bersih","Reset example":"Tetapkan semula contoh","2026 salary scenario":"2026 senario gaji","Gross salary per year":"Gaji kasar setahun","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Pekerja AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Insurans pengangguran pekerja","Pension deduction entered":"Potongan pencen dimasukkan","Accident insurance entered":"Insurans kemalangan telah dimasukkan","Source tax entered":"Cukai sumber dimasukkan","Other deductions entered":"Potongan lain dimasukkan","Total deductions shown":"Jumlah potongan ditunjukkan","Estimated net per year":"Anggaran bersih setahun","Average net per salary payment":"Purata bersih setiap pembayaran gaji","Average net per month":"Purata bersih sebulan\nElaun","AHV allowance applied":"AHV digunakan","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Masukkan gaji kasar anda dan, jika ada, potongan gaji tahunan sebenar.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Senario dikira dalam penyemak imbas anda.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Semak gaji, umur dan amaun potongan. Potongan tidak boleh melebihi gaji kasar.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Pilih situasi caruman yang sepadan dengan senarai gaji semasa anda. Umur sahaja tidak menentukan setiap kes istimewa.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton adalah konteks sahaja di sini. Ia tidak mengubah kadar caruman persekutuan atau mengira cukai sumber.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Gunakan jumlah tahunan yang ditunjukkan oleh majikan atau slip gaji anda. Kanton dan bahasa tidak mencukupi untuk mengira tarif individu.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Jumlah pencen dan kemalangan berbeza mengikut pelan dan majikan. Jika anda tidak mengenali mereka, biarkan mereka pada sifar; hasilnya akan menjadi anggaran separa.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Cukai pendapatan tahunan biasa tidak termasuk. Pekerja Switzerland yang tidak dikenakan cukai di sumber biasanya menyelesaikannya melalui penyata cukai tahunan, bukan pegangan penyata gaji standard.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Anggaran gaji persekutuan bertarikh 2026. Ia mengambil alih satu pekerjaan pekerja dan setahun penuh. Pekerjaan separuh tahun, berbilang majikan, bonus, kes rentas sempadan, status caruman khas dan penggenapan individu boleh menukar senarai gaji. Gunakan penyata majikan anda untuk jumlah yang mengikat.","Official 2026 references:":"Rujukan rasmi 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO dan kadar sumbangan ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 ambang pencen pekerjaan","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Adakah ini sebut harga bawa pulang-bayar Switzerland yang tepat?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"No. Ia menganggarkan caruman pekerja berkanun di seluruh negara dan menolak amaun khusus gaji tahunan yang anda masukkan. Hasilnya hanya selengkap input tersebut.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Mengapa saya perlu memasukkan potongan pencen dan kemalangan?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Caruman pencen pekerjaan bergantung pada dana pencen dan pelan. Premium kemalangan bukan pekerjaan bergantung kepada risiko penanggung insurans, industri dan majikan. Tiada jumlah pekerja tunggal yang boleh disimpulkan daripada gaji kasar sahaja.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Bolehkah ia mengira cukai sumber daripada canton saya?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"No. Tarif cukai sumber menggunakan butiran peribadi dan senarai gaji dan fail yang diterbitkan bertujuan untuk majikan dan penyedia perisian gaji. Masukkan amaun daripada slip gaji semasa anda atau anggaran majikan.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Bagaimanakah cara kerja gaji ke-13 di sini?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Masukkan jumlah kasar satu pembayaran gaji biasa dan pilih 13 pembayaran. Kalkulator membuat tahunan jumlah kasar dahulu, menggunakan had sumbangan tahunan dan membahagikan anggaran bersih yang terhasil pada 13 pembayaran.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Adakah kanton mengubah AVS/AI/APG atau kadar pengangguran?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Kadar pekerja persekutuan yang digunakan di sini adalah di seluruh negara. Cukai sumber khusus Canton dan potongan majikan atau pelan lain tidak dikira secara automatik.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Sumbangan persekutuan majikan ditunjukkan secara berasingan (tidak ditolak daripada bersih anda)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Majikan AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Insurans pengangguran majikan","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Kadar berkanun persekutuan sahaja. Pencen majikan, insurans kemalangan, dana elaun keluarga dan caruman khusus kanton tidak termasuk."},"pl":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Szwajcarski kalkulator scenariusza wynagrodzeń netto","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Szwajcarski kalkulator wynagrodzeń 2026 — scenariusz wynagrodzenia brutto do netto","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Oszacuj potrącenia od wynagrodzeń pracowników w Szwajcarii na rok 2026. Zobacz federalne składki na ubezpieczenie społeczne AHV/IV/EO i składki na wypadek bezrobocia, a następnie wprowadź rzeczywiste kwoty emerytury, ubezpieczenia wypadkowego i podatku źródłowego, aby uzyskać przydatny scenariusz 12 lub 13 wynagrodzeń.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Stwórz praktyczny szwajcarski scenariusz wypłaty na rok 2026. Kalkulator wylicza ogólnokrajowe składki pracownicze i odejmuje od Ciebie emeryturę, ubezpieczenie wypadkowe, podatek u źródła i inne potrącenia, które wprowadzasz z własnych dokumentów płacowych.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Stawki federalne są takie same we wszystkich kantonach, ale Twój plan emerytalny, składka z tytułu wypadku niezwiązanego z pracą i podatek źródłowy zależą od Twojego planu, pracodawcy i sytuacji osobistej. Wprowadź te roczne kwoty z odcinka wypłaty lub aktualnego szacunku pracodawcy. Kanton i status podatkowy pokazano w kontekście; narzędzie to nie rekonstruuje kantonalnych tabel podatku u źródła ani rocznego podatku dochodowego.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"W przypadku 8 000 CHF na wypłatę wynagrodzenia i 13 wypłat roczna kwota brutto wynosi 104 000 CHF. Federalne składki pracowników są szacowane na podstawie rocznego wynagrodzenia; wprowadź plan roczny i ulgi podatkowe, aby oszacować scenariusz netto.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brutto za jedno regularne wynagrodzenie (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Wypłaty wynagrodzeń rocznie","12 payments":"12","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 płatności, w tym 13. pensja","Age in years":"Wiek w latach","Contribution situation":"Sytuacja dotycząca składek","Employee contributions apply":"Obowiązują składki pracownicze","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Jeszcze nie podlega składkom pracowniczym","Working after AHV reference age":"Praca po osiągnięciu wieku referencyjnego AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Zastosuj miesięczny dodatek AHV w wysokości 1400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton w kontekście płac","Tax-at-source situation":"Sytuacja podatku u źródła","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Nie opodatkowane u źródła / należy stosować podatek roczny oddzielnie","Taxed at source":"Opodatkowanie u źródła","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Roczne potrącenia z dokumentów płacowych (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Odliczenie emerytury pracowniczej (roczne)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Ubezpieczenie od wypadków innych niż przy pracy (roczne)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Potrącony podatek źródłowy (roczny)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Inne potrącenia pracownicze (roczne)","Estimate net salary":"Szacowana pensja netto","Reset example":"Przykład resetowania\nScenariusz wynagrodzeń","2026 salary scenario":"2026","Gross salary per year":"Wynagrodzenie brutto rocznie","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Pracownik AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Ubezpieczenie pracownicze na wypadek bezrobocia","Pension deduction entered":"Wprowadzono potrącenie z emerytury","Accident insurance entered":"Wprowadzono ubezpieczenie od następstw nieszczęśliwych wypadków","Source tax entered":"Wprowadzono podatek źródłowy","Other deductions entered":"Wprowadzono inne odliczenia","Total deductions shown":"Pokazano łączne odliczenia","Estimated net per year":"Szacowana wartość netto rocznie","Average net per salary payment":"Średnia kwota netto na wypłatę wynagrodzenia","Average net per month":"Średnia kwota netto miesięcznie\nZastosowano dodatek","AHV allowance applied":"AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Wprowadź swoje wynagrodzenie brutto i, jeśli są dostępne, rzeczywiste roczne potrącenia z wynagrodzenia.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenariusz obliczony w Twojej przeglądarce.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Sprawdź wynagrodzenie, wiek i kwoty odliczeń. Potrącenia nie mogą przekraczać wynagrodzenia brutto.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Wybierz składkę odpowiadającą Twojej aktualnej liście płac. Sam wiek nie determinuje każdego szczególnego przypadku.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Kanton jest tutaj jedynie kontekstem. Nie zmienia to stawek składek federalnych ani nie oblicza podatku źródłowego.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Użyj rocznej kwoty wskazanej przez pracodawcę lub na odcinku wypłaty. Kanton i język nie wystarczą do obliczenia indywidualnej taryfy.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Kwoty emerytur i rent różnią się w zależności od planu i pracodawcy. Jeśli ich nie znasz, pozostaw je na poziomie zero; wynik będzie częściowym szacunkiem.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Zwykły roczny podatek dochodowy nie jest uwzględniony. Szwajcarscy pracownicy, którzy nie są opodatkowani u źródła, zazwyczaj rozliczają się za pomocą rocznego zeznania podatkowego, a nie standardowego odcinka wypłaty.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Federalne szacunki płac z 2026 r. Zakładają, że jeden pracownik będzie pracował przez cały rok. Praca na pół roku, wielu pracodawców, premie, przypadki transgraniczne, specjalny status składki i indywidualne zaokrąglenia mogą zmienić listę płac. Aby określić wiążącą kwotę, skorzystaj z oświadczenia pracodawcy.","Official 2026 references:":"Oficjalne referencje na rok 2026:\nStawki składek","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO i ALV\nProgi emerytur pracowniczych","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Czy to dokładna szwajcarska wycena „na miejscu”?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Nie. Szacuje ustawowe ogólnokrajowe składki pracownicze i odejmuje wprowadzone roczne kwoty związane z listą płac. Wynik jest tak kompletny, jak te dane wejściowe.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Dlaczego muszę odliczać składki emerytalne i wypadkowe?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Pracownicze składki emerytalne zależą od funduszu emerytalnego i planu. Wysokość składek z tytułu wypadków niezwiązanych z pracą zależy od ubezpieczyciela, branży i ryzyka pracodawcy. Nie ma jednej kwoty pracownika, którą można wywnioskować na podstawie samego wynagrodzenia brutto.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Czy może obliczyć podatek źródłowy z mojego kantonu?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Nie. Taryfy podatku źródłowego wykorzystują dane osobowe i płacowe, a publikowane pliki są przeznaczone dla pracodawców i dostawców oprogramowania płacowego. Wprowadź kwotę z bieżącego odcinka wypłaty lub szacunkowej kwoty pracodawcy.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Jak tu działa 13-ta pensja?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Wprowadź kwotę brutto jednej regularnej wypłaty wynagrodzenia i wybierz 13 wypłat. Kalkulator w pierwszej kolejności dokonuje rocznej kwoty brutto, stosuje roczne limity składek i dzieli powstałą szacunkową kwotę netto na 13 płatności.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Czy kanton zmienia AVS/AI/APG lub stopy bezrobocia?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Zastosowane tutaj federalne stawki pracownicze mają charakter ogólnokrajowy. Specyficzny dla kantonu podatek źródłowy i inne potrącenia pracodawcy lub planu nie są obliczane automatycznie.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Składki federalne pracodawcy pokazane osobno (nie odliczane od Twojej netto)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Pracodawca AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Zabezpieczenie pracodawcy na wypadek bezrobocia","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Tylko federalne stawki ustawowe. Nie uwzględniono emerytury pracodawcy, ubezpieczenia wypadkowego, funduszu świadczeń rodzinnych i składek zależnych od kantonu."},"sv":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Schweizisk nettolönescenariokalkylator","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Schweizisk lönekalkylator 2026 — Scenario brutto till nettolön","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Uppskatta löneavdrag för schweiziska anställda för 2026. Se federala AHV/IV/EO och arbetslöshetsavgifter, ange sedan dina faktiska pensions-, olycksfallsförsäkringsbelopp och källskattebelopp för ett användbart scenario med 12 eller 13 löner.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Skapa ett praktiskt scenario för 2026 schweizisk lönebesked. Kalkylatorn uppskattar rikstäckande löntagaravgifter och drar av de pensioner, olycksfallsförsäkringar, förskottsinnehållning och andra avdrag du anger från dina egna lönehandlingar.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"De federala priserna är desamma i alla kantoner, men din pensionsplan, olycksfallspremie och källskatt beror på din plan, arbetsgivare och personliga fall. Ange dessa årliga belopp från ett lönebesked eller aktuell arbetsgivaruppskattning. Kanton och skattestatus visas för sammanhang; detta verktyg rekonstruerar inte kantonala källskattetabeller eller årlig inkomstskatt.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"För 8 000 CHF per löneutbetalning och 13 betalningar är brutto 104 000 CHF per år. Federala anställdas bidrag beräknas från årslönen; ange årsplan och skatteavdrag för att uppskatta nettoscenariot.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brutto för en vanlig lönebetalning (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Löneutbetalningar per år","12 payments":"12 betalningar","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 betalningar, inklusive 13:e lön","Age in years":"Ålder i år","Contribution situation":"Bidragssituation","Employee contributions apply":"Anställda avgifter gäller","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Ännu ej föremål för anställdas bidrag","Working after AHV reference age":"Arbetar efter AHV referensålder","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Använd det månatliga AHV-tillägget på 1 400 CHF","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton för ditt lönesammanhang","Tax-at-source situation":"Källskatt","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Beskattas inte vid källskatt / använd årlig skatt separat","Taxed at source":"Källbeskattad","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Årliga avdrag från dina lönedokument (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Anställdas pensionsavdrag (årligt)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Icke-yrkesrelaterade olycksfallsförsäkring (årlig)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Källskatt innehållen (årlig)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Övriga anställdas avdrag (årliga)","Estimate net salary":"Uppskatta nettolön","Reset example":"Återställningsexempel","2026 salary scenario":"2026 lönescenario","Gross salary per year":"Bruttolön per år","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Anställd AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Arbetslöshetsförsäkring för anställda","Pension deduction entered":"Pensionsavdrag har angetts","Accident insurance entered":"olycksfallsförsäkring tecknad","Source tax entered":"Källskatt har angetts","Other deductions entered":"Andra avdrag har angetts","Total deductions shown":"Totala avdrag visas","Estimated net per year":"Uppskattat netto per år","Average net per salary payment":"Genomsnittligt netto per löneutbetalning","Average net per month":"Genomsnittligt netto per månad","AHV allowance applied":"AHV-tillägg tillämpas","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Ange din bruttolön och, om tillgängligt, faktiska årliga löneavdrag.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario beräknat i din webbläsare.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Kontrollera lön, ålder och avdragsbelopp. Avdrag får inte överstiga bruttolönen.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Välj den avgiftssituation som matchar din nuvarande lönelista. Ålder ensam avgör inte varje specialfall.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton är bara sammanhang här. Det ändrar inte de federala bidragssatserna eller beräkna källskatten.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Använd det årliga beloppet som visas av din arbetsgivare eller lönebesked. En kanton och ett språk räcker inte för att beräkna en individuell taxa.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Pensioner och olycksbelopp varierar beroende på plan och arbetsgivare. Om du inte känner till dem, lämna dem på noll; resultatet blir en partiell uppskattning.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Vanlig årlig inkomstskatt ingår inte. Schweiziska anställda som inte är källbeskattade reglerar i allmänhet det genom en årlig skattedeklaration, inte en vanlig lönebeskattning.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Federal löneuppskattning daterad 2026. Den förutsätter ett anställningsjobb och ett helt år. Delårsjobb, flera arbetsgivare, bonusar, gränsöverskridande ärenden, särskild avgiftsstatus och individuell avrundning kan ändra lönelistan. Använd ditt arbetsgivarutdrag för det bindande beloppet.","Official 2026 references:":"Officiella 2026 referenser:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO och ALV-avgifter","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 tjänstepensionströsklar","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Är detta en exakt schweizisk offert för att ta hem och betala?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Nr. Den uppskattar lagstadgade rikstäckande anställdas bidrag och subtraherar de årliga lönespecifika beloppen du anger. Resultatet är bara så komplett som dessa ingångar.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Varför måste jag göra pensions- och olycksfallsavdrag?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Tjänstepensionsavgifter beror på pensionsfonden och planen. Icke-yrkesrelaterade olycksfallspremier beror på försäkringsgivarens, bransch- och arbetsgivarrisken. Det finns inget enskilt anställdsbelopp som kan utläsas från enbart bruttolönen.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Kan det beräkna källskatt från min kanton?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Nr. Källskattetaxor använder personliga uppgifter och löneuppgifter och de publicerade filerna är avsedda för arbetsgivare och leverantörer av löneprogram. Ange beloppet från din nuvarande lönebesked eller arbetsgivaruppskattning.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Hur fungerar den 13:e lönen här?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Ange bruttobeloppet för en vanlig löneutbetalning och välj 13 utbetalningar. Kalkylatorn årligen beräknar bruttobeloppet först, tillämpar årliga bidragsgränser och delar upp den resulterande nettouppskattningen över de 13 betalningarna.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Ändras kantonen AVS/AI/APG eller arbetslöshetstalen?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"De federala anställdas priser som används här är rikstäckande. Kantonspecifik källskatt och andra arbetsgivar- eller planavdrag beräknas inte automatiskt.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Arbetsgivaravgifter visas separat (dras inte från ditt netto)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Arbetsgivare AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Arbetsgivar-arbetslöshetsförsäkring","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Endast federala lagstadgade priser. Arbetsgivarpension, olycksfallsförsäkring, familjebidragsfond och kantonspecifika avgifter ingår inte."},"th":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณสถานการณ์เงินเดือนสุทธิของสวิส","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"เครื่องคำนวณเงินเดือนของสวิสเซอร์แลนด์ 2026 - สถานการณ์การจ่ายเงินรวมเป็นสุทธิ","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"ประมาณการการหักเงินเดือนพนักงานชาวสวิสสำหรับปี 2026 ดู AHV/IV/EO ของรัฐบาลกลางและเงินสมทบการว่างงาน จากนั้นป้อนเงินบำนาญจริง ประกันอุบัติเหตุ และจำนวนภาษีที่มาสำหรับสถานการณ์การจ่าย 12 หรือ 13 ที่เป็นประโยชน์","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"สร้างสถานการณ์สลิปเงินเดือนของสวิสปี 2026 ที่ใช้งานได้จริง เครื่องคำนวณจะประมาณการเงินสมทบของพนักงานทั่วประเทศ และลบเงินบำนาญ ประกันอุบัติเหตุ ภาษีหัก ณ ที่จ่าย และการหักเงินอื่นๆ ที่คุณป้อนจากเอกสารเงินเดือนของคุณเอง","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"อัตราของรัฐบาลกลางจะเหมือนกันในทุกรัฐ แต่แผนเงินบำนาญของคุณ เบี้ยประกันภัยอุบัติเหตุนอกอาชีพ และภาษีที่มานั้นขึ้นอยู่กับแผน นายจ้าง และกรณีส่วนตัวของคุณ ป้อนจำนวนเงินรายปีเหล่านั้นจากสลิปเงินเดือนหรือประมาณการนายจ้างปัจจุบัน สถานะแคนตันและภาษีจะแสดงตามบริบท เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้สร้างตารางภาษีแหล่งที่มาของมณฑลหรือภาษีเงินได้ประจำปีขึ้นใหม่","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"สำหรับการชำระ 8,000 CHF ต่อการจ่ายเงินเดือนและการชำระ 13 ครั้ง ยอดรวมต่อปีคือ CHF 104,000 เงินสมทบพนักงานของรัฐบาลกลางประเมินจากเงินเดือนประจำปี ป้อนแผนรายปีและการหักภาษีเพื่อประมาณการสถานการณ์สุทธิ","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"รวมสำหรับการจ่ายเงินเดือนปกติหนึ่งครั้ง (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"การจ่ายเงินเดือนต่อปี","12 payments":"12 การชำระเงิน","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 งวด รวมเงินเดือนที่ 13","Age in years":"อายุเป็นปี","Contribution situation":"สถานการณ์การสมทบทุน","Employee contributions apply":"มีการใช้เงินสมทบของพนักงาน","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"ยังไม่อยู่ภายใต้การจ่ายเงินสมทบของพนักงาน","Working after AHV reference age":"ทำงานหลังจากอายุอ้างอิง AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"ใช้ค่าเผื่อ AHV รายเดือน CHF 1,400","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton สำหรับบริบทบัญชีเงินเดือนของคุณ","Tax-at-source situation":"สถานการณ์ภาษี ณ ต้นทาง","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"ไม่เก็บภาษีที่แหล่งที่มา / ใช้ภาษีรายปีแยกกัน","Taxed at source":"เก็บภาษีที่ต้นทาง","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"การหักเงินรายปีจากเอกสารเงินเดือนของคุณ (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"การหักเงินบำนาญพนักงาน (รายปี)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"ประกันอุบัติเหตุนอกสถานที่ (รายปี)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"แหล่งที่มาของภาษีหัก ณ ที่จ่าย (รายปี)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"การหักเงินพนักงานอื่นๆ (รายปี)","Estimate net salary":"ประมาณการเงินเดือนสุทธิ","Reset example":"ตัวอย่างการรีเซ็ต","2026 salary scenario":"สถานการณ์เงินเดือนปี 2026","Gross salary per year":"เงินเดือนรวมต่อปี","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"พนักงาน AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"ประกันการว่างงานของพนักงาน","Pension deduction entered":"ป้อนการหักเงินบำนาญแล้ว","Accident insurance entered":"เข้าประกันอุบัติเหตุ","Source tax entered":"ภาษีต้นทางที่ป้อน","Other deductions entered":"การหักเงินอื่นๆ ที่ป้อน","Total deductions shown":"แสดงการหักเงินทั้งหมด","Estimated net per year":"ประมาณการสุทธิต่อปี","Average net per salary payment":"สุทธิเฉลี่ยต่อการจ่ายเงินเดือน","Average net per month":"สุทธิเฉลี่ยต่อเดือน","AHV allowance applied":"ใช้ค่าเผื่อ AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"ป้อนเงินเดือนรวมของคุณ และหากมี การหักเงินเดือนประจำปีตามจริง (หากมี)","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"สถานการณ์จำลองที่คำนวณในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"ตรวจสอบเงินเดือน อายุ และจำนวนเงินที่หัก การหักเงินต้องไม่เกินเงินเดือนขั้นต้น","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"เลือกสถานการณ์การบริจาคที่ตรงกับเงินเดือนปัจจุบันของคุณ อายุเพียงอย่างเดียวไม่ได้กำหนดกรณีพิเศษทุกกรณี","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton เป็นบริบทเฉพาะที่นี่ จะไม่เปลี่ยนแปลงอัตราการบริจาคของรัฐบาลกลางหรือคำนวณภาษีต้นทาง","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"ใช้จำนวนเงินรายปีที่นายจ้างหรือสลิปเงินเดือนแสดง ตำบลและภาษาไม่เพียงพอที่จะคำนวณภาษีศุลกากรแต่ละรายการ","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"จำนวนเงินบำนาญและอุบัติเหตุจะแตกต่างกันไปตามแผนและนายจ้าง หากคุณไม่รู้จักพวกเขา ให้ปล่อยพวกเขาไว้ที่ศูนย์ ผลลัพธ์จะเป็นการประมาณการบางส่วน","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"ไม่รวมภาษีเงินได้ประจำปีสามัญ พนักงานชาวสวิสที่ไม่ถูกหักภาษี ณ ที่จ่าย โดยทั่วไปจะชำระเงินผ่านการคืนภาษีประจำปี ไม่ใช่การหักภาษี ณ ที่จ่ายแบบมาตรฐาน","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"การประมาณการเงินเดือนของรัฐบาลกลางลงวันที่ 2026 โดยถือว่ามีงานพนักงาน 1 งานและหนึ่งปีเต็ม งานพาร์ทไทม์, นายจ้างหลายราย, โบนัส, กรณีข้ามพรมแดน, สถานะการจ่ายเงินสมทบพิเศษ และการปัดเศษรายบุคคลสามารถเปลี่ยนเงินเดือนได้ ใช้ใบแจ้งยอดนายจ้างของคุณเป็นจำนวนเงินที่มีผลผูกพัน","Official 2026 references:":"ข้อมูลอ้างอิงอย่างเป็นทางการประจำปี 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"อัตราการสนับสนุน AHV/IV/EO และ ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 เกณฑ์เงินบำนาญจากการประกอบอาชีพ","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"นี่คือใบเสนอราคาซื้อกลับบ้านของสวิสใช่ไหม","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"เลขที่ โดยจะประมาณการเงินสมทบของพนักงานทั่วประเทศตามกฎหมาย และลบจำนวนเงินเฉพาะเงินเดือนประจำปีที่คุณป้อน ผลลัพธ์จะสมบูรณ์เท่ากับอินพุตเหล่านั้นเท่านั้น","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"ทำไมต้องกรอกเงินบำนาญและการหักลดอุบัติเหตุ?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"เงินสมทบบำนาญขึ้นอยู่กับกองทุนบำเหน็จบำนาญและแผนงาน เบี้ยประกันอุบัติเหตุนอกอาชีพขึ้นอยู่กับความเสี่ยงของผู้รับประกัน อุตสาหกรรม และนายจ้าง ไม่มีจำนวนพนักงานเพียงรายเดียวที่สามารถอนุมานได้จากเงินเดือนรวมเพียงอย่างเดียว","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"สามารถคำนวณภาษีต้นทางจากรัฐของฉันได้หรือไม่","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"เลขที่ ภาษีต้นทางใช้รายละเอียดส่วนบุคคลและรายละเอียดเงินเดือน และไฟล์ที่เผยแพร่มีไว้สำหรับนายจ้างและผู้ให้บริการซอฟต์แวร์บัญชีเงินเดือน ป้อนจำนวนเงินจากสลิปเงินเดือนปัจจุบันของคุณหรือประมาณการนายจ้าง","How does the 13th salary work here?":"เงินเดือนที่ 13 ทำงานยังไงที่นี่?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"ป้อนจำนวนเงินรวมของการจ่ายเงินเดือนปกติหนึ่งครั้ง และเลือกการชำระเงิน 13 รายการ เครื่องคำนวณจะคำนวณจำนวนเงินรวมเป็นรายปีก่อน ใช้ขีดจำกัดการบริจาครายปี และหารผลประมาณการสุทธิที่เกิดขึ้นในการชำระเงิน 13 ครั้ง","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"รัฐเปลี่ยนแปลง AVS/AI/APG หรืออัตราการว่างงานหรือไม่","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"อัตราพนักงานของรัฐบาลกลางที่ใช้ในที่นี้เป็นอัตราทั่วประเทศ ภาษีต้นทางเฉพาะของมณฑลและการหักเงินจากนายจ้างหรือแผนอื่นๆ จะไม่ถูกคำนวณโดยอัตโนมัติ","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"เงินสมทบของรัฐบาลกลางของนายจ้างแสดงแยกต่างหาก (ไม่หักออกจากสุทธิของคุณ)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"นายจ้าง AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"ประกันการว่างงานของนายจ้าง","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"อัตราตามกฎหมายของรัฐบาลกลางเท่านั้น ไม่รวมเงินบำนาญนายจ้าง ประกันอุบัติเหตุ กองทุนสงเคราะห์ครอบครัว และเงินสมทบเฉพาะเทศมณฑล"},"uk":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор сценарію чистої зарплати в Швейцарії","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Швейцарський калькулятор зарплати 2026 — сценарій від валової до чистої зарплати","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Оцініть відрахування із заробітної плати швейцарського працівника на 2026 рік. Перегляньте федеральні внески AHV/IV/EO та внески на випадок безробіття, а потім введіть фактичні суми пенсії, страхування від нещасних випадків і податку на джерело для корисного сценарію з 12 або 13 зарплатами.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Створіть практичний сценарій швейцарської платіжної відомості на 2026 рік. Калькулятор розраховує внески працівників по всій країні та віднімає пенсію, страхування від нещасних випадків, податок на дохід та інші відрахування, які ви вводите з власних документів із заробітної плати.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Федеральні ставки однакові для всіх кантонів, але ваш пенсійний план, премія за нещасні випадки, не пов’язані з виробництвом, і податок джерела залежать від вашого плану, роботодавця та особистого випадку. Введіть ці річні суми з платіжної відомості або оцінки поточного роботодавця. Кантон і податковий статус показані для контексту; цей інструмент не реконструює кантональні податкові таблиці або річний податок на прибуток.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Для 8 000 швейцарських франків на виплату зарплати та 13 виплат річна сума становить 104 000 швейцарських франків. Внески федерального службовця розраховуються з річної зарплати; введіть річний план і податкові відрахування, щоб оцінити чистий сценарій.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Брутто для однієї регулярної виплати зарплати (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Виплати заробітної плати за рік","12 payments":"12 плат","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 виплат, в т.ч. 13 заробітна плата","Age in years":"Вік у роках","Contribution situation":"Ситуація з внеску","Employee contributions apply":"Застосовуються внески працівників","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Ще не підлягає внескам працівників","Working after AHV reference age":"Робота після контрольного віку AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Застосуйте місячну допомогу AHV у розмірі 1400 швейцарських франків","Canton for your payroll context":"Кантон для вашого контексту заробітної плати","Tax-at-source situation":"Ситуація з податком у джерела","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Не оподатковується у джерела / використовує річний податок окремо","Taxed at source":"Оподатковується у джерела","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Щорічні відрахування з ваших документів із заробітної плати (швейцарські франки)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Відрахування з пенсії працівників (щорічно)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Страхування від нещасних випадків не на виробництві (річна)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Утриманий податок з джерела (щорічний)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Інші відрахування працівників (щорічно)","Estimate net salary":"Розрахунковий чистий оклад","Reset example":"Приклад скидання","2026 salary scenario":"2026 сценарій зарплати","Gross salary per year":"Зарплата брутто за рік","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Працівник AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Страхування працівників на випадок безробіття","Pension deduction entered":"Введено відрахування з пенсії","Accident insurance entered":"Введено страхування від нещасних випадків","Source tax entered":"Введено вихідний податок","Other deductions entered":"Внесено інші відрахування","Total deductions shown":"Відображено загальну суму відрахувань","Estimated net per year":"Очікувана чиста сума на рік","Average net per salary payment":"Середня виплата чистої заробітної плати","Average net per month":"Середнє нетто за місяць","AHV allowance applied":"Застосовано надбавку AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Введіть свою валову зарплату та, якщо доступно, фактичні щорічні відрахування із заробітної плати.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Сценарій, розрахований у вашому браузері.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Перевірте розмір зарплати, віку та відрахувань. Відрахування не можуть перевищувати валову зарплату.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Виберіть суму внесків, яка відповідає вашій поточній зарплаті. Сам по собі вік не визначає кожен окремий випадок.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Кантон тут містить лише контекст. Це не змінює федеральні ставки внесків і не обчислює вихідний податок.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Використовуйте річну суму, указану вашим роботодавцем, або платіжну відомість. Для розрахунку індивідуального тарифу недостатньо кантону та мови.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Суми пенсії та суми від нещасних випадків залежать від плану та роботодавця. Якщо ви їх не знаєте, залиште їх на нулі; результатом буде часткова оцінка.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Звичайний річний податок на прибуток не включено. Працівники Швейцарії, які не оподатковуються у джерела, як правило, сплачують його через річну податкову декларацію, а не через стандартну платіжну відомість.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Федеральний розрахунок заробітної плати від 2026 року. Він передбачає одну роботу працівника та повний рік. Робота на неповний рік, кілька роботодавців, бонуси, транскордонні випадки, статус спеціальних внесків та індивідуальне округлення можуть змінити зарплату. Для отримання обов’язкової суми скористайтеся заявою роботодавця.","Official 2026 references:":"Офіційні посилання 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"Ставки внесків AHV/IV/EO та ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 Порогові розміри професійної пенсії","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Це точна швейцарська пропозиція оплати додому?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"№ Він оцінює загальнонаціональні внески працівників і віднімає введені вами річні суми заробітної плати. Результат настільки повний, наскільки ці вхідні дані.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Чому я маю вводити відрахування на пенсію та нещасні випадки?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Професійні пенсійні внески залежать від пенсійного фонду та плану. Премії за нещасні випадки, не пов’язані з виробництвом, залежать від ризику страховика, галузі та роботодавця. Немає єдиної суми працівника, яку можна було б визначити лише на основі валової зарплати.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Чи може він розрахувати податок джерела з мого кантону?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"№ Тарифи з податку на джерело використовують персональні дані та відомості про заробітну плату, а опубліковані файли призначені для роботодавців і постачальників програмного забезпечення для розрахунку заробітної плати. Введіть суму з вашої поточної платіжної відомості або оцінки роботодавця.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Як тут 13 зарплата?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Введіть валову суму однієї регулярної виплати зарплати та виберіть 13 виплат. Калькулятор спочатку перераховує валову суму на рік, застосовує річні ліміти внесків і ділить отриману чисту оцінку на 13 платежів.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Чи змінює кантон AVS/AI/APG чи рівень безробіття?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Федеральні ставки для службовців, які використовуються тут, діють для всієї країни. Податок з джерела кантону та інші відрахування роботодавця чи плану не розраховуються автоматично.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Федеральні внески роботодавця вказуються окремо (не вираховуються з вашої суми)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Роботодавець AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Страхування роботодавця на випадок безробіття","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Лише федеральні законодавчі ставки. Пенсія роботодавця, страхування від нещасних випадків, фонд сімейної допомоги та внески кантонів не включені."},"sw":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Hali ya Mishahara ya Uswizi","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Kikokotoo cha Mshahara cha Uswizi 2026 - Hali ya Malipo ya Jumla hadi Jumla","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Kadiria makato ya malipo ya wafanyakazi wa Uswizi kwa mwaka wa 2026. Angalia AHV/IV/EO ya shirikisho na michango ya watu wasio na ajira, kisha uweke pensheni yako halisi, bima ya ajali na kiasi cha kodi ya chanzo kwa hali muhimu ya kulipa 12 au 13.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Unda hali halisi ya malipo ya Uswizi ya 2026. Kikokotoo kinakadiria michango ya wafanyikazi nchini kote na kutoa pensheni, bima ya ajali, kodi ya zuio na makato mengine unayoweka kutoka kwa hati zako za malipo.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Viwango vya shirikisho ni sawa katika mikoa yote, lakini mpango wako wa pensheni, malipo ya ajali isiyo ya kazini na kodi ya chanzo hutegemea mpango wako, mwajiri na kesi ya kibinafsi. Weka kiasi hicho cha kila mwaka kutoka kwa hati ya malipo au makadirio ya mwajiri wa sasa. Kantoni na hali ya kodi zinaonyeshwa kwa muktadha; chombo hiki hakitengenezi upya jedwali la kodi ya chanzo cha kawaida au kodi ya mapato ya kila mwaka.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Kwa CHF 8,000 kwa kila malipo ya mshahara na malipo 13, jumla ya mwaka ni CHF 104,000. Michango ya wafanyikazi wa shirikisho inakadiriwa kutoka kwa mshahara wa kila mwaka; ingiza mpango wa mwaka na makato ya ushuru ili kukadiria hali halisi.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Pato la jumla la malipo moja ya kawaida ya mshahara (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Malipo ya mishahara kwa mwaka","12 payments":"12 malipo","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 malipo, ikijumuisha mshahara wa 13","Age in years":"Umri katika miaka","Contribution situation":"Hali ya mchango","Employee contributions apply":"Michango ya mfanyakazi itatumika","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Bado haiko chini ya michango ya wafanyikazi","Working after AHV reference age":"Inafanya kazi baada ya umri wa marejeleo wa AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Tumia posho ya AHV ya CHF 1,400 ya kila mwezi","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton kwa muktadha wako wa malipo","Tax-at-source situation":"Hali ya kodi-kwenye chanzo","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Haitozwi kodi katika chanzo / matumizi ya kodi ya kila mwaka kando","Taxed at source":"Inatozwa ushuru kwenye chanzo","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Makato ya kila mwaka kutoka kwa hati zako za malipo (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Kato la pensheni ya mfanyakazi (kila mwaka)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Bima ya ajali isiyo ya kazini (ya kila mwaka)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Kodi ya chanzo imezuiliwa (kila mwaka)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Makato mengine ya wafanyikazi (kila mwaka)","Estimate net salary":"Kadiria jumla ya mshahara","Reset example":"Weka upya mfano","2026 salary scenario":"2026 hali ya mshahara","Gross salary per year":"Jumla ya mshahara kwa mwaka","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Mfanyakazi AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Bima ya ukosefu wa ajira kwa wafanyikazi","Pension deduction entered":"Kato la pensheni limeingizwa","Accident insurance entered":"Bima ya ajali imeingizwa","Source tax entered":"Kodi ya chanzo imeingizwa","Other deductions entered":"Makato mengine yameingizwa","Total deductions shown":"Jumla ya makato yaliyoonyeshwa","Estimated net per year":"Kadirio la jumla kwa mwaka","Average net per salary payment":"Wastani wa jumla kwa kila malipo ya mshahara","Average net per month":"Wastani wa wavu kwa mwezi","AHV allowance applied":"AHV posho imetumika","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Weka mshahara wako wa jumla na, ikiwa inapatikana, makato halisi ya kila mwaka ya malipo.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario imekokotolewa katika kivinjari chako.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Angalia mshahara, umri na kiasi cha makato. Makato hayawezi kuzidi mshahara wa jumla.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Chagua hali ya mchango inayolingana na malipo yako ya sasa. Umri pekee hauamua kila kesi maalum.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton ni muktadha hapa pekee. Haibadilishi viwango vya michango ya shirikisho au kukokotoa kodi ya chanzo.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Tumia kiasi cha mwaka kinachoonyeshwa na mwajiri wako au hati ya malipo. Kantoni na lugha haitoshi kuhesabu ushuru wa mtu binafsi.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Malipo ya pensheni na ajali hutofautiana kulingana na mpango na mwajiri. Ikiwa hujui, waache kwa sifuri; matokeo yatakuwa makadirio ya sehemu.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Kodi ya mapato ya kawaida ya kila mwaka haijajumuishwa. Wafanyakazi wa Uswizi ambao hawatozwi kodi kwenye chanzo kwa ujumla hulipa kupitia marejesho ya kodi ya kila mwaka, wala si zuio la kawaida la payslip.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Makadirio ya mishahara ya serikali ya 2026. Inachukua kazi moja ya mfanyakazi na mwaka mzima. Ajira za muda wa mwaka mmoja, waajiri wengi, bonasi, kesi za kuvuka mipaka, hali maalum ya mchango na ukamilishaji wa mtu binafsi zinaweza kubadilisha malipo. Tumia taarifa ya mwajiri wako kwa kiasi cha malipo.","Official 2026 references:":"Marejeleo Rasmi ya 2026:\nViwango vya michango ya","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO na ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 viwango vya juu vya pensheni ya kazini","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Je, hii ni nukuu kamili ya malipo ya nyumbani ya Uswizi?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Na. Inakadiria michango ya kisheria ya wafanyikazi nchini kote na kupunguza kiasi cha malipo mahususi cha kila mwaka unachoingiza. Matokeo yake ni kamili tu kama pembejeo hizo.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Kwa nini ni lazima niingize makato ya pensheni na ajali?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Michango ya pensheni ya kazini inategemea mfuko wa pensheni na mpango. Malipo ya ajali zisizo za kazini hutegemea bima, tasnia na hatari ya mwajiri. Hakuna kiasi kimoja cha mfanyakazi ambacho kinaweza kuhesabiwa kutoka kwa mshahara wa jumla pekee.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Je, inaweza kukokotoa ushuru wa chanzo kutoka kwa jimbo langu?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Na. Ushuru wa kodi ya chanzo hutumia maelezo ya kibinafsi na ya malipo na faili zilizochapishwa zinalenga waajiri na watoa huduma za malipo. Weka kiasi kutoka kwenye payslip yako ya sasa au makadirio ya mwajiri.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Mshahara wa 13 hufanya kazi vipi hapa?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Weka kiasi cha jumla cha malipo moja ya kawaida ya mshahara na uchague malipo 13. Kikokotoo huweka kiasi cha jumla cha mwaka kwanza, huweka kikomo cha michango ya kila mwaka, na hugawanya makadirio yote yanayotokana na malipo 13.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Je, jimbo linabadilisha AVS/AI/APG au viwango vya ukosefu wa ajira?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Viwango vya wafanyikazi wa shirikisho vinavyotumika hapa ni vya nchi nzima. Ushuru wa chanzo mahususi wa Canton na makato mengine ya mwajiri au mpango haukokotolewa kiotomatiki.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Michango ya shirikisho la mwajiri iliyoonyeshwa kando (haijakatwa kutoka kwa wavu wako)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Mwajiri AHV/IV/EO\nUVMP2|Bima ya ukosefu wa ajira kwa waajiri","Employer unemployment insurance":"Bima ya ukosefu wa ajira kwa waajiri","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Viwango vya kisheria vya shirikisho pekee. Pensheni ya mwajiri, bima ya ajali, hazina ya posho ya familia na michango mahususi ya jimbo haijajumuishwa."},"mr":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"स्विस निव्वळ पगार परिदृश्य कॅल्क्युलेटर","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"स्विस पगार कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — एकूण ते निव्वळ वेतन परिस्थिती","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 साठी स्विस कर्मचाऱ्यांच्या वेतन कपातीचा अंदाज लावा. फेडरल AHV/IV/EO आणि बेरोजगारी योगदान पहा, नंतर उपयुक्त 12- किंवा 13-पगाराच्या परिस्थितीसाठी तुमची वास्तविक पेन्शन, अपघात विमा आणि स्त्रोत-कर रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"एक व्यावहारिक 2026 स्विस पेस्लिप परिदृश्य तयार करा. कॅल्क्युलेटर देशव्यापी कर्मचाऱ्यांच्या योगदानाचा अंदाज लावतो आणि पेन्शन, अपघात विमा, विदहोल्डिंग टॅक्स आणि तुम्ही तुमच्या स्वतःच्या पेरोल दस्तऐवजांमधून टाकलेल्या इतर कपाती वजा करतो.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"कॅन्टन्समध्ये फेडरल दर सारखेच आहेत, परंतु तुमची पेन्शन योजना, बिगर व्यावसायिक अपघात प्रीमियम आणि स्रोत कर तुमची योजना, नियोक्ता आणि वैयक्तिक केस यावर अवलंबून असतात. पेस्लिप किंवा वर्तमान नियोक्ता अंदाजानुसार त्या वार्षिक रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा. संदर्भासाठी कँटन आणि कर स्थिती दर्शविली आहे; हे साधन कॅन्टोनल स्रोत-कर सारणी किंवा वार्षिक आयकर पुनर्रचना करत नाही.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"CHF 8,000 प्रति पगार पेमेंट आणि 13 पेमेंटसाठी, वार्षिक एकूण CHF 104,000 आहे. फेडरल कर्मचाऱ्यांच्या योगदानाचा अंदाज वार्षिक पगारातून केला जातो; निव्वळ परिस्थितीचा अंदाज घेण्यासाठी वार्षिक योजना आणि कर कपात प्रविष्ट करा.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"एका नियमित पगार पेमेंटसाठी एकूण (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"दर वर्षी पगार देयके","12 payments":"12 पेमेंट","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 पेमेंट, 13 व्या पगारासह","Age in years":"वर्षांमध्ये वय","Contribution situation":"योगदान परिस्थिती","Employee contributions apply":"कर्मचारी योगदान लागू","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"अद्याप कर्मचारी योगदानाच्या अधीन नाही","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV संदर्भ वयानंतर काम करणे","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 मासिक AHV भत्ता लागू करा","Canton for your payroll context":"तुमच्या पगाराच्या संदर्भासाठी Canton","Tax-at-source situation":"टॅक्स-एट-सोर्स परिस्थिती","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"स्रोतवर कर आकारला जात नाही / स्वतंत्रपणे वार्षिक कर वापरा","Taxed at source":"स्रोतावर कर आकारला","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"तुमच्या पेरोल दस्तऐवजांमधून वार्षिक कपात (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"कर्मचारी पेन्शन कपात (वार्षिक)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"गैर-व्यावसायिक अपघात विमा (वार्षिक)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"स्रोत कर रोखला (वार्षिक)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"इतर कर्मचारी कपाती (वार्षिक)","Estimate net salary":"निव्वळ पगाराचा अंदाज लावा","Reset example":"रीसेट उदाहरण","2026 salary scenario":"2026 पगार परिस्थिती","Gross salary per year":"दर वर्षी एकूण पगार","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"कर्मचारी AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"कर्मचारी बेरोजगारी विमा","Pension deduction entered":"पेन्शन कपात प्रविष्ट केली","Accident insurance entered":"अपघात विमा प्रविष्ट केला","Source tax entered":"स्रोत कर प्रविष्ट केला","Other deductions entered":"इतर वजावट प्रविष्ट केल्या","Total deductions shown":"एकूण कपात दाखवली","Estimated net per year":"दर वर्षी अंदाजे निव्वळ","Average net per salary payment":"सरासरी निव्वळ प्रति पगार पेमेंट","Average net per month":"दरमहा सरासरी निव्वळ","AHV allowance applied":"AHV भत्ता लागू","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"तुमचा एकूण पगार आणि, उपलब्ध असल्यास, वास्तविक वार्षिक वेतन कपात प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये गणना केलेली परिस्थिती.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"पगार, वय आणि कपातीची रक्कम तपासा. वजावट एकूण पगारापेक्षा जास्त असू शकत नाही.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"तुमच्या सध्याच्या पेरोलशी जुळणारी योगदान परिस्थिती निवडा. प्रत्येक विशेष केस केवळ वय ठरवत नाही.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"कँटन फक्त येथे संदर्भ आहे. हे फेडरल योगदान दर बदलत नाही किंवा स्त्रोत कराची गणना करत नाही.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"तुमच्या नियोक्त्याने दाखवलेली वार्षिक रक्कम किंवा पेस्लिप वापरा. वैयक्तिक दर मोजण्यासाठी कॅन्टोन आणि भाषा पुरेसे नाहीत.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"पेन्शन आणि अपघाताची रक्कम योजना आणि नियोक्त्यानुसार बदलते. आपण त्यांना ओळखत नसल्यास, त्यांना शून्यावर सोडा; परिणाम आंशिक अंदाज असेल.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"सामान्य वार्षिक आयकर समाविष्ट नाही. स्विस कर्मचारी ज्यांच्यावर स्रोतावर कर आकारला जात नाही ते सामान्यतः वार्षिक कर रिटर्नद्वारे सेटलमेंट करतात, मानक पेस्लिप विथहोल्डिंगद्वारे नाही.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"फेडरल पेरोल अंदाज दिनांक 2026. यात एका कर्मचाऱ्याची नोकरी आणि पूर्ण वर्ष गृहीत धरले जाते. अर्ध-वर्षाच्या नोकऱ्या, एकाधिक नियोक्ते, बोनस, क्रॉस-बॉर्डर केसेस, विशेष योगदान स्थिती आणि वैयक्तिक राउंडिंग पगार बदलू शकतात. बंधनकारक रकमेसाठी तुमचे नियोक्ता विधान वापरा.","Official 2026 references:":"अधिकृत 2026 संदर्भ:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO आणि ALV योगदान दर","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 व्यावसायिक-पेन्शन थ्रेशोल्ड","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"हे तंतोतंत स्विस टेक-होम-पे कोट आहे का?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"नं. हे वैधानिक राष्ट्रव्यापी कर्मचाऱ्यांच्या योगदानाचा अंदाज लावते आणि तुम्ही एंटर केलेली वार्षिक वेतन-विशिष्ट रक्कम वजा करते. परिणाम फक्त त्या इनपुट्स प्रमाणेच पूर्ण आहे.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"मला पेन्शन आणि अपघात वजावट का भरावी लागेल?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"व्यावसायिक पेन्शन योगदान पेन्शन फंड आणि योजनेवर अवलंबून असते. गैर-व्यावसायिक अपघात प्रीमियम विमा कंपनी, उद्योग आणि नियोक्ता जोखमीवर अवलंबून असतात. केवळ एकूण पगारावरून अनुमान काढता येईल अशी कोणतीही कर्मचारी रक्कम नाही.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"माझ्या कॅन्टोनमधून स्त्रोत कर मोजू शकतो का?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"नं. स्त्रोत-कर टॅरिफ वैयक्तिक आणि वेतनपट तपशील वापरतात आणि प्रकाशित फायली नियोक्ते आणि वेतन-सॉफ्टवेअर प्रदात्यांसाठी आहेत. तुमच्या सध्याच्या पेस्लिप किंवा नियोक्त्याच्या अंदाजातील रक्कम एंटर करा.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"येथे 13वा पगार कसा चालतो?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"एक नियमित पगार पेमेंटची एकूण रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा आणि 13 पेमेंट निवडा. कॅल्क्युलेटर प्रथम एकूण रकमेचे वार्षिकीकरण करतो, वार्षिक योगदान मर्यादा लागू करतो आणि परिणामी निव्वळ अंदाज 13 पेमेंटमध्ये विभाजित करतो.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"कँटन AVS/AI/APG किंवा बेरोजगारी दर बदलते का?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"येथे वापरलेले फेडरल कर्मचारी दर देशव्यापी आहेत. कँटन-विशिष्ट स्रोत कर आणि इतर नियोक्ता किंवा योजना वजावट स्वयंचलितपणे मोजल्या जात नाहीत.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"नियोक्ता फेडरल योगदान वेगळे दाखवले (तुमच्या नेटमधून वजा केलेले नाही)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"नियोक्ता AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"नियोक्ता बेरोजगारी विमा","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"केवळ फेडरल वैधानिक दर. नियोक्ता पेन्शन, अपघात विमा, कौटुंबिक भत्ता निधी आणि कॅन्टोन-विशिष्ट योगदान समाविष्ट नाही."},"te":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"స్విస్ నికర జీతం దృశ్య కాలిక్యులేటర్","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"స్విస్ శాలరీ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — స్థూల నుండి నికర చెల్లింపు దృశ్యం","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 కోసం స్విస్ ఉద్యోగి పేరోల్ తగ్గింపులను అంచనా వేయండి. ఫెడరల్ AHV/IV/EO మరియు నిరుద్యోగ విరాళాలను చూడండి, ఆపై ఉపయోగకరమైన 12- లేదా 13-చెల్లింపు దృశ్యం కోసం మీ వాస్తవ పెన్షన్, ప్రమాద బీమా మరియు మూల-పన్ను మొత్తాలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"ప్రాక్టికల్ 2026 స్విస్ పేస్లిప్ దృశ్యాన్ని రూపొందించండి. కాలిక్యులేటర్ దేశవ్యాప్తంగా ఉద్యోగుల విరాళాలను అంచనా వేస్తుంది మరియు మీ స్వంత పేరోల్ పత్రాల నుండి మీరు నమోదు చేసే పెన్షన్, ప్రమాద బీమా, విత్హోల్డింగ్ పన్ను మరియు ఇతర తగ్గింపులను తీసివేస్తుంది.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"సమాఖ్య రేట్లు ఖండాలలో ఒకే విధంగా ఉంటాయి, కానీ మీ పెన్షన్ ప్లాన్, నాన్-ఆక్యుపేషనల్ యాక్సిడెంట్ ప్రీమియం మరియు సోర్స్ టాక్స్ మీ ప్లాన్, యజమాని మరియు వ్యక్తిగత కేసుపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటాయి. పేస్లిప్ లేదా ప్రస్తుత యజమాని అంచనా నుండి ఆ వార్షిక మొత్తాలను నమోదు చేయండి. కాంటన్ మరియు పన్ను స్థితి సందర్భం కోసం చూపబడింది; ఈ సాధనం కాంటోనల్ సోర్స్-టాక్స్ పట్టికలను లేదా వార్షిక ఆదాయ పన్నును పునర్నిర్మించదు.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"ఒక జీతం చెల్లింపుకు CHF 8,000 మరియు 13 చెల్లింపులకు, వార్షిక స్థూల CHF 104,000. ఫెడరల్ ఉద్యోగి విరాళాలు వార్షిక జీతం నుండి అంచనా వేయబడతాయి; నికర దృష్టాంతాన్ని అంచనా వేయడానికి వార్షిక ప్రణాళిక మరియు పన్ను మినహాయింపులను నమోదు చేయండి.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"ఒక సాధారణ జీతం చెల్లింపు (CHF) కోసం మొత్తం","Salary payments per year":"సంవత్సరానికి జీతం చెల్లింపులు","12 payments":"12 చెల్లింపులు","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 చెల్లింపులు, 13వ జీతంతో సహా","Age in years":"సంవత్సరాలలో వయస్సు","Contribution situation":"కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ పరిస్థితి","Employee contributions apply":"ఉద్యోగి విరాళాలు వర్తిస్తాయి","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"ఇంకా ఉద్యోగి విరాళాలకు లోబడి లేదు","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV సూచన వయస్సు తర్వాత పని చేస్తోంది","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 నెలవారీ AHV భత్యాన్ని వర్తింపజేయండి","Canton for your payroll context":"మీ పేరోల్ సందర్భం కోసం కాంటన్","Tax-at-source situation":"పన్ను-ఎట్-సోర్స్ పరిస్థితి","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"మూలం వద్ద పన్ను విధించబడదు / వార్షిక పన్నును ప్రత్యేకంగా ఉపయోగించండి","Taxed at source":"మూలం వద్ద పన్ను విధించబడింది","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"మీ పేరోల్ పత్రాల నుండి వార్షిక తగ్గింపులు (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"ఉద్యోగి పెన్షన్ మినహాయింపు (వార్షిక)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"వృత్తియేతర ప్రమాద బీమా (వార్షిక)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"మూల పన్ను నిలిపివేయబడింది (వార్షిక)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"ఇతర ఉద్యోగుల తగ్గింపులు (వార్షిక)","Estimate net salary":"నికర జీతం అంచనా వేయండి","Reset example":"ఉదాహరణను రీసెట్ చేయండి","2026 salary scenario":"2026 జీతం దృశ్యం","Gross salary per year":"సంవత్సరానికి స్థూల జీతం","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"ఉద్యోగి AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"ఉద్యోగి నిరుద్యోగ బీమా","Pension deduction entered":"పెన్షన్ తగ్గింపు నమోదు చేయబడింది","Accident insurance entered":"ప్రమాద భీమా నమోదు చేయబడింది","Source tax entered":"మూల పన్ను నమోదు చేయబడింది","Other deductions entered":"ఇతర తగ్గింపులు నమోదు చేయబడ్డాయి","Total deductions shown":"చూపబడిన మొత్తం తగ్గింపులు","Estimated net per year":"సంవత్సరానికి అంచనా వేసిన నికర","Average net per salary payment":"జీతం చెల్లింపుకు సగటు నికర","Average net per month":"నెలకు సగటు నికర","AHV allowance applied":"AHV భత్యం వర్తింపజేయబడింది","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"మీ స్థూల జీతం మరియు అందుబాటులో ఉంటే, వాస్తవ వార్షిక పేరోల్ తగ్గింపులను నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"మీ బ్రౌజర్లో దృశ్యం లెక్కించబడింది.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"జీతం, వయస్సు మరియు తగ్గింపు మొత్తాలను తనిఖీ చేయండి. తగ్గింపులు స్థూల జీతం మించకూడదు.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"మీ ప్రస్తుత పేరోల్కు సరిపోలే సహకార పరిస్థితిని ఎంచుకోండి. ప్రతి ప్రత్యేక కేసును వయస్సు మాత్రమే నిర్ణయించదు.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"కాంటన్ ఇక్కడ మాత్రమే సందర్భం. ఇది ఫెడరల్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ రేట్లను మార్చదు లేదా మూల పన్నును లెక్కించదు.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"మీ యజమాని లేదా పేస్లిప్ చూపిన వార్షిక మొత్తాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి. వ్యక్తిగత టారిఫ్ను లెక్కించడానికి ఒక ఖండం మరియు భాష సరిపోవు.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"ప్లాన్ మరియు యజమానిని బట్టి పెన్షన్ మరియు ప్రమాద మొత్తాలు మారుతూ ఉంటాయి. మీకు అవి తెలియకపోతే, వాటిని సున్నా వద్ద వదిలివేయండి; ఫలితం పాక్షికంగా అంచనా వేయబడుతుంది.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"సాధారణ వార్షిక ఆదాయపు పన్ను చేర్చబడలేదు. మూలం వద్ద పన్ను విధించబడని స్విస్ ఉద్యోగులు సాధారణంగా వార్షిక పన్ను రిటర్న్ ద్వారా దాన్ని పరిష్కరిస్తారు, ప్రామాణిక పేస్లిప్ విత్హోల్డింగ్ కాదు.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"ఫెడరల్ పేరోల్ అంచనా 2026 నాటిది. ఇది ఒక ఉద్యోగి ఉద్యోగం మరియు పూర్తి సంవత్సరాన్ని కలిగి ఉంటుంది. పార్ట్-ఇయర్ ఉద్యోగాలు, బహుళ యజమానులు, బోనస్లు, సరిహద్దు కేసులు, ప్రత్యేక సహకారం స్థితి మరియు వ్యక్తిగత రౌండింగ్ పేరోల్ను మార్చవచ్చు. బైండింగ్ మొత్తం కోసం మీ యజమాని స్టేట్మెంట్ను ఉపయోగించండి.","Official 2026 references:":"అధికారిక 2026 సూచనలు:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO మరియు ALV సహకారం రేట్లు","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 ఆక్యుపేషనల్-పెన్షన్ థ్రెషోల్డ్లు","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"ఇది ఖచ్చితమైన స్విస్ టేక్-హోమ్-పే కోట్ కాదా?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"నం. ఇది చట్టబద్ధమైన దేశవ్యాప్తంగా ఉద్యోగుల విరాళాలను అంచనా వేస్తుంది మరియు మీరు నమోదు చేసే వార్షిక పేరోల్-నిర్దిష్ట మొత్తాలను తీసివేస్తుంది. ఫలితం ఆ ఇన్పుట్ల వలె మాత్రమే పూర్తి అవుతుంది.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"నేను పెన్షన్ మరియు ప్రమాద తగ్గింపులను ఎందుకు నమోదు చేయాలి?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"వృత్తిపరమైన పెన్షన్ విరాళాలు పెన్షన్ ఫండ్ మరియు ప్లాన్పై ఆధారపడి ఉంటాయి. నాన్-ఆక్యుపేషనల్ యాక్సిడెంట్ ప్రీమియంలు బీమా సంస్థ, పరిశ్రమ మరియు యజమాని రిస్క్పై ఆధారపడి ఉంటాయి. స్థూల జీతం నుండి మాత్రమే ఊహించగలిగే ఏ ఒక్క ఉద్యోగి మొత్తం లేదు.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"ఇది నా ఖండం నుండి మూల పన్నును లెక్కించగలదా?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"నం. సోర్స్-టాక్స్ టారిఫ్లు వ్యక్తిగత మరియు పేరోల్ వివరాలను ఉపయోగిస్తాయి మరియు ప్రచురించిన ఫైల్లు యజమానులు మరియు పేరోల్-సాఫ్ట్వేర్ ప్రొవైడర్ల కోసం ఉద్దేశించబడ్డాయి. మీ ప్రస్తుత పేస్లిప్ లేదా యజమాని అంచనా నుండి మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13వ జీతం ఇక్కడ ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"ఒక సాధారణ జీతం చెల్లింపు యొక్క స్థూల మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి మరియు 13 చెల్లింపులను ఎంచుకోండి. కాలిక్యులేటర్ ముందుగా స్థూల మొత్తాన్ని వార్షికం చేస్తుంది, వార్షిక సహకారం పరిమితులను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది మరియు ఫలితంగా వచ్చే నికర అంచనాను 13 చెల్లింపులకు విభజిస్తుంది.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"ఖండం AVS/AI/APG లేదా నిరుద్యోగిత రేటును మారుస్తుందా?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"ఇక్కడ ఉపయోగించిన ఫెడరల్ ఉద్యోగి రేట్లు దేశవ్యాప్తంగా ఉన్నాయి. కాంటన్-నిర్దిష్ట మూలపు పన్ను మరియు ఇతర యజమాని లేదా ప్లాన్ తగ్గింపులు స్వయంచాలకంగా లెక్కించబడవు.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"ఎంప్లాయర్ ఫెడరల్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్‌లు విడిగా చూపబడ్డాయి (మీ నెట్ నుండి తీసివేయబడలేదు)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"యజమాని AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"యజమాని నిరుద్యోగ బీమా","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"ఫెడరల్ చట్టబద్ధమైన రేట్లు మాత్రమే. యజమాని పెన్షన్, ప్రమాద బీమా, కుటుంబ భత్యం ఫండ్ మరియు ఖండం-నిర్దిష్ట విరాళాలు చేర్చబడలేదు."},"ha":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Lissafin labarun kan layi na yanar gizo na Swiss","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Kalkuleta na Albashin Swiss 2026 - Babban Yanayin Biyan Kuɗi","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Kididdigar ragi na albashin ma'aikatan Swiss na 2026. Dubi AHV/IV/EO na tarayya da gudunmawar rashin aikin yi, sannan shigar da ainihin kuɗin fensho, inshorar haɗari da adadin harajin tushe don yanayi mai amfani 12- ko 13-biya.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Gina ingantaccen yanayin biyan kuɗi na Swiss 2026. Kalkuleta yana ƙididdige gudunmawar ma'aikata na ƙasa baki ɗaya kuma yana rage fensho, inshorar haɗari, harajin riƙewa da sauran ragi da kuka shigar daga takaddun biyan kuɗin ku.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Kudin kuɗin tarayya iri ɗaya ne a duk faɗin cantons, amma shirin ku na fensho, ƙimar haɗari marar aiki da harajin tushe ya dogara da shirin ku, ma'aikaci da shari'ar ku. Shigar da waɗannan adadin na shekara-shekara daga lissafin albashi ko kimanta ma'aikata na yanzu. Canton da matsayin haraji an nuna su don mahallin; wannan kayan aikin baya sake gina teburin harajin tushen-canton ko harajin kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Ga CHF 8,000 akan kowane biyan albashi da biyan kuɗi 13, jimlar shekara shine CHF 104,000. An kiyasta gudunmawar ma'aikatan tarayya daga albashin shekara; shigar da shirin shekara-shekara da ragi na haraji don kimanta yanayin yanar gizo.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Babban don biyan albashi na yau da kullun (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Biyan albashi a kowace shekara","12 payments":"12 biya","13 payments, including 13th salary":"biya 13, gami da albashi na 13","Age in years":"Shekaru a cikin shekaru","Contribution situation":"Yanayin gudummawa","Employee contributions apply":"Gudunmawar ma'aikata ta shafi","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Ba a ƙaddamar da gudunmawar ma'aikata ba tukuna","Working after AHV reference age":"Aiki bayan shekarun tunani AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Aiwatar da CHF 1,400 na kowane wata AHV","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton don mahallin biyan kuɗin ku","Tax-at-source situation":"Halin haraji-a-tushen","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Ba a biya haraji a tushe/amfani da haraji na shekara daban","Taxed at source":"An sanya haraji daga tushe","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Cire duk shekara daga takaddun biyan kuɗin ku (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Rage fensho na ma'aikata (shekara-shekara)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Inshorar hatsarori mara sana'a","Source tax withheld (annual)":"An hana haraji tushen (shekara-shekara)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Sauran ragi na ma'aikata (shekara-shekara)","Estimate net salary":"Kimanin net albashi","Reset example":"Sake saitin misali","2026 salary scenario":"yanayin albashi na 2026","Gross salary per year":"Babban albashi a shekara","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Ma'aikaci AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Asusun rashin aikin yi na ma'aikata","Pension deduction entered":"An shiga ragi na fensho","Accident insurance entered":"An shigar da inshorar haɗari","Source tax entered":"An shigar da haraji tushen","Other deductions entered":"An shigar da wasu ragi","Total deductions shown":"Jimlar cirewar da aka nuna","Estimated net per year":"Ƙimar net a kowace shekara","Average net per salary payment":"Matsakaicin gidan yanar gizon kowane biyan albashi","Average net per month":"Matsakaicin net kowane wata","AHV allowance applied":"Anyi amfani da izinin AHV","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Shigar da babban albashin ku kuma, idan akwai, ainihin ragi na albashi na shekara-shekara.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Halin da aka ƙididdige shi a cikin burauzar ku.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Duba albashi, shekaru da adadin raguwa. Ragewa ba zai iya wuce babban albashi ba.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Zaɓi yanayin gudummawar da ya dace da lissafin kuɗin ku na yanzu. Shekaru kadai ba ya ƙayyade kowane lamari na musamman.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton mahallin mahallin ne kawai a nan. Ba ya canza ƙimar gudummawar tarayya ko ƙididdige harajin tushe.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Yi amfani da adadin shekara-shekara da mai aiki ko takardar biyan kuɗi ya nuna. Canton da harshe ba su isa don ƙididdige jadawalin kuɗin fito na mutum ɗaya ba.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Kudin fansho da adadin haɗari sun bambanta da tsari da ma'aikata. Idan ba ku san su ba, ku bar su a sifili; sakamakon zai zama wani ɗan ƙima.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Ba a haɗa harajin shiga na yau da kullun na shekara-shekara ba. Ma'aikatan Swiss waɗanda ba a biya su haraji a tushen gabaɗaya suna daidaita shi ta hanyar dawo da harajin shekara-shekara, ba daidaitaccen tanadin biyan kuɗi ba.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Kididdigar biyan albashi na Tarayya mai kwanan wata 2026. Yana ɗaukar aikin ma'aikaci ɗaya da cikakken shekara. Ayyuka na shekara-shekara, masu daukar ma'aikata da yawa, kari, shari'o'in kan iyaka, matsayi na musamman na gudummawa da zagaye na mutum na iya canza albashi. Yi amfani da bayanin mai aiki don adadin ɗauri.","Official 2026 references:":"Nassoshi na 2026 na hukuma:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO da ƙimar gudummawar ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 Matsakaicin Ma'aikata-fensho","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Shin wannan shine ainihin ƙimar kuɗin-gida na Swiss?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"No. Yana ƙididdige gudunmawar ma'aikata na ƙasa baki ɗaya bisa doka kuma yana rage takamaiman adadin albashin shekara-shekara da kuka shigar. Sakamakon ya cika ne kawai kamar waɗannan abubuwan shigar.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Me yasa dole in shiga fensho da ragi na haɗari?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Gudunmawar fansho ta sana'a ta dogara da asusun fansho da shirin. Ƙididdiga masu haɗari marasa sana'a sun dogara da mai insurer, masana'antu da haɗarin ma'aikata. Babu adadin ma'aikaci guda ɗaya da za'a iya ƙididdige shi daga babban albashi shi kaɗai.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Shin zai iya ƙididdige harajin tushe daga canton na?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"No. Tariffs-haraji suna amfani da bayanan sirri da na biyan kuɗi da fayilolin da aka buga an yi nufin masu aiki da masu samar da software na biyan kuɗi. Shigar da adadin daga lissafin kuɗin ku na yanzu ko kimanta ma'aikata.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Yaya albashi na 13 ke aiki a nan?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Shigar da jimlar adadin biyan albashi na yau da kullun kuma zaɓi biya 13. Ƙididdigar ƙididdiga na shekara-shekara na babban adadin farko, yana aiki da iyakacin gudunmawar shekara, kuma yana rarraba sakamakon ƙididdiga a cikin biyan kuɗi 13.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Shin Canton yana canza AVS/AI/APG ko yawan rashin aikin yi?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Kimanin ma'aikatan tarayya da ake amfani da su a nan suna cikin ƙasa baki ɗaya. Takamaiman harajin tushen Canton da sauran ma'aikata ko ragi na shirin ba a ƙididdige su ta atomatik.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Gudunmawar tarayya ta ma'aikaci an nuna daban (ba a cire shi daga gidan yanar gizon ku ba)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Mai Aiki AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Inshorar rashin aikin yi","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Farashin ƙa'idar tarayya kawai. Ba a haɗa fenshon ma'aikata, inshorar haɗari, asusun ba da izinin iyali da takamaiman gudunmawar kanton."},"tl":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Tantyahin ang mga pagbawas sa suweldo ng empleyado sa Switzerland para sa 2026. Tingnan ang pederal na AHV/IV/EO at mga kontribusyon sa kawalan ng trabaho, pagkatapos ay ilagay ang iyong aktwal na pensiyon, insurance sa aksidente at mga halaga ng source-tax para sa isang kapaki-pakinabang na 12- o 13-pay na senaryo.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Bumuo ng praktikal na 2026 Swiss payslip na senaryo. Tinatantya ng calculator ang mga kontribusyon ng empleyado sa buong bansa at ibinabawas ang pensiyon, insurance sa aksidente, withholding tax at iba pang mga bawas na iyong ipinasok mula sa iyong sariling mga dokumento sa payroll.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"Ang mga pederal na rate ay pareho sa mga canton, ngunit ang iyong pension plan, non-occupational accident premium at source tax ay nakadepende sa iyong plan, employer at personal na kaso. Ipasok ang mga taunang halaga mula sa isang payslip o kasalukuyang pagtatantya ng employer. Ang katayuan ng Canton at buwis ay ipinapakita para sa konteksto; ang tool na ito ay hindi muling bumubuo ng cantonal source-tax table o taunang income tax.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"Para sa CHF 8,000 bawat pagbabayad ng suweldo at 13 pagbabayad, ang taunang kabuuang ay CHF 104,000. Ang mga kontribusyon ng pederal na empleyado ay tinatantya mula sa taunang suweldo; ipasok ang taunang plano at mga bawas sa buwis upang matantya ang netong senaryo.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Gross para sa isang regular na pagbabayad ng suweldo (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Mga pagbabayad ng suweldo bawat taon","12 payments":"12 pagbabayad","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 pagbabayad, kasama ang ika-13 na suweldo","Age in years":"Edad sa mga taon","Contribution situation":"Sitwasyon ng kontribusyon","Employee contributions apply":"Nalalapat ang mga kontribusyon ng empleyado","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Hindi pa napapailalim sa mga kontribusyon ng empleyado","Working after AHV reference age":"Gumagana pagkatapos ng edad ng sangguniang AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Ilapat ang CHF 1,400 buwanang AHV allowance","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton para sa konteksto ng iyong payroll","Tax-at-source situation":"Tax-at-source na sitwasyon","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Hindi binubuwisan sa pinagmulan / gumamit ng taunang buwis nang hiwalay","Taxed at source":"Nabubuwisan sa pinagmulan","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Taunang mga pagbabawas mula sa iyong mga dokumento sa payroll (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Pagbawas ng pensiyon ng empleyado (taon)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Insyurans sa aksidenteng hindi trabaho (taon)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Pinagkukunan ng buwis (taon)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Iba pang mga bawas sa empleyado (taon)","Estimate net salary":"Tantyahin ang netong suweldo","Reset example":"I-reset ang halimbawa","2026 salary scenario":"2026 na senaryo ng suweldo","Gross salary per year":"Gross na suweldo bawat taon","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Empleyado AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Employee unemployment insurance","Pension deduction entered":"Inilagay ang pagbabawas ng pensiyon","Accident insurance entered":"Pumasok ang insurance sa aksidente","Source tax entered":"Inilagay ang source tax","Other deductions entered":"Iba pang mga pagbabawas ang ipinasok","Total deductions shown":"Kabuuang mga pagbabawas na ipinakita","Estimated net per year":"Tinantyang neto bawat taon","Average net per salary payment":"Average na net bawat pagbabayad ng suweldo","Average net per month":"Average net bawat buwan\nInilapat ang","AHV allowance applied":"AHV allowance","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Ilagay ang iyong kabuuang suweldo at, kung mayroon, aktwal na taunang pagbabawas sa suweldo.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario na kinakalkula sa iyong browser.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Tingnan ang suweldo, edad at halaga ng bawas. Ang mga pagbabawas ay hindi maaaring lumampas sa kabuuang suweldo.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Piliin ang sitwasyon ng kontribusyon na tumutugma sa iyong kasalukuyang payroll. Ang edad lamang ay hindi tumutukoy sa bawat espesyal na kaso.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Ang Canton ay konteksto lamang dito. Hindi nito binabago ang mga rate ng kontribusyon ng pederal o kinakalkula ang pinagmulang buwis.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Gamitin ang taunang halaga na ipinapakita ng iyong employer o payslip. Ang isang canton at wika ay hindi sapat upang kalkulahin ang isang indibidwal na taripa.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Ang mga halaga ng pensiyon at aksidente ay nag-iiba ayon sa plano at employer. Kung hindi mo sila kilala, iwanan ang mga ito sa zero; ang resulta ay isang bahagyang pagtatantya.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Hindi kasama ang ordinaryong taunang buwis sa kita. Ang mga empleyadong Swiss na hindi binubuwisan sa pinagmulan ay karaniwang nagbabayad nito sa pamamagitan ng taunang pagbabalik ng buwis, hindi isang karaniwang payslip withholding.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Ang pagtatantya ng pederal na payroll na may petsang 2026. Ipinagpapalagay nito ang isang trabaho ng empleyado at isang buong taon. Ang mga part-year na trabaho, maraming employer, mga bonus, mga kaso sa cross-border, status ng espesyal na kontribusyon at indibidwal na rounding ay maaaring magbago ng payroll. Gamitin ang pahayag ng iyong employer para sa umiiral na halaga.","Official 2026 references:":"Opisyal na 2026 na mga sanggunian:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO at mga rate ng kontribusyon sa ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 occupational-pension threshold","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Ito ba ay eksaktong Swiss take-home-pay na quote?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Hindi. Tinatantya nito ang mga kontribusyon ng empleyado sa buong bansa ayon sa batas at ibinabawas ang taunang mga halagang tukoy sa payroll na iyong ipinasok. Ang resulta ay kasing kumpleto lamang ng mga input na iyon.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Bakit kailangan kong ipasok ang mga pagbabawas ng pensiyon at aksidente?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Ang mga kontribusyon sa pensiyon sa trabaho ay nakadepende sa pondo at plano ng pensiyon. Ang mga premium na hindi pangtrabaho sa aksidente ay nakadepende sa panganib ng insurer, industriya at employer. Walang iisang halaga ng empleyado na mahihinuha mula sa kabuuang suweldo lamang.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Maaari ba nitong kalkulahin ang pinagmumulan ng buwis mula sa aking canton?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Hindi. Ang mga tariff ng source-tax ay gumagamit ng personal at mga detalye ng payroll at ang mga nai-publish na file ay inilaan para sa mga employer at provider ng payroll-software. Ilagay ang halaga mula sa iyong kasalukuyang payslip o pagtatantya ng employer.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Paano gumagana ang ika-13 na suweldo dito?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Ilagay ang kabuuang halaga ng isang regular na pagbabayad ng suweldo at pumili ng 13 pagbabayad. Ang calculator ay nag-i- annualize muna ng kabuuang halaga, naglalapat ng taunang mga limitasyon sa kontribusyon, at hinahati ang resultang netong pagtatantya sa 13 mga pagbabayad.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Nagbabago ba ang canton ng AVS/AI/APG o mga rate ng kawalan ng trabaho?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"Ang mga rate ng pederal na empleyado na ginagamit dito ay sa buong bansa. Hindi awtomatikong kinakalkula ang pinagmumulan ng buwis na partikular sa Canton at iba pang mga pagbabawas ng employer o plano.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Mga pederal na kontribusyon ng employer na ipinapakita nang hiwalay (hindi ibinabawas sa iyong net)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Employer AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Seguro sa kawalan ng trabaho ng employer","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Mga rate ng ayon sa batas ng federal lamang. Ang pensiyon ng employer, insurance sa aksidente, pondo ng allowance ng pamilya at mga kontribusyong partikular sa canton ay hindi kasama."},"ta":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"சுவிஸ் நிகர சம்பள சூழ்நிலை கால்குலேட்டர்","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"சுவிஸ் சம்பளக் கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — நிகர ஊதியம் வரை","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 ஆம் ஆண்டிற்கான சுவிஸ் ஊழியர்களின் சம்பளப் பட்டியல் விலக்குகளை மதிப்பிடவும். ஃபெடரல் AHV/IV/EO மற்றும் வேலையின்மை பங்களிப்புகளைப் பார்க்கவும், பின்னர் பயனுள்ள 12- அல்லது 13-செலுத்துவதற்கான சூழ்நிலையில் உங்களின் உண்மையான ஓய்வூதியம், விபத்துக் காப்பீடு மற்றும் ஆதார-வரித் தொகைகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"ஒரு நடைமுறை 2026 சுவிஸ் பேஸ்லிப் காட்சியை உருவாக்கவும். கால்குலேட்டர் நாடு தழுவிய பணியாளர் பங்களிப்புகளை மதிப்பிடுகிறது மற்றும் ஓய்வூதியம், விபத்து காப்பீடு, பிடித்தம் செய்யும் வரி மற்றும் உங்கள் சொந்த ஊதிய ஆவணங்களிலிருந்து நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் பிற விலக்குகளை கழிக்கிறது.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"கூட்டாட்சிக் கட்டணங்கள் அனைத்து மண்டலங்களிலும் ஒரே மாதிரியாக இருக்கும், ஆனால் உங்கள் ஓய்வூதியத் திட்டம், தொழில் அல்லாத விபத்து பிரீமியம் மற்றும் மூல வரி ஆகியவை உங்கள் திட்டம், முதலாளி மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட வழக்கைப் பொறுத்தது. அந்த ஆண்டுத் தொகைகளை ஒரு ஊதியச் சீட்டு அல்லது தற்போதைய முதலாளி மதிப்பீட்டில் உள்ளிடவும். கேண்டன் மற்றும் வரி நிலை ஆகியவை சூழலுக்காக காட்டப்படுகின்றன; இந்த கருவி மண்டல மூல-வரி அட்டவணைகள் அல்லது வருடாந்திர வருமான வரியை மறுகட்டமைக்கவில்லை.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"ஒரு சம்பளம் மற்றும் 13 கொடுப்பனவுகளுக்கு CHF 8,000 க்கு, ஆண்டு மொத்த தொகை CHF 104,000 ஆகும். கூட்டாட்சி ஊழியர் பங்களிப்புகள் வருடாந்திர சம்பளத்தில் இருந்து மதிப்பிடப்படுகிறது; நிகர சூழ்நிலையை மதிப்பிடுவதற்கு வருடாந்திர திட்டம் மற்றும் வரி விலக்குகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"ஒரு வழக்கமான சம்பளத்திற்கான மொத்த தொகை (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"வருடத்திற்கான சம்பளம்","12 payments":"12 கொடுப்பனவுகள்","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 வது சம்பளம் உட்பட 13 கொடுப்பனவுகள்","Age in years":"ஆண்டுகளில் வயது","Contribution situation":"பங்களிப்பு நிலைமை","Employee contributions apply":"பணியாளர் பங்களிப்புகள் பொருந்தும்","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"பணியாளர் பங்களிப்புகளுக்கு இன்னும் உட்பட்டது இல்லை","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV குறிப்பு வயதுக்குப் பிறகு வேலை","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 மாதாந்திர AHV கொடுப்பனவைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்","Canton for your payroll context":"உங்கள் ஊதியச் சூழலுக்கான கேன்டன்","Tax-at-source situation":"வரி-மூல நிலைமை","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"மூலத்தில் வரி விதிக்கப்படவில்லை / ஆண்டு வரியை தனியாகப் பயன்படுத்தவும்","Taxed at source":"மூலத்தில் வரி விதிக்கப்பட்டது","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"உங்கள் ஊதிய ஆவணங்களிலிருந்து (CHF) வருடாந்திர விலக்குகள்","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"பணியாளர் ஓய்வூதியப் பிடித்தம் (ஆண்டு)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"தொழில் சாராத விபத்து காப்பீடு (ஆண்டு)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"மூல வரி நிறுத்தப்பட்டது (ஆண்டு)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"பிற பணியாளர் விலக்குகள் (ஆண்டு)","Estimate net salary":"நிகர சம்பளத்தை மதிப்பிடவும்","Reset example":"உதாரணத்தை மீட்டமைக்கவும்","2026 salary scenario":"2026 சம்பள சூழ்நிலை","Gross salary per year":"வருடத்திற்கு மொத்த சம்பளம்","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"பணியாளர் AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"பணியாளர் வேலையின்மை காப்பீடு","Pension deduction entered":"ஓய்வூதியப் பிடித்தம் உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Accident insurance entered":"விபத்து காப்பீடு உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Source tax entered":"மூல வரி உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Other deductions entered":"பிற விலக்குகள் உள்ளிடப்பட்டுள்ளன","Total deductions shown":"மொத்த விலக்குகள் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ளன","Estimated net per year":"ஆண்டுக்கு மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிகரம்","Average net per salary payment":"ஒரு சம்பளம் செலுத்தும் சராசரி நிகரம்","Average net per month":"மாதத்திற்கு சராசரி நிகரம்","AHV allowance applied":"AHV கொடுப்பனவு பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"உங்கள் மொத்த சம்பளம் மற்றும் இருந்தால், உண்மையான வருடாந்திர ஊதிய விலக்குகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"உங்கள் உலாவியில் காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"சம்பளம், வயது மற்றும் விலக்கு தொகையை சரிபார்க்கவும். விலக்குகள் மொத்த சம்பளத்தை விட அதிகமாக இருக்கக்கூடாது.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"உங்கள் தற்போதைய ஊதியத்துடன் பொருந்தக்கூடிய பங்களிப்பு சூழ்நிலையைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும். ஒவ்வொரு சிறப்பு வழக்கையும் வயது மட்டும் தீர்மானிக்காது.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"காண்டன் என்பது இங்கு மட்டும் தான். இது கூட்டாட்சி பங்களிப்பு விகிதங்களை மாற்றாது அல்லது மூல வரியைக் கணக்கிடாது.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"உங்கள் பணியமர்த்துபவர் அல்லது பேஸ்லிப் மூலம் காட்டப்படும் வருடாந்திரத் தொகையைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். தனி நபர் கட்டணத்தை கணக்கிடுவதற்கு ஒரு மண்டலமும் மொழியும் போதாது.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"ஓய்வூதியம் மற்றும் விபத்துத் தொகைகள் திட்டம் மற்றும் முதலாளியைப் பொறுத்து மாறுபடும். நீங்கள் அவர்களை அறியவில்லை என்றால், அவற்றை பூஜ்ஜியத்தில் விட்டு விடுங்கள்; இதன் விளைவாக ஒரு பகுதி மதிப்பீடு இருக்கும்.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"சாதாரண வருடாந்திர வருமான வரி சேர்க்கப்படவில்லை. மூலத்தில் வரி விதிக்கப்படாத சுவிஸ் ஊழியர்கள் பொதுவாக வருடாந்திர வரி வருமானத்தின் மூலம் அதைத் தீர்க்கிறார்கள், நிலையான ஊதியம் பிடித்தம் அல்ல.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"2026 தேதியிட்ட ஃபெடரல் சம்பளப் பட்டியல் மதிப்பீடு. இது ஒரு ஊழியர் வேலை மற்றும் முழு வருடத்தையும் எடுத்துக்கொள்கிறது. பகுதி ஆண்டு வேலைகள், பல முதலாளிகள், போனஸ்கள், எல்லை தாண்டிய வழக்குகள், சிறப்பு பங்களிப்பு நிலை மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட ரவுண்டிங் ஆகியவை ஊதியத்தை மாற்றலாம். பிணைப்புத் தொகைக்கு உங்கள் முதலாளி அறிக்கையைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","Official 2026 references:":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ 2026 குறிப்புகள்:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO மற்றும் ALV பங்களிப்பு விகிதங்கள்","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 தொழில்-ஓய்வூதிய வரம்புகள்","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"இது சரியான சுவிஸ் டேக்-ஹோம்-பே மேற்கோள்தானா?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"எண். இது சட்டப்பூர்வ நாடு தழுவிய பணியாளர் பங்களிப்புகளை மதிப்பிடுகிறது மற்றும் நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் வருடாந்திர ஊதிய-குறிப்பிட்ட தொகைகளைக் கழிக்கிறது. அந்த உள்ளீடுகளைப் போலவே முடிவும் முழுமையானது.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"நான் ஏன் ஓய்வூதியம் மற்றும் விபத்து விலக்குகளை உள்ளிட வேண்டும்?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"தொழில்சார் ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்புகள் ஓய்வூதிய நிதி மற்றும் திட்டத்தைப் பொறுத்தது. தொழில் அல்லாத விபத்து பிரீமியங்கள் காப்பீட்டாளர், தொழில் மற்றும் முதலாளியின் அபாயத்தைப் பொறுத்தது. மொத்த சம்பளத்தில் இருந்து மட்டும் ஊகிக்கக்கூடிய எந்த ஒரு ஊழியர் தொகையும் இல்லை.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"எனது மண்டலத்திலிருந்து மூல வரியைக் கணக்கிட முடியுமா?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"எண். மூல-வரி கட்டணங்கள் தனிப்பட்ட மற்றும் ஊதிய விவரங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன மற்றும் வெளியிடப்பட்ட கோப்புகள் முதலாளிகள் மற்றும் ஊதிய-மென்பொருள் வழங்குநர்களுக்காக வடிவமைக்கப்பட்டவை. உங்களின் தற்போதைய பேஸ்லிப் அல்லது முதலாளி மதிப்பீட்டில் இருந்து தொகையை உள்ளிடவும்.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13வது சம்பளம் இங்கு எப்படி வேலை செய்கிறது?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"ஒரு வழக்கமான சம்பளத்தின் மொத்தத் தொகையை உள்ளிட்டு 13 கொடுப்பனவுகளைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும். கால்குலேட்டர் முதலில் மொத்தத் தொகையை ஆண்டு படுத்துகிறது, வருடாந்திர பங்களிப்பு வரம்புகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது மற்றும் அதன் விளைவாக வரும் நிகர மதிப்பீட்டை 13 கொடுப்பனவுகளில் பிரிக்கிறது.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"கேண்டன் AVS/AI/APG அல்லது வேலையின்மை விகிதங்களை மாற்றுகிறதா?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"இங்கு பயன்படுத்தப்படும் கூட்டாட்சி ஊழியர்களின் விகிதங்கள் நாடு முழுவதும் உள்ளன. கான்டன்-குறிப்பிட்ட மூல வரி மற்றும் பிற முதலாளி அல்லது திட்ட விலக்குகள் தானாக கணக்கிடப்படாது.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"முதலாளியின் கூட்டாட்சி பங்களிப்புகள் தனித்தனியாகக் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ளன (உங்கள் நிகரத்திலிருந்து கழிக்கப்படவில்லை)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"முதலாளி AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"முதலாளி வேலையின்மை காப்பீடு","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"கூட்டாட்சி சட்டப்படியான கட்டணங்கள் மட்டுமே. முதலாளி ஓய்வூதியம், விபத்துக் காப்பீடு, குடும்பக் கொடுப்பனவு நிதி மற்றும் கேண்டன் சார்ந்த பங்களிப்புகள் சேர்க்கப்படவில்லை."},"fa":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"ماشین حساب سناریوی حقوق خالص سوئیس","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"ماشین حساب حقوق سوئیس 2026 - سناریوی دستمزد ناخالص به خالص","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"تخمین کسر حقوق و دستمزد کارمندان سوئیس برای سال 2026. به AHV/IV/EO فدرال و سهم بیکاری مراجعه کنید، سپس مبلغ واقعی بازنشستگی، بیمه حوادث و مبالغ مالیات منبع را برای یک سناریوی مفید 12 یا 13 پرداختی وارد کنید.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"ساخت یک سناریوی عملی فیش حقوقی 2026 سوئیس. ماشین حساب میزان مشارکت کارکنان در سراسر کشور را تخمین می زند و حقوق بازنشستگی، بیمه حوادث، مالیات تکلیفی و سایر کسوراتی را که وارد می کنید از اسناد حقوق و دستمزد خود کم می کند.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"نرخ های فدرال در سراسر کانتون ها یکسان است، اما طرح بازنشستگی، حق بیمه حوادث غیر شغلی و مالیات منبع به برنامه، کارفرما و پرونده شخصی شما بستگی دارد. آن مبالغ سالانه را از فیش حقوقی یا برآورد فعلی کارفرما وارد کنید. وضعیت کانتون و مالیات برای زمینه نشان داده شده است. این ابزار جداول مالیات منبع کانتونی یا مالیات بر درآمد سالانه را بازسازی نمی کند.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"برای 8000 فرانک فرانک به ازای هر پرداخت حقوق و 13 پرداخت، ناخالص سالانه 104000 فرانک فرانک است. سهم کارکنان فدرال از حقوق سالانه تخمین زده می شود. برنامه سالانه و کسر مالیات را برای برآورد سناریوی خالص وارد کنید.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"ناخالص برای یک پرداخت معمولی حقوق (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"پرداخت حقوق در سال","12 payments":"12 پرداخت","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 پرداخت، از جمله حقوق سیزدهم","Age in years":"سن بر حسب سال","Contribution situation":"وضعیت مشارکت","Employee contributions apply":"کمک های مشارکتی کارکنان اعمال می شود","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"هنوز مشمول مشارکت کارکنان نیست","Working after AHV reference age":"کار بعد از سن مرجع AHV","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"کمک هزینه ماهانه 1400 فرانک فرانک را برای AHV اعمال کنید","Canton for your payroll context":"کانتون برای زمینه حقوق و دستمزد شما","Tax-at-source situation":"وضعیت مالیات در مبدا","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"در مبدأ مشمول مالیات نیست / مالیات سالانه را جداگانه استفاده کنید","Taxed at source":"مالیات در مبدا","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"کسورات سالانه از اسناد حقوق و دستمزد شما (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"کسور بازنشستگی کارمند (سالانه)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"بیمه حوادث غیر شغلی (سالانه)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"مالیات کسر شده منبع (سالانه)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"سایر کسورات کارکنان (سالانه)","Estimate net salary":"دستمزد خالص را برآورد کنید","Reset example":"نمونه بازنشانی","2026 salary scenario":"سناریوی حقوق و دستمزد 2026","Gross salary per year":"حقوق ناخالص در سال","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"کارمند AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"بیمه بیکاری کارکنان","Pension deduction entered":"کسر بازنشستگی وارد شد","Accident insurance entered":"بیمه حوادث وارد شد","Source tax entered":"مالیات منبع وارد شده است","Other deductions entered":"کاسورهای دیگر وارد شده است","Total deductions shown":"مجموع کسر نشان داده شده است","Estimated net per year":"تخمین خالص در سال","Average net per salary payment":"میانگین خالص پرداخت به ازای هر حقوق","Average net per month":"میانگین خالص در ماه","AHV allowance applied":"کمک هزینه AHV اعمال شد","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"دستمزد ناخالص و، در صورت وجود، کسر واقعی حقوق و دستمزد سالانه خود را وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"سناریو در مرورگر شما محاسبه شده است.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"مقدار حقوق، سن و کسر را بررسی کنید. کسورات نمی تواند بیشتر از حقوق ناخالص باشد.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"وضعیت مشارکت را انتخاب کنید که با حقوق و دستمزد فعلی شما مطابقت دارد. سن به تنهایی تعیین کننده هر مورد خاص نیست.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"کانتون فقط در اینجا متن است. این نرخ سهم فدرال را تغییر نمی دهد یا مالیات منبع را محاسبه نمی کند.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"از مبلغ سالانه نشان داده شده توسط کارفرما یا فیش حقوقی خود استفاده کنید. یک کانتون و زبان برای محاسبه تعرفه فردی کافی نیست.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"میزان بازنشستگی و حوادث بسته به طرح و کارفرما متفاوت است. اگر آنها را نمی شناسید، آنها را در صفر رها کنید. نتیجه یک تخمین جزئی خواهد بود.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"مالیات بر درآمد عادی سالانه شامل نمیشود. کارمندان سوئیسی که در مبدأ مشمول مالیات نیستند، عموماً آن را از طریق اظهارنامه مالیاتی سالانه تسویه می کنند، نه یک کسر استاندارد فیش حقوقی.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"برآورد حقوق و دستمزد فدرال مورخ 2026. یک شغل کارمند و یک سال کامل را فرض میکند. مشاغل پاره سال، کارفرمایان متعدد، پاداش ها، پرونده های فرامرزی، وضعیت سهم ویژه و گرد کردن فردی می توانند لیست حقوق و دستمزد را تغییر دهند. از بیانیه کارفرما برای مبلغ الزام آور استفاده کنید.","Official 2026 references:":"مرجع رسمی 2026:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"نرخ مشارکت AHV/IV/EO و ALV","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"آستانه بازنشستگی شغلی 2026","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"آیا این یک نقل قول دقیق سوئیس است؟","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"شماره. این کمک های قانونی کارمندان در سراسر کشور را تخمین می زند و مبالغ سالانه حقوق و دستمزد خاص را که وارد می کنید کم می کند. نتیجه فقط به اندازه آن ورودی ها کامل است.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"چرا باید کسورات بازنشستگی و حوادث را وارد کنم؟","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"سهم بازنشستگی شغلی به صندوق بازنشستگی و برنامه بستگی دارد. حق بیمه حوادث غیر شغلی به ریسک بیمه گر، صنعت و کارفرما بستگی دارد. هیچ مبلغ واحدی وجود ندارد که بتوان از حقوق ناخالص به تنهایی استنباط کرد.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"آیا می تواند مالیات منبع را از کانتون من محاسبه کند؟","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"شماره. در تعرفه های مالیات منبع از مشخصات شخصی و حقوق و دستمزد استفاده می شود و فایل های منتشر شده برای کارفرمایان و ارائه دهندگان نرم افزار حقوق و دستمزد در نظر گرفته شده است. مبلغ را از فیش حقوقی فعلی یا برآورد کارفرما وارد کنید.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"حقوق سیزدهم اینجا چگونه کار می کند؟","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"مبلغ ناخالص یک پرداخت معمولی حقوق را وارد کنید و 13 پرداخت را انتخاب کنید. ماشین حساب ابتدا مبلغ ناخالص را سالانه می کند، محدودیت های سهم سالانه را اعمال می کند، و برآورد خالص حاصل را بین 13 پرداخت تقسیم می کند.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"آیا کانتون AVS/AI/APG یا نرخ بیکاری را تغییر میدهد؟","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"نرخهای کارمندان فدرال که در اینجا استفاده میشوند در سراسر کشور هستند. مالیات منبع خاص کانتون و سایر کسرهای کارفرما یا طرح به طور خودکار محاسبه نمی شود.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"کمک‌های فدرال کارفرما به طور جداگانه نشان داده می‌شود (از خالص شما کسر نمی‌شود)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"کارفرما AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"بیمه بیکاری کارفرما","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"فقط نرخ‌های قانونی فدرال. بازنشستگی کارفرما، بیمه حوادث، صندوق کمک هزینه خانواده و کمک های خاص کانتون شامل نمی شود."},"am":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"የስዊስ የተጣራ ደመወዝ ሁኔታ ማስያ","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"የስዊስ ደሞዝ ካልኩሌተር 2026 — ከጠቅላላ ወደ የተጣራ ክፍያ ሁኔታ","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"ለ2026 የስዊዘርላንድ ሰራተኛ ደመወዝ ተቀናሾችን ይገምቱ።የፌዴራል AHV/IV/EOን እና የስራ አጥ መዋጮዎችን ይመልከቱ፣ከዚያም ትክክለኛውን የጡረታ፣የአደጋ መድን እና የምንጭ ታክስ መጠንን ለ12 ወይም 13-ክፍያ ሁኔታ ያስገቡ።","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"ተግባራዊ የሆነ የ2026 የስዊስ ደሞዝ ሁኔታን ይገንቡ። ካልኩሌተሩ በአገር አቀፍ ደረጃ የሰራተኞችን መዋጮ ይገምታል እና ከራስዎ የደመወዝ ሰነድ የሚያስገቡትን የጡረታ፣ የአደጋ መድን፣ የተቀናሽ ታክስ እና ሌሎች ተቀናሾችን ይቀንሳል።","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"የፌዴራል ዋጋዎች በካንቶኖች ውስጥ አንድ አይነት ናቸው፣ ነገር ግን የጡረታ እቅድዎ፣ ከስራ ውጭ የሆነ የአደጋ ዓረቦን እና የምንጭ ግብር በእቅድዎ፣ በአሰሪዎ እና በግል ጉዳይዎ ይወሰናል። እነዚያን አመታዊ መጠኖች ከክፍያ ደብተር ወይም አሁን ካለው የአሰሪ ግምት ያስገቡ። ካንቶን እና የታክስ ሁኔታ ለዐውደ-ጽሑፉ ይታያሉ; ይህ መሳሪያ የካንቶናል ምንጭ-ታክስ ሰንጠረዦችን ወይም ዓመታዊ የገቢ ግብርን እንደገና አይገነባም.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"ለ CHF 8,000 በደመወዝ ክፍያ እና 13 ክፍያዎች ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ ገቢ CHF 104,000 ነው። የፌደራል ሰራተኛ መዋጮዎች ከዓመታዊ ደመወዝ ይገመታል; የተጣራውን ሁኔታ ለመገመት ዓመታዊ እቅድ እና የግብር ቅነሳዎችን ያስገቡ.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"ጠቅላላ ለአንድ መደበኛ የደመወዝ ክፍያ (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"የደመወዝ ክፍያዎች በአመት","12 payments":"12 ክፍያዎች","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 ክፍያዎች፣ 13ኛ ደሞዝን ጨምሮ","Age in years":"ዕድሜ በዓመታት","Contribution situation":"የአስተዋጽዖ ሁኔታ","Employee contributions apply":"የሰራተኛ መዋጮ ተግባራዊ ይሆናል።","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"ለሰራተኛ መዋጮ ገና አልተገዛም።","Working after AHV reference age":"ከ AHV ማጣቀሻ ዕድሜ በኋላ በመስራት ላይ","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"የ CHF 1,400 ወርሃዊ AHV አበል ተግብር","Canton for your payroll context":"ካንቶን ለደመወዝ አገባብዎ","Tax-at-source situation":"የታክስ-በምንጭ ሁኔታ","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"በምንጭ አይቀረጥም / አመታዊ ታክስን ለብቻ ይጠቀሙ","Taxed at source":"የምንጩ ታክስ","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"ከእርስዎ የደመወዝ ክፍያ ሰነዶች (CHF) ዓመታዊ ተቀናሾች","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"የሰራተኛ ጡረታ ቅነሳ (ዓመታዊ)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"የስራ ያልሆነ የአደጋ መድን (ዓመታዊ)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"የምንጭ ታክስ ተቀናሽ (ዓመታዊ)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"የሌሎች የሰራተኞች ተቀናሾች (ዓመታዊ)","Estimate net salary":"የተጣራ ደሞዝ ግምት","Reset example":"ምሳሌን ዳግም አስጀምር","2026 salary scenario":"2026 የደመወዝ ሁኔታ","Gross salary per year":"ጠቅላላ ደሞዝ በአመት","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"ሰራተኛ AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"የሰራተኛ የስራ አጥነት መድን","Pension deduction entered":"የጡረታ ቅነሳ ገብቷል።","Accident insurance entered":"የአደጋ መድን ገብቷል።","Source tax entered":"የምንጭ ግብር ገብቷል።","Other deductions entered":"ሌሎች ተቀናሾች ገብተዋል።","Total deductions shown":"ጠቅላላ ተቀናሾች ታይተዋል።","Estimated net per year":"በዓመት የሚገመተው የተጣራ","Average net per salary payment":"በደመወዝ ክፍያ አማካኝ የተጣራ","Average net per month":"አማካይ በወር","AHV allowance applied":"AHV አበል ተተግብሯል።","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"ጠቅላላ ደሞዝዎን ያስገቡ እና ካለ ትክክለኛ አመታዊ የደመወዝ ተቀናሾች።","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ያለው ሁኔታ ይሰላል።","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"የደሞዙን ዕድሜ እና የተቀናሽ መጠን ያረጋግጡ። ተቀናሾች ከጠቅላላ ደሞዝ መብለጥ አይችሉም።","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"ከአሁኑ የደመወዝ ክፍያዎ ጋር የሚዛመደውን የአስተዋጽኦ ሁኔታ ይምረጡ። ዕድሜ ብቻውን እያንዳንዱን ልዩ ጉዳይ አይወስንም.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"ካንቶን አውድ እዚህ ብቻ ነው። የፌዴራል መዋጮ ተመኖችን አይለውጥም ወይም የምንጭ ታክስን አያሰላም።","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"በቀጣሪዎ የሚታየውን አመታዊ መጠን ወይም የክፍያ ደብተር ይጠቀሙ። የግለሰብን ታሪፍ ለማስላት ካንቶን እና ቋንቋ በቂ አይደሉም።","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"የጡረታ እና የአደጋ መጠን እንደ እቅድ እና አሰሪ ይለያያል። ካላወቃችኋቸው በዜሮ ተዋቸው; ውጤቱ ከፊል ግምት ይሆናል.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"የተራ ዓመታዊ የገቢ ግብር አልተካተተም። ከምንጩ ያልተቀጡ የስዊዘርላንድ ሰራተኞች በዓመታዊ የታክስ ተመላሽ እንጂ መደበኛ የደመወዝ ተቀናሽ አይደለም።","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"የፌዴራል የደመወዝ ክፍያ ግምት እ.ኤ.አ. የትርፍ ዓመት ስራዎች፣ ብዙ ቀጣሪዎች፣ ጉርሻዎች፣ ድንበር ተሻጋሪ ጉዳዮች፣ ልዩ መዋጮ ሁኔታ እና የግለሰብ ማጠጋጋት የደመወዝ ክፍያን ሊቀይሩ ይችላሉ። ለማሰሪያው መጠን የአሰሪዎን መግለጫ ይጠቀሙ።","Official 2026 references:":"ኦፊሴላዊ 2026 ዋቢዎች፡-","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO እና ALV መዋጮ ተመኖች","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 የሙያ-ጡረታ ገደቦች","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"ይህ ትክክለኛ የስዊስ የቤት ክፍያ ጥቅስ ነው?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"ቁ. በህግ የተደነገገው በአገር አቀፍ ደረጃ የሰራተኞችን መዋጮ ይገምታል እና የሚያስገቡትን ዓመታዊ የደመወዝ-ተኮር መጠን ይቀንሳል። ውጤቱ እንደ እነዚህ ግብዓቶች ብቻ የተሟላ ነው.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"ለምንድነው የጡረታ እና የአደጋ ቅነሳዎች መግባት አለብኝ?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"የስራ ጡረታ መዋጮ በጡረታ ፈንድ እና እቅድ ላይ የተመሰረተ ነው። ከስራ ውጪ ያሉ የአደጋ ክፍያዎች በኢንሹራንስ ሰጪው፣ በኢንዱስትሪው እና በአሰሪው ስጋት ላይ ይወሰናሉ። ከጠቅላላ ደሞዝ ብቻ የሚገመት አንድም የሰራተኛ መጠን የለም።","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"ከኔ ካንቶን የምንጭ ታክስን ማስላት ይችላል?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"አይ. የምንጭ-ታክስ ታሪፎች የግል እና የደመወዝ ዝርዝሮችን ይጠቀማሉ እና የታተሙት ፋይሎች ለቀጣሪዎች እና ለክፍያ-ሶፍትዌር አቅራቢዎች የታሰቡ ናቸው። መጠኑን አሁን ካለህበት የክፍያ ደብተር ወይም የአሰሪ ግምት አስገባ።","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13ኛ ደሞዝ እዚህ እንዴት ይሰራል?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"የአንድ መደበኛ የደመወዝ ክፍያ ጠቅላላ መጠን ያስገቡ እና 13 ክፍያዎችን ይምረጡ። ካልኩሌተሩ አጠቃላይ መጠኑን በመጀመሪያ አመታዊ ያደርጋል፣ አመታዊ የመዋጮ ገደቦችን ይተገበራል እና የተገኘውን የተጣራ ግምት በ13ቱ ክፍያዎች ያካፍላል።","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"ካንቶን AVS/AI/APG ወይም የስራ አጥነት መጠን ይለውጣል?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"የፌዴራል የሰራተኞች ተመኖች እዚህ ጥቅም ላይ የዋሉት በአገር አቀፍ ደረጃ ነው። ካንቶን-ተኮር የምንጭ ታክስ እና ሌሎች ቀጣሪዎች ወይም የእቅድ ተቀናሾች በራስ ሰር አይሰሉም።","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"የአሰሪ ፌዴራል መዋጮዎች ተለይተው የሚታዩ ናቸው (ከእርስዎ መረብ ያልተቀነሰ)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"ቀጣሪ AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"የአሰሪ የስራ አጥ መድን","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"የፌዴራል ህጋዊ ተመኖች ብቻ። የአሰሪ ጡረታ፣ የአደጋ መድን፣ የቤተሰብ አበል ፈንድ እና ካንቶን-ተኮር መዋጮዎች አልተካተቱም።"},"gu":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"સ્વિસ નેટ પગાર દૃશ્ય કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"સ્વિસ સેલેરી કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — ગ્રોસ ટુ નેટ પે સિનારિયો","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"2026 માટે સ્વિસ કર્મચારીના પેરોલ કપાતનો અંદાજ કાઢો. ફેડરલ AHV/IV/EO અને બેરોજગારી યોગદાન જુઓ, પછી ઉપયોગી 12- અથવા 13-પગાર દૃશ્ય માટે તમારું વાસ્તવિક પેન્શન, અકસ્માત વીમો અને સ્ત્રોત-કરની રકમ દાખલ કરો.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"વ્યવહારિક 2026 સ્વિસ પેસ્લિપ દૃશ્ય બનાવો. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર રાષ્ટ્રવ્યાપી કર્મચારી યોગદાનનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે અને તમારા પોતાના પગારપત્રક દસ્તાવેજોમાંથી તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે પેન્શન, અકસ્માત વીમો, વિથહોલ્ડિંગ ટેક્સ અને અન્ય કપાત બાદ કરે છે.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"ફેડરલ દરો સમગ્ર કેન્ટોન્સમાં સમાન છે, પરંતુ તમારી પેન્શન યોજના, બિન-વ્યવસાયિક અકસ્માત પ્રીમિયમ અને સ્ત્રોત કર તમારી યોજના, નોકરીદાતા અને વ્યક્તિગત કેસ પર આધારિત છે. પેસ્લિપ અથવા વર્તમાન એમ્પ્લોયર અંદાજમાંથી તે વાર્ષિક રકમ દાખલ કરો. સંદર્ભ માટે કેન્ટન અને ટેક્સ સ્ટેટસ બતાવવામાં આવે છે; આ સાધન કેન્ટોનલ સ્ત્રોત-કર કોષ્ટકો અથવા વાર્ષિક આવકવેરાનું પુનઃનિર્માણ કરતું નથી.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"પગાર ચુકવણી અને 13 ચૂકવણી દીઠ CHF 8,000 માટે, વાર્ષિક કુલ CHF 104,000 છે. ફેડરલ કર્મચારીના યોગદાનનો અંદાજ વાર્ષિક પગારમાંથી કરવામાં આવે છે; ચોખ્ખી પરિસ્થિતિનો અંદાજ કાઢવા વાર્ષિક યોજના અને કર કપાત દાખલ કરો.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"એક નિયમિત પગાર ચુકવણી (CHF) માટે કુલ","Salary payments per year":"દર વર્ષે પગાર ચૂકવણી","12 payments":"12 ચુકવણીઓ","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 ચૂકવણી, 13મા પગાર સહિત","Age in years":"વર્ષોમાં ઉંમર","Contribution situation":"યોગદાન પરિસ્થિતિ","Employee contributions apply":"કર્મચારી યોગદાન લાગુ","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"હજુ સુધી કર્મચારી યોગદાનને આધીન નથી","Working after AHV reference age":"AHV સંદર્ભ વય પછી કામ કરવું","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"CHF 1,400 માસિક AHV ભથ્થું લાગુ કરો","Canton for your payroll context":"તમારા પેરોલ સંદર્ભ માટે કેન્ટન","Tax-at-source situation":"ટેક્સ-એટ-સોર્સ પરિસ્થિતિ","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"સ્રોત પર ટેક્સ લાગતો નથી / અલગથી વાર્ષિક ટેક્સનો ઉપયોગ કરો","Taxed at source":"સ્રોત પર કર","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"તમારા પગારપત્રક દસ્તાવેજો (CHF)માંથી વાર્ષિક કપાત","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"કર્મચારી પેન્શન કપાત (વાર્ષિક)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"બિન-વ્યવસાયિક અકસ્માત વીમો (વાર્ષિક)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"સ્રોત કર રોકાયેલો (વાર્ષિક)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"અન્ય કર્મચારી કપાત (વાર્ષિક)","Estimate net salary":"નેટ વેતનનો અંદાજ","Reset example":"રીસેટ ઉદાહરણ","2026 salary scenario":"2026 પગારનું દૃશ્ય","Gross salary per year":"દર વર્ષે કુલ પગાર","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"કર્મચારી AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"કર્મચારી બેરોજગારી વીમો","Pension deduction entered":"પેન્શન કપાત દાખલ કરી","Accident insurance entered":"અકસ્માત વીમો દાખલ કર્યો","Source tax entered":"સ્રોત કર દાખલ કર્યો","Other deductions entered":"અન્ય કપાત દાખલ કરી","Total deductions shown":"કુલ કપાત બતાવવામાં આવી છે","Estimated net per year":"દર વર્ષે અંદાજિત નેટ","Average net per salary payment":"પગાર ચુકવણી દીઠ સરેરાશ ચોખ્ખી","Average net per month":"દર મહિને સરેરાશ નેટ","AHV allowance applied":"AHV ભથ્થું લાગુ","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"તમારો કુલ પગાર અને, જો ઉપલબ્ધ હોય, તો વાસ્તવિક વાર્ષિક પગારપત્રક કપાત દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ગણતરી કરેલ દૃશ્ય.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"પગાર, ઉંમર અને કપાતની રકમ તપાસો. કપાત કુલ પગાર કરતાં વધી શકતી નથી.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"તમારા વર્તમાન પગારપત્રક સાથે મેળ ખાતા યોગદાનની સ્થિતિ પસંદ કરો. દરેક ખાસ કેસ માત્ર ઉંમર નક્કી કરતી નથી.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"કેન્ટન માત્ર અહીં સંદર્ભ છે. તે ફેડરલ યોગદાન દરમાં ફેરફાર કરતું નથી અથવા સ્ત્રોત કરની ગણતરી કરતું નથી.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"તમારા એમ્પ્લોયર દ્વારા દર્શાવેલ વાર્ષિક રકમ અથવા પેસ્લિપનો ઉપયોગ કરો. વ્યક્તિગત ટેરિફની ગણતરી કરવા માટે કેન્ટન અને ભાષા પર્યાપ્ત નથી.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"પેન્શન અને અકસ્માતની રકમ યોજના અને એમ્પ્લોયર દ્વારા બદલાય છે. જો તમે તેમને જાણતા નથી, તો તેમને શૂન્ય પર છોડી દો; પરિણામ આંશિક અંદાજ હશે.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"સામાન્ય વાર્ષિક આવકવેરો શામેલ નથી. સ્વિસ કર્મચારીઓ કે જેમના પર સ્ત્રોત પર કર વસૂલવામાં આવતો નથી તેઓ સામાન્ય રીતે વાર્ષિક ટેક્સ રિટર્ન દ્વારા પતાવટ કરે છે, પ્રમાણભૂત પેસ્લિપ વિથ્હોલ્ડિંગ દ્વારા નહીં.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"ફેડરલ પેરોલ અંદાજ તારીખ 2026. તે એક કર્મચારીની નોકરી અને આખું વર્ષ ધારે છે. પાર્ટ-યર નોકરીઓ, બહુવિધ નોકરીદાતાઓ, બોનસ, ક્રોસ-બોર્ડર કેસ, વિશેષ યોગદાન સ્થિતિ અને વ્યક્તિગત રાઉન્ડિંગ પગારપત્રક બદલી શકે છે. બંધનકર્તા રકમ માટે તમારા એમ્પ્લોયર સ્ટેટમેન્ટનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","Official 2026 references:":"સત્તાવાર 2026 સંદર્ભો:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO અને ALV યોગદાન દર","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 વ્યવસાયિક-પેન્શન થ્રેશોલ્ડ","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"શું આ એક ચોક્કસ સ્વિસ ટેક-હોમ-પે ક્વોટ છે?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"નં. તે વૈધાનિક રાષ્ટ્રવ્યાપી કર્મચારી યોગદાનનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે અને તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે વાર્ષિક પગારપત્રક-વિશિષ્ટ રકમને બાદ કરે છે. પરિણામ તે ઇનપુટ્સ જેટલું જ સંપૂર્ણ છે.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"મારે પેન્શન અને અકસ્માત કપાત શા માટે દાખલ કરવી પડશે?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"વ્યવસાયિક પેન્શન યોગદાન પેન્શન ફંડ અને યોજના પર આધારિત છે. બિન-વ્યવસાયિક અકસ્માત પ્રિમીયમ વીમાદાતા, ઉદ્યોગ અને નોકરીદાતાના જોખમ પર આધાર રાખે છે. એકલા કુલ પગાર પરથી અનુમાન લગાવી શકાય તેવી કોઈ એક કર્મચારીની રકમ નથી.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"શું તે મારા કેન્ટોનમાંથી સ્ત્રોત કરની ગણતરી કરી શકે છે?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"નં. સોર્સ-ટેક્સ ટેરિફ વ્યક્તિગત અને પેરોલ વિગતોનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે અને પ્રકાશિત ફાઇલો એમ્પ્લોયર અને પેરોલ-સોફ્ટવેર પ્રદાતાઓ માટે બનાવાયેલ છે. તમારી વર્તમાન પેસ્લિપ અથવા એમ્પ્લોયર અંદાજમાંથી રકમ દાખલ કરો.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"13મો પગાર અહીં કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"એક નિયમિત પગાર ચુકવણીની કુલ રકમ દાખલ કરો અને 13 ચૂકવણી પસંદ કરો. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર પ્રથમ કુલ રકમનું વાર્ષિકીકરણ કરે છે, વાર્ષિક યોગદાન મર્યાદા લાગુ કરે છે અને પરિણામી ચોખ્ખા અંદાજને 13 ચૂકવણીઓમાં વિભાજિત કરે છે.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"શું કેન્ટન AVS/AI/APG કે બેરોજગારીના દરોમાં ફેરફાર કરે છે?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"અહીં વપરાતા ફેડરલ કર્મચારી દર દેશવ્યાપી છે. કેન્ટન-વિશિષ્ટ સ્ત્રોત કર અને અન્ય એમ્પ્લોયર અથવા પ્લાન કપાતની ગણતરી આપમેળે કરવામાં આવતી નથી.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"એમ્પ્લોયર ફેડરલ યોગદાન અલગથી બતાવવામાં આવે છે (તમારા નેટમાંથી કપાત કરેલ નથી)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"એમ્પ્લોયર AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"એમ્પ્લોયર બેરોજગારી વીમો","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"ફક્ત ફેડરલ વૈધાનિક દરો. એમ્પ્લોયર પેન્શન, અકસ્માત વીમો, કુટુંબ ભથ્થું ભંડોળ અને કેન્ટન-વિશિષ્ટ યોગદાનનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી."},"nb":{"Swiss Net Salary Scenario Calculator":"Sveitsisk nettolønnsscenariokalkulator","Swiss Salary Calculator 2026 — Gross to Net Pay Scenario":"Sveitsisk lønnskalkulator 2026 — Brutto til nettolønnsscenario","Estimate Swiss employee payroll deductions for 2026. See federal AHV/IV/EO and unemployment contributions, then enter your actual pension, accident insurance and source-tax amounts for a useful 12- or 13-pay scenario.":"Beregn fradrag for sveitsiske ansattes lønn for 2026. Se føderale AHV/IV/EO og arbeidsledighetsavgifter, og skriv deretter inn faktiske beløp for pensjon, ulykkesforsikring og kildeskatt for et nyttig 12- eller 13-lønnsscenario.","Build a practical 2026 Swiss payslip scenario. The calculator estimates nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the pension, accident insurance, withholding tax and other deductions you enter from your own payroll documents.":"Bygg et praktisk 2026 sveitsisk lønnsslippscenario. Kalkulatoren beregner landsdekkende arbeidstakeravgifter og trekker fra pensjon, ulykkesforsikring, forskuddstrekk og andre trekk du fører fra egne lønnsdokumenter.","The federal rates are the same across cantons, but your pension plan, non-occupational accident premium and source tax depend on your plan, employer and personal case. Enter those annual amounts from a payslip or current employer estimate. Canton and tax status are shown for context; this tool does not reconstruct cantonal source-tax tables or annual income tax.":"De føderale satsene er de samme på tvers av kantoner, men din pensjonsplan, ikke-yrkesulykkespremie og kildeskatt avhenger av planen din, arbeidsgiver og personlig sak. Angi disse årlige beløpene fra en lønnsslipp eller gjeldende arbeidsgiverestimat. Kanton og skattestatus vises for kontekst; dette verktøyet rekonstruerer ikke kantonale kildeskattetabeller eller årlig inntektsskatt.","For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.":"For CHF 8 000 per lønnsutbetaling og 13 utbetalinger er brutto CHF 104 000 per år. Føderale ansattes bidrag beregnes ut fra årslønnen; legge inn årsplan og skattefradrag for å estimere nettoscenarioet.","Gross for one regular salary payment (CHF)":"Brutto for én vanlig lønnsutbetaling (CHF)","Salary payments per year":"Lønnsutbetalinger per år","12 payments":"12 betalinger","13 payments, including 13th salary":"13 betalinger, inkludert 13. lønn","Age in years":"Alder i år","Contribution situation":"Bidragssituasjon","Employee contributions apply":"Ansattes bidrag gjelder","Not yet subject to employee contributions":"Foreløpig ikke underlagt ansattes bidrag","Working after AHV reference age":"Fungerer etter AHV-referansealder","Apply the CHF 1,400 monthly AHV allowance":"Bruk den månedlige AHV-godtgjørelsen på CHF 1400","Canton for your payroll context":"Canton for din lønnssammenheng","Tax-at-source situation":"Kildeskatt-situasjon","Not taxed at source / use annual tax separately":"Beskattes ikke ved kilden / bruk årlig avgift separat","Taxed at source":"Kildeskattes","Annual deductions from your payroll documents (CHF)":"Årlige trekk fra lønnsdokumentene dine (CHF)","Employee pension deduction (annual)":"Pensjonsfradrag for ansatte (årlig)","Non-occupational accident insurance (annual)":"Ikke-yrkesulykkesforsikring (årlig)","Source tax withheld (annual)":"Kildeskatt tilbakeholdt (årlig)","Other employee deductions (annual)":"Andre ansattefradrag (årlig)","Estimate net salary":"Estimer nettolønn","Reset example":"Tilbakestill eksempel","2026 salary scenario":"2026 lønnsscenario","Gross salary per year":"Bruttolønn per år","Employee AHV/IV/EO":"Ansatt AHV/IV/EO","Employee unemployment insurance":"Arbeidsledighetsforsikring for ansatte","Pension deduction entered":"Pensjonsfradrag er lagt inn","Accident insurance entered":"Ulykkesforsikring inngått","Source tax entered":"Kildeavgift angitt","Other deductions entered":"Andre fradrag lagt inn","Total deductions shown":"Totale fradrag vist","Estimated net per year":"Estimert netto per år","Average net per salary payment":"Gjennomsnittlig netto per lønnsutbetaling","Average net per month":"Gjennomsnittlig netto per måned","AHV allowance applied":"AHV-godtgjørelse er påført","Enter your gross salary and, if available, actual annual payroll deductions.":"Skriv inn din bruttolønn og, hvis tilgjengelig, faktiske årlige lønnstrekk.","Scenario calculated in your browser.":"Scenario beregnet i nettleseren din.","Check the salary, age and deduction amounts. Deductions cannot exceed gross salary.":"Sjekk lønn, alder og trekkbeløp. Trekk kan ikke overstige bruttolønn.","Choose the contribution situation that matches your current payroll. Age alone does not determine every special case.":"Velg bidragssituasjonen som samsvarer med din nåværende lønnsliste. Alder alene bestemmer ikke alle spesielle tilfeller.","Canton is context only here. It does not change the federal contribution rates or calculate source tax.":"Canton er kun kontekst her. Det endrer ikke de føderale bidragssatsene eller beregner kildeskatt.","Use the annual amount shown by your employer or payslip. A canton and language are not enough to calculate an individual tariff.":"Bruk det årlige beløpet som vises av din arbeidsgiver eller lønnsslipp. En kanton og et språk er ikke nok til å beregne en individuell tariff.","Pension and accident amounts vary by plan and employer. If you do not know them, leave them at zero; the result will be a partial estimate.":"Pensjons- og ulykkesbeløp varierer etter plan og arbeidsgiver. Hvis du ikke kjenner dem, la dem stå på null; resultatet vil være et delvis estimat.","Ordinary annual income tax is not included. Swiss employees who are not taxed at source generally settle it through an annual tax return, not a standard payslip withholding.":"Vanlig årlig inntektsskatt er ikke inkludert. Sveitsiske arbeidstakere som ikke er kildebeskattet, avregner vanligvis det gjennom en årlig selvangivelse, ikke en standard lønnsslipptrekk.","Federal payroll estimate dated 2026. It assumes one employee job and a full year. Part-year jobs, multiple employers, bonuses, cross-border cases, special contribution status and individual rounding can change payroll. Use your employer statement for the binding amount.":"Federal lønnsestimat datert 2026. Det forutsetter én ansattjobb og et helt år. Delårsjobber, flere arbeidsgivere, bonuser, grenseoverskridende saker, særskilt bidragsstatus og individuell avrunding kan endre lønn. Bruk din arbeidsgiveroppgave for det bindende beløpet.","Official 2026 references:":"Offisielle 2026-referanser:","AHV/IV/EO and ALV contribution rates":"AHV/IV/EO og ALV bidragssatser","2026 occupational-pension thresholds":"2026 tjenestepensjonsgrenser","Is this an exact Swiss take-home-pay quote?":"Er dette et eksakt sveitsisk take-home-pay-tilbud?","No. It estimates statutory nationwide employee contributions and subtracts the annual payroll-specific amounts you enter. The result is only as complete as those inputs.":"Nei. Den estimerer lovpålagte landsdekkende ansattes bidrag og trekker fra de årlige lønnsspesifikke beløpene du legger inn. Resultatet er bare så komplett som disse inngangene.","Why do I have to enter pension and accident deductions?":"Hvorfor må jeg føre pensjons- og ulykkesfradrag?","Occupational pension contributions depend on the pension fund and plan. Non-occupational accident premiums depend on the insurer, industry and employer risk. There is no single employee amount that can be inferred from gross salary alone.":"Tjenestepensjonsinnskudd avhenger av pensjonsfond og ordning. Ikke-yrkesulykkespremier avhenger av forsikringsgiver, bransje- og arbeidsgiverrisiko. Det er ikke et enkelt ansattbeløp som kan utledes av bruttolønn alene.","Can it calculate source tax from my canton?":"Kan den beregne kildeskatt fra kantonen min?","No. Source-tax tariffs use personal and payroll details and the published files are intended for employers and payroll-software providers. Enter the amount from your current payslip or employer estimate.":"Nei. Kildeskattetariffer bruker personlige opplysninger og lønnsdetaljer, og de publiserte filene er beregnet på arbeidsgivere og leverandører av lønnsprogramvare. Angi beløpet fra gjeldende lønnsslipp eller arbeidsgiveranslag.","How does the 13th salary work here?":"Hvordan fungerer den 13. lønnen her?","Enter the gross amount of one regular salary payment and choose 13 payments. The calculator annualizes the gross amount first, applies annual contribution limits, and divides the resulting net estimate across the 13 payments.":"Skriv inn bruttobeløpet for én vanlig lønnsutbetaling og velg 13 utbetalinger. Kalkulatoren beregner først bruttobeløpet på årsbasis, bruker årlige bidragsgrenser og deler det resulterende nettoestimatet på de 13 utbetalingene.","Does the canton change AVS/AI/APG or unemployment rates?":"Endres kantonen AVS/AI/APG eller arbeidsledighet?","The federal employee rates used here are nationwide. Canton-specific source tax and other employer or plan deductions are not calculated automatically.":"De føderale ansattesatsene som brukes her er landsdekkende. Kantonspesifikk kildeskatt og andre arbeidsgiver- eller planfradrag beregnes ikke automatisk.","Employer federal contributions shown separately (not deducted from your net)":"Federale arbeidsgiveravgifter vist separat (ikke trukket fra nettoen din)","Employer AHV/IV/EO":"Arbeidsgiver AHV/IV/EO","Employer unemployment insurance":"Arbeidsløshetsforsikring","Federal statutory rates only. Employer pension, accident insurance, family allowance fund and canton-specific contributions are not included.":"Bare føderale lovbestemte priser. Arbeidsgiverpensjon, ulykkesforsikring, familiepengefond og kantonspesifikke bidrag er ikke inkludert."}});
